1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Mover: Thank you very much! I'm heading out now!

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Kashou: ... Phew, this should be most of the boxes then.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,000
*I wiped the sweat off my forehead with my arm...*

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,000
*... as the moving truck disappeared from view.*

5
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:17,000
*Although it was early April and only the beginning of spring...*

6
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:21,000
*... today's weather was quite nice. It was even a bit hot.*

7
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Kashou: Well, it's a good day for a new start.

8
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:30,000
*I turned my head to look at the empty bakery which didn't even have any signage yet.*

9
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:36,000
*The brand-new exterior wall had a Western look with a predominantly white and brown motif.*

10
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:40,000
*There was also a large window which let lots of sunlight in.*

11
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:46,000
*And finally, there were the words that displayed the name of the bakery: "La Soleil".*

12
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:52,000
*Instead of the proper French article, "Le", it was "La Soleil", meaning "The Sun".*

13
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:56,000
*This was a nod towards the name of the shop of someone I admired.*

14
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Kashou: ... Now that I'm on my own, I'll have to do my best.

15
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:02,000
*I softly murmured to myself.*

16
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:05,000
*From here on out, no one would tell me what to do.*

17
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:13,000
*I was going to start completely anew despite the stature of my family's name and everything that had happened up until now.*

18
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:18,000
*I alone would decide my path and take responsibility for what I do.*

19
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:23,000
*In exchange for that freedom, I can't blame anyone else for what happens.*

20
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:24,000
*Still...*

21
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:26,000
*Although I was a bit worried...*

22
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:30,000
*... the thought of what lay ahead made me break into a smile.*

23
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:31,000
Kashou: ... All right.

24
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:35,000
Kashou: In any case, I'd better get all these things cleaned up.

25
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:38,000
*I took a deep breath and got my spirits back up.*

26
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:41,000
*I stepped into the new-smelling bakery.*

27
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:44,000
Kashou: ... Hmm? What's with this big box...?

28
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:47,000
*In front of me was a large box I didn't recognize.*

29
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:49,000
*In fact, there were two of them.*

30
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:51,000
*"Fragile!" "Delicate!"*

31
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:56,000
*"Absolutely this side up!" "If thrown, your company will be in trouble!"*

32
00:01:56,000 --> 00:02:00,000
*The warnings were going overboard. They were getting annoying.*

33
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:06,000
Kashou: Even if these are baking supplies, I don't remember buying anything quite like this...

34
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:11,000
*First off, they were boxes that looked like they came from my house.*

35
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:16,000
*If these were for the bakery, there's no way I wouldn't remember buying them.*

36
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:19,000
*There were no tags from the moving company either.*

37
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:22,000
*All there was were those warning labels.*

38
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:26,000
Kashou: ... Well, I'll know for sure once I open the--

39
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:27,000
Box: Achoo!!

40
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:28,000
Kashou: Huh...?!

41
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:29,000
Box: ......

42
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:30,000
Kashou: ......

43
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:31,000
Box: M-Me~ow...?

44
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:32,000
Kashou: ......

45
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:33,000
Box: ......

46
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:37,000
Kashou: Oh, it's just a cat, huh? Just a troublesome cat. Geez.

47
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:41,000
Box: Phew... thank goodness. Looks like that fooled him...

48
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:45,000
Box: That was close... Chocola'd better be careful, meow...

49
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:49,000
Kashou: Like that would fool me! What are you doing, Chocola?!

50
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:53,000
Chocola: Eheheh... uhm, l-long time no see... right, Master...?

51
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:57,000
Kashou: We just saw each other at home yesterday, you know.

52
00:02:57,000 --> 00:03:01,000
Chocola: Well, uhm... that is true, Chocola guesses... Ahaha...

53
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:06,000
Chocola: Ah, more importantly than that, listen up! Those movers were really mean!

54
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:09,000
Chocola: So they were picking up Chocola, right?!

55
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:13,000
Chocola: And they said "This box is heavy, so be careful with it!"

56
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:18,000
Chocola: Chocola wanted to hiss at them all of a sudden. Chocola really did!

57
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:25,000
Chocola: Chocola did her best to control her temper, but Chocola was fuming, you know! Absolutely fuming!

58
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:29,000
Kashou: Well, compared to the rest of my things, you are heavy...

59
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:31,000
*She ignored what I said.*

60
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:33,000
*Chocola puffed out her cheeks.*

61
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:36,000
*You could say that she was always happy-go-lucky.*

62
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:41,000
*Or rather she preoccupied herself with only what was in front of her.*

63
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:45,000
*... Well, I guess that was how you'd describe Chocola.*

64
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:50,000
Kashou: While I was getting ready to move, I did wonder why I didn't see you--

65
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:51,000
Box2: Achee!!

66
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:52,000
Box2: Hmmm...

67
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:53,000
Kashou: ... Hey.

68
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:55,000
Vanilla: Long time no see, Master.

69
00:03:55,000 --> 00:04:00,000
Vanilla: My nose was itchy because the inside of the moving truck was dusty.

70
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:02,000
Kashou: Why is Vanilla here too...

71
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:05,000
Vanilla: Wherever Chocola is, I am too.

72
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:09,000
Vanilla: Besides, catgirls don't dislike tight spaces.

73
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:15,000
Vanilla: Also, they said "This box is heavy, so be careful with it" in regards to me too.

74
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:18,000
Vanilla: So I was also mad. Just steaming!

75
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:19,000
Kashou: Again, huh?

76
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:23,000
Kashou: In any case, Chocola, Vanilla, get out of there.

77
00:04:23,000 --> 00:04:28,000
*I was at my wits' end with the large boxes that had suddenly shown up.*

78
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:32,000
*Anyhow, Chocola and Vanilla got out of their boxes.*

79
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:35,000
Kashou: ... Why is no one picking up the phone?

80
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:38,000
Kashou: Just what is Shigure doing...?

81
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:41,000
*I hung up after trying to call my little sister.*

82
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:49,000
*There was no way that Chocola and Vanilla could've gotten mixed in with the rest of the boxes in the first place.*

83
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:52,000
*On the outside, catgirls look almost like humans.*

84
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:56,000
*They can understand words and can talk just like us.*

85
00:04:56,000 --> 00:05:00,000
*But more than humans, catgirls were closer to normal cats.*

86
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:04,000
*After all, catgirls had ears and tails just like cats do.*

87
00:05:04,000 --> 00:05:10,000
*They were genetically modified humanoid cats that were commonly referred to as "catgirls."*

88
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:13,000
*These days, catgirls fit into society...*

89
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:16,000
*... as pets in families or partners to humans.*

90
00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:20,000
*My little sister really loves to dote on catgirls...*

91
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:24,000
*... so our family has six including Chocola and Vanilla.*

92
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:29,000
*In any case, they couldn't have mailed themselves all on their own.*

93
00:05:29,000 --> 00:05:34,000
*Mailing living things through the post would be impossible, for one thing.*

94
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:38,000
*There's no way my parents would have helped with this either.*

95
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:42,000
*Thus I could only guess that this was somehow Shigure's doing...*

96
00:05:42,000 --> 00:05:46,000
Kashou: ... I see, so Shigure was an accomplice then.

97
00:05:46,000 --> 00:05:49,000
Chocola: Meow~! This is a really pretty home~ ♪

98
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:54,000
Chocola: Chocola really likes the smell of mew bedding and furniture~ ♪

99
00:05:54,000 --> 00:05:58,000
Vanilla: It's bigger than it looks. Perfect for Master's abilities.

100
00:05:58,000 --> 00:06:03,000
Chocola: Vanilla, over here! Let's take a look at that room! Time to explore!

101
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:09,000
Vanilla: From where it is, I suspect that it is a bedroom. Master's new bed must be there.

102
00:06:09,000 --> 00:06:14,000
Chocola: Meow! We can't miss that! Let's go snuggle in it! Snuggle time!

103
00:06:14,000 --> 00:06:17,000
Vanilla: Snuggling acknowledged. That is fine by me.

104
00:06:17,000 --> 00:06:20,000
Vanilla: With that decided, let's go~!

105
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:24,000
Kashou: Don't get out of control and hurt yourselves!

106
00:06:24,000 --> 00:06:25,000
Chocola: Okay~! ♪

107
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:26,000
Vanilla: Okay~!

108
00:06:26,000 --> 00:06:31,000
*Without any ill intentions, the two catgirls were off and running.*

109
00:06:31,000 --> 00:06:35,000
*Well, the bakery did have living quarters on the second floor...*

110
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:39,000
*... so I wasn't worried about them causing a ruckus around here.*

111
00:06:39,000 --> 00:06:43,000
*Of course, they aren't young catgirls anymore either...*

112
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:48,000
*... so I shouldn't have to worry about them getting out of control too much.*

113
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:50,000
Kashou: ... Well, besides that...

114
00:06:50,000 --> 00:06:53,000
*I looked up an address in my phone's address book.*

115
00:06:53,000 --> 00:06:54,000
**Minaduki Residence**

116
00:06:54,000 --> 00:07:00,000
Kashou: ... Well, I already left Shigure a message, so she should call me back later.

117
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:05,000
*Without pressing the call button, I put my cell phone back in my pocket.*

118
00:07:05,000 --> 00:07:08,000
*I had moved out without saying anything...*

119
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:13,000
*... so for her to call me back within the day seemed a bit stupid.*

120
00:07:13,000 --> 00:07:18,000
*Well, it wasn't really an issue I needed to bring up right this moment.*

121
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:21,000
*I should hear from Shigure soon anyhow.*

122
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:24,000
Chocola: We've finished snuggling on Master's bed!

123
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:28,000
Vanilla: The new bed is very fluffy. It gets a passing score.

124
00:07:28,000 --> 00:07:30,000
Kashou: Good work, you two.

125
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:34,000
Kashou: Gosh, both of you have major bed-head. Sheesh!

126
00:07:34,000 --> 00:07:39,000
Chocola: Fuwah~ Chocola loves it when Master rubs her head~ ♪ It feels good~ ♪

127
00:07:39,000 --> 00:07:42,000
Vanilla: I have no objections to this. More.

128
00:07:42,000 --> 00:07:44,000
*I tidied up their hair with a comb.*

129
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:47,000
*Their soft hair felt nice as always.*

130
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:52,000
*I lightly bonked them both on the head while they had their eyes closed.*

131
00:07:52,000 --> 00:07:57,000
Kashou: ... Now then, why were the two of you hiding among my moving boxes?

132
00:07:57,000 --> 00:08:02,000
Chocola: ... You said you wouldn't bring us with you so we had no choice.

133
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:06,000
Vanilla: Chocola said she was going, so I tagged along.

134
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:10,000
Kashou: You had no choice? Just tagged along? You two...

135
00:08:10,000 --> 00:08:13,000
*Well, I figured that had to be the reason, but...*

136
00:08:13,000 --> 00:08:17,000
*Anyhow, I recomposed myself and looked at the two of them again.*

137
00:08:17,000 --> 00:08:19,000
Kashou: Listen up, okay?

138
00:08:19,000 --> 00:08:24,000
Kashou: How many times have I told you two? This isn't a vacation or a picnic.

139
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:29,000
Kashou: I moved out because I have no intention of going back there.

140
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:37,000
Kashou: If you were at home, you wouldn't have anything to worry about. Shigure and the other catgirls are there too.

141
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:40,000
Kashou: It would be better if you two just--

142
00:08:40,000 --> 00:08:43,000
Chocola: Th-That's not it! It's just that, uhmm...!

143
00:08:43,000 --> 00:08:48,000
Chocola: Chocola's stomach is just being rebellious!! So that's not it, really!!

144
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:54,000
Vanilla: Master moved out really early in the morning, so there was no time to eat breakfast.

145
00:08:54,000 --> 00:08:58,000
Vanilla: The sound of Chocola's stomach rumbling is cute anyways.

146
00:08:58,000 --> 00:09:05,000
*While listening to those silly excuses, I glanced at the clock and saw that it was already past 1 o'clock.*

147
00:09:05,000 --> 00:09:10,000
*Now that I thought about it, I haven't eaten anything since this morning either.*

148
00:09:10,000 --> 00:09:13,000
Kashou: Well... why don't we have lunch first then?

149
00:09:13,000 --> 00:09:16,000
Chocola: Yay~! Food! Chocola loves Master!

150
00:09:16,000 --> 00:09:20,000
Vanilla: Understanding as ever, Master. We are in your debt.

151
00:09:20,000 --> 00:09:23,000
*These two were as easygoing as always.*

152
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:25,000
Chocola: Shopping~ Shopping~ ♪

153
00:09:25,000 --> 00:09:28,000
Chocola: Shopping together with Master~ Meow~ ♪

154
00:09:28,000 --> 00:09:32,000
Vanilla: Lately, Master hasn't taken us shopping with him at all...

155
00:09:32,000 --> 00:09:37,000
Vanilla: ... So that's why Chocola is in such a good mood right now. Meow~

156
00:09:37,000 --> 00:09:40,000
Chocola: You're really happy too, right Vanilla~? ♪

157
00:09:40,000 --> 00:09:44,000
Chocola: Come on, Chocola is going to squish your cheeks~

158
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:47,000
Vanilla: Fueh! Chocola, that tickles...!

159
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:49,000
Vanilla: Myah, myahn... Don't~ ♪

160
00:09:49,000 --> 00:09:55,000
Kashou: You'll bother those around us, so try not to get too carried away, you two.

161
00:09:55,000 --> 00:10:01,000
*Since the refrigerator was empty, we headed to the nearby shopping district to buy groceries.*

162
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:06,000
*From brand-name clothing stores to supermarkets, there was an array of stores.*

163
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:10,000
*There was even a drug store with daily necessities amongst them.*

164
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:13,000
**If you come here, we have just about everything.**

165
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:18,000
*That was how the real estate agent had recommended this place to me.*

166
00:10:18,000 --> 00:10:22,000
Kashou: Wait, don't you two go shopping with Shigure often?

167
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:28,000
Chocola: Uuuu~ Shopping with Shigure-chan and shopping with Master are totally different!

168
00:10:28,000 --> 00:10:35,000
Vanilla: Sigh~ It's troubling that Master doesn't have the proper mindset of a master. Chocola pities you.

169
00:10:35,000 --> 00:10:38,000
Kashou: Hey, first of all, Shigure is your master.

170
00:10:38,000 --> 00:10:43,000
Chocola: Shigure-chan is our master too, but Shigure-chan is Shigure-chan!

171
00:10:43,000 --> 00:10:45,000
Chocola: That's why Master is Master!

172
00:10:45,000 --> 00:10:49,000
Chocola: It's totally different, right? Right? Right?

173
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:58,000
Vanilla: I don't understand your reasoning, but I can tell you're very enthusiastic. Just as expected of Chocola. Clap clap clap~

174
00:10:58,000 --> 00:11:03,000
Kashou: ... Never mind then. Anyhow, keep it down inside the store, okay?

175
00:11:03,000 --> 00:11:05,000
*I parted from the two of them.*

176
00:11:05,000 --> 00:11:07,000
*I decided to hurry on ahead.*

177
00:11:07,000 --> 00:11:11,000
Chocola: Master! Shigure-chan said this is a good shampoo!

178
00:11:11,000 --> 00:11:16,000
Vanilla: It makes your hair all smooth and smells really sweet and nice too!

179
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:19,000
Kashou: But that's stuff for you two to use.

180
00:11:19,000 --> 00:11:23,000
Kashou: I don't need it, so put it down and come over here.

181
00:11:23,000 --> 00:11:26,000
Chocola: Fuehh...! Master, that's mean...!

182
00:11:26,000 --> 00:11:30,000
Chocola: It's so mean, it feels like you hit me, fuehhh...!!

183
00:11:30,000 --> 00:11:35,000
Vanilla: Now now, don't cry, Chocola. Master is an awful person, isn't he?

184
00:11:35,000 --> 00:11:40,000
Kashou: Don't just say that and then toss that in the basket all nonchalantly.

185
00:11:40,000 --> 00:11:42,000
Vanilla: Tch, his defense is strong.

186
00:11:42,000 --> 00:11:48,000
*I had to be on guard or they would sneak something in when I wasn't paying attention.*

187
00:11:48,000 --> 00:11:54,000
*They even tried to grab another basket for themselves at the supermarket earlier.*

188
00:11:54,000 --> 00:12:00,000
*It was apparent to me how dreadful an idea it was when they decided to come along.*

189
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:02,000
Chocola: Eheheh~ ♪ Sorry, Master!

190
00:12:02,000 --> 00:12:09,000
Chocola: It's been a long time since Chocola went shopping with Master, so Chocola got really excited.

191
00:12:09,000 --> 00:12:12,000
Vanilla: Catgirls are honest, so it can't be helped.

192
00:12:12,000 --> 00:12:16,000
Vanilla: It would be nice if Master was honest too. Slip~

193
00:12:16,000 --> 00:12:25,000
Kashou: It has nothing to do with being honest. I'm telling you, don't just put the shampoo in the basket like that. Put it back.

194
00:12:25,000 --> 00:12:27,000
Chocola: We repent! Please, Master!

195
00:12:27,000 --> 00:12:32,000
Chocola: We beg of you! We beg of you to buy shampoo for Chocola and Vanilla!

196
00:12:32,000 --> 00:12:39,000
Vanilla: It's sad to return to a home that doesn't have shampoo. Catgirls don't like having oily hair.

197
00:12:39,000 --> 00:12:45,000
Female Customer A: He won't even buy shampoo for those catgirls? The poor things...

198
00:12:45,000 --> 00:12:50,000
Female Customer B: I wonder if we should report him for catgirl abuse...

199
00:12:50,000 --> 00:12:55,000
Kashou: Don't put on some act to confuse the customers around us! Seriously!

200
00:12:55,000 --> 00:12:57,000
*We'd only just moved here...*

201
00:12:57,000 --> 00:13:02,000
*... but suddenly, we already had disapproving glares directed at us.*

202
00:13:02,000 --> 00:13:05,000
Chocola: Going out with Master is lots of fun! ♪

203
00:13:05,000 --> 00:13:09,000
Chocola: It makes me want to start purring! Meow meow~ ♪

204
00:13:09,000 --> 00:13:14,000
Vanilla: He didn't buy us anything though. Master is such a cheapskate.

205
00:13:14,000 --> 00:13:16,000
Kashou: I'm not a cheapskate.

206
00:13:16,000 --> 00:13:19,000
Kashou: Besides, I nearly got reported.

207
00:13:19,000 --> 00:13:23,000
*After that, it was the same sort of exchange at the supermarket.*

208
00:13:23,000 --> 00:13:30,000
*The whole thing was so awkward that I don't think I can visit that shopping district for a while.*

209
00:13:30,000 --> 00:13:35,000
*... Well, I guess you could say that was the cute side of catgirls.*

210
00:13:35,000 --> 00:13:38,000
Vanilla: Hmm? Sniff sniff, sniff sniff...

211
00:13:38,000 --> 00:13:41,000
Vanilla: Something smells really nice over there.

212
00:13:41,000 --> 00:13:45,000
Chocola: You're right! Something smells really good, Master!

213
00:13:45,000 --> 00:13:48,000
Kashou: It definitely does. What is this smell...

214
00:13:48,000 --> 00:13:50,000
*I turned towards the source of it.*

215
00:13:50,000 --> 00:13:52,000
Food Stand Cat: Welcome~!

216
00:13:52,000 --> 00:13:57,000
Food Stand Cat: Would you like to try some delicious, fresh takoyaki~?

217
00:13:57,000 --> 00:14:04,000
Food Stand Cat: Would you like to try some piping hot takoyaki with lots of bonito flakes on top~?

218
00:14:04,000 --> 00:14:10,000
Chocola: Wah, it's a takoyaki shop run by a catgirl! That's pretty rare, huh, Master?!

219
00:14:10,000 --> 00:14:13,000
Vanilla: Indeed. That little catgirl is cute.

220
00:14:13,000 --> 00:14:16,000
*It was a catgirl younger than Chocola and Vanilla.*

221
00:14:16,000 --> 00:14:20,000
*She waved her tiny hands as she politely drew customers in.*

222
00:14:20,000 --> 00:14:25,000
*In human terms, she looked like she was about twelve or thirteen years old.*

223
00:14:25,000 --> 00:14:28,000
*In cat years, she was about six months old.*

224
00:14:28,000 --> 00:14:31,000
*The young catgirl noticed us and ran over.*

225
00:14:31,000 --> 00:14:36,000
Food Stand Cat: It's an older sister catgirl! Just like me, huh? Meow meow♪

226
00:14:36,000 --> 00:14:40,000
Chocola: Mmhmm, Chocola is the same as you~♪ Meow meow! ♪

227
00:14:40,000 --> 00:14:44,000
Chocola: Chocola is gonna rub your neck~ ♪ Rub rub~ ♪

228
00:14:44,000 --> 00:14:49,000
Vanilla: Young catgirls are so innocent and super cute. They're the best.

229
00:14:49,000 --> 00:14:51,000
Vanilla: I'll pat your head. Pat pat.

230
00:14:51,000 --> 00:14:55,000
Food Stand Owner: I'm sorry that my catgirl is troubling you...

231
00:14:55,000 --> 00:14:59,000
Food Stand Owner: Oh, are you the owner of those catgirls?

232
00:14:59,000 --> 00:15:02,000
*The owner of the food stand greeted us.*

233
00:15:02,000 --> 00:15:03,000
Kashou: Yes, I am...

234
00:15:03,000 --> 00:15:07,000
Kashou: Ah well, to be more exact, my little sister is their owner.

235
00:15:07,000 --> 00:15:11,000
Food Stand Owner: They're cute and smart catgirls, aren't they?

236
00:15:11,000 --> 00:15:15,000
Food Stand Owner: They're so courteous and well-spoken, too.

237
00:15:15,000 --> 00:15:19,000
Food Stand Owner: Mine is still only seven months old.

238
00:15:19,000 --> 00:15:25,000
Food Stand Owner: Maybe when she's a bit older, she'll be a fine catgirl like these two.

239
00:15:25,000 --> 00:15:32,000
*The food stand owner had a wry smile on her face like she was talking about a mischievous child of hers.*

240
00:15:32,000 --> 00:15:39,000
*At a glance, it was understandable that seeing a young catgirl made it easy to overlook these things.*

241
00:15:39,000 --> 00:15:44,000
Kashou: Mine were originally strays, so I don't actually know how old they are.

242
00:15:44,000 --> 00:15:50,000
Kashou: The veterinarian said that they were twins and were now about 9 months old.

243
00:15:50,000 --> 00:15:54,000
Kashou: My little sister is actually quite the education freak.

244
00:15:54,000 --> 00:15:58,000
Kashou: Back then they were really noisy, but it was all worth it.

245
00:15:58,000 --> 00:16:01,000
Chocola: Shigure-chan really taught us well!

246
00:16:01,000 --> 00:16:06,000
Chocola: She said we'd grow up to be good catgirls if we listened to her!

247
00:16:06,000 --> 00:16:11,000
Vanilla: Shigure was tough on us. But thanks to her, we learned a lot.

248
00:16:11,000 --> 00:16:15,000
Food Stand Owner: Really? What a wonderful owner you have.

249
00:16:15,000 --> 00:16:17,000
Chocola: Ah, but Master is Master!

250
00:16:17,000 --> 00:16:21,000
Chocola: And Shigure-chan is Shigure-chan! Right, Master?

251
00:16:21,000 --> 00:16:25,000
Vanilla: In other words, Shigure is an important friend.

252
00:16:25,000 --> 00:16:30,000
Vanilla: And when we say 'Master,' we are referring to Master over here.

253
00:16:30,000 --> 00:16:35,000
Food Stand Owner: Ahaha! You're a very well-loved "master," aren't you?

254
00:16:35,000 --> 00:16:37,000
Kashou: Well, I am grateful.

255
00:16:37,000 --> 00:16:40,000
*She lightly nudged me with her elbow.*

256
00:16:40,000 --> 00:16:43,000
*I responded with an embarrassed, forced smile.*

257
00:16:43,000 --> 00:16:47,000
*... Hearing this kind of stuff in public sure was embarrassing.*

258
00:16:47,000 --> 00:16:51,000
Chocola: Little catgirl, why don't you look up a bit?

259
00:16:51,000 --> 00:16:53,000
Food Stand Cat: Up? Like this?

260
00:16:53,000 --> 00:16:55,000
Vanilla: An opening. Rub rub rub~ ♪

261
00:16:55,000 --> 00:16:57,000
Food Stand Cat: Rub rub rub~♪

262
00:16:57,000 --> 00:17:00,000
*The three of them were getting along very well.*

263
00:17:00,000 --> 00:17:04,000
*The food stand owner looked fondly at them from nearby.*

264
00:17:04,000 --> 00:17:07,000
Food Stand Owner: ... My catgirl was a stray, too.

265
00:17:07,000 --> 00:17:14,000
Food Stand Owner: On a day just like this while I was selling takoyaki, she came up to me with an empty stomach.

266
00:17:14,000 --> 00:17:19,000
Food Stand Owner: I took her home and she's been like a daughter to me.

267
00:17:19,000 --> 00:17:23,000
Food Stand Owner: She's even able to help me with the shop now.

268
00:17:23,000 --> 00:17:27,000
Food Stand Owner: Humanoid cats were all the rage, but...

269
00:17:27,000 --> 00:17:33,000
Food Stand Owner: They're many times more difficult to take care of than regular cats.

270
00:17:33,000 --> 00:17:36,000
*Her words seemed tinged with blame and worry.*

271
00:17:36,000 --> 00:17:38,000
*She grumbled, letting out a sigh.*

272
00:17:38,000 --> 00:17:44,000
*Not that long ago, it wasn't rare to see stray humanoid cats just wandering throughout town.*

273
00:17:44,000 --> 00:17:50,000
*But now, it was more likely for one to see humanoid cats that were well loved by their owners.*

274
00:17:50,000 --> 00:17:54,000
*Since the amount of unfortunate humanoid cats had decreased...*

275
00:17:54,000 --> 00:17:58,000
*...there was more of a balance, and owners were quite elated.*

276
00:17:58,000 --> 00:18:06,000
Food Stand Owner: I really am disgusted with those who don't understand the responsibility involved in owning catgirls...

277
00:18:06,000 --> 00:18:13,000
Food Stand Owner: But then again, if it wasn't for them I'd have never found my cute daughter. Ahaha.

278
00:18:13,000 --> 00:18:15,000
*It was a bright and honest laugh.*

279
00:18:15,000 --> 00:18:17,000
*I nodded in agreement.*

280
00:18:17,000 --> 00:18:19,000
Kashou: ... That is true.

281
00:18:19,000 --> 00:18:23,000
*This must be like how pets find their way back to their owners.*

282
00:18:23,000 --> 00:18:27,000
*I smiled at such an uncharacteristic thought from me.*

283
00:18:27,000 --> 00:18:29,000
Food Stand Cat: Ah, that's right!

284
00:18:29,000 --> 00:18:34,000
Food Stand Cat: Older cat-sisters, would you like to try some takoyaki?

285
00:18:34,000 --> 00:18:40,000
Food Stand Cat: It's piping hot, has a big piece of octopus in it, and is really, really tasty!

286
00:18:40,000 --> 00:18:42,000
Chocola: Really tasty takoyaki...!

287
00:18:42,000 --> 00:18:46,000
Chocola: Auuuu... but we're on our way home to have dinner...

288
00:18:46,000 --> 00:18:50,000
Vanilla: Yes, Master is going to cook for us, so... Sorry...

289
00:18:50,000 --> 00:18:54,000
*Chocola and Vanilla's shoulders drooped downheartedly.*

290
00:18:54,000 --> 00:18:58,000
*As they hung their heads, I rubbed them from behind.*

291
00:18:58,000 --> 00:19:01,000
*I took a look at the little takoyaki seller.*

292
00:19:01,000 --> 00:19:05,000
Kashou: Okay, three orders of takoyaki. Can you do that for me?

293
00:19:05,000 --> 00:19:07,000
Food Stand Cat: Three orders?

294
00:19:07,000 --> 00:19:11,000
*Her large eyes blinked as she tilted her head in confusion.*

295
00:19:11,000 --> 00:19:14,000
Kashou: Yeah. For me, Chocola, and Vanilla.

296
00:19:14,000 --> 00:19:16,000
Kashou: Could you do that for me?

297
00:19:16,000 --> 00:19:19,000
Food Stand Cat: Okay! Three orders, right?

298
00:19:19,000 --> 00:19:23,000
Food Stand Cat: Master, we've got an order! Three takoyaki!

299
00:19:23,000 --> 00:19:25,000
Chocola & Vanilla: Master...!

300
00:19:25,000 --> 00:19:30,000
Kashou: It's going to take time to get home and make food, after all.

301
00:19:30,000 --> 00:19:34,000
Kashou: Besides, I want to try the takoyaki here, too.

302
00:19:34,000 --> 00:19:40,000
Chocola: Okay! Chocola's tummy is making big growly sounds too! Chocola is really happy!

303
00:19:40,000 --> 00:19:42,000
Vanilla: Master, you're so cool...!

304
00:19:42,000 --> 00:19:48,000
Vanilla: Shigure wasn't kidding when she said "a tsundere older brother is a good thing"...!

305
00:19:48,000 --> 00:19:50,000
Kashou: Wait, what does that mean?

306
00:19:50,000 --> 00:19:56,000
Food Stand Owner: Okay! Please choose the topping and flavour you'd like off this menu here.

307
00:19:56,000 --> 00:20:02,000
Food Stand Owner: Since you were so nice to my catgirl, I'll throw it in free of charge~ ♪

308
00:20:02,000 --> 00:20:04,000
Chocola: Wow~! Thank you so much!

309
00:20:04,000 --> 00:20:07,000
Chocola: Chocola likes them with mayonnaise on top!

310
00:20:07,000 --> 00:20:14,000
Vanilla: Thank you so very much for your kindness. Bow~ I'd like mine to be fish roe and cheese flavour.

311
00:20:14,000 --> 00:20:16,000
*My question was completely ignored.*

312
00:20:16,000 --> 00:20:20,000
*... Well, I guess I shouldn't let it bother me, huh.*

313
00:20:20,000 --> 00:20:24,000
*I wondered about that as I looked at Chocola and Vanilla...*

314
00:20:24,000 --> 00:20:28,000
*... happily awaiting their takoyaki in front of the food stand.*

315
00:20:28,000 --> 00:20:31,000
Kashou: ... I still can't get a hold of her.

316
00:20:31,000 --> 00:20:34,000
Kashou: Were there guests over today...?

317
00:20:34,000 --> 00:20:38,000
*When I checked the clock, it was past 10 o'clock already.*

318
00:20:38,000 --> 00:20:44,000
*Since then, I'd tried calling Shigure several times, but couldn't get through to her.*

319
00:20:44,000 --> 00:20:48,000
*And just like that, it had already gotten this late.*

320
00:20:48,000 --> 00:20:52,000
Kashou: ... I've never gone this long without hearing from Shigure.

321
00:20:52,000 --> 00:20:56,000
*I really didn't understand my family's schedule at all...*

322
00:20:56,000 --> 00:20:58,000
Chocola: Master~? Master~?

323
00:20:58,000 --> 00:21:04,000
Chocola: It's been a while since we've bathed together! I'll even wash your back~ ♪

324
00:21:04,000 --> 00:21:09,000
Vanilla: You haven't bathed with us since we've matured. Master, you pervert.

325
00:21:09,000 --> 00:21:14,000
Kashou: You haven't even grown that much. What are you two talking about?

326
00:21:14,000 --> 00:21:17,000
Chocola: Me-Me-Meowhat did you just say?!

327
00:21:17,000 --> 00:21:23,000
Chocola: Shigure-chan said that Chocola and Vanilla have already grown to be elegant cat-ladies!

328
00:21:23,000 --> 00:21:28,000
Vanilla: Those words are sexual harassment. You are trampling on our dignity.

329
00:21:28,000 --> 00:21:32,000
Vanilla: Besides, this is Chocola's identity we are talking about.

330
00:21:32,000 --> 00:21:36,000
Kashou: Vanilla, you're the one changing the subject.

331
00:21:36,000 --> 00:21:42,000
Kashou: In any case, don't worry about the bath. You two need to get ready to go home.

332
00:21:42,000 --> 00:21:44,000
Chocola: Meow? Get ready to go home?

333
00:21:44,000 --> 00:21:47,000
Chocola: But isn't Chocola's home Master's home?

334
00:21:47,000 --> 00:21:50,000
Vanilla: And I belong next to Chocola.

335
00:21:50,000 --> 00:21:54,000
Vanilla: Also, Master is cool. You look strangely handsome.

336
00:21:54,000 --> 00:21:58,000
Kashou: Stop feigning ignorance, you two. Cut that out.

337
00:21:58,000 --> 00:22:02,000
*The two of them looked my way, about to distract me again.*

338
00:22:02,000 --> 00:22:06,000
Kashou: Since Shigure isn't picking up, I'll take you two home.

339
00:22:06,000 --> 00:22:08,000
Kashou: So go get ready to leave.

340
00:22:08,000 --> 00:22:10,000
Chocola & Vanilla: ......

341
00:22:10,000 --> 00:22:15,000
*Chocola and Vanilla turned away from me and cast their gazes downwards.*

342
00:22:15,000 --> 00:22:18,000
*Returning home on the same day I had moved out...*

343
00:22:18,000 --> 00:22:22,000
*... seemed to be such a stupid idea that I did hesitate a bit.*

344
00:22:22,000 --> 00:22:24,000
*There was no other way.*

345
00:22:24,000 --> 00:22:26,000
*Nor was there time for excuses.*

346
00:22:26,000 --> 00:22:32,000
*I looked towards Chocola and Vanilla as they hung their heads in silence and continued on.*

347
00:22:32,000 --> 00:22:36,000
Kashou: Listen up, you two. I'm going to open my bakery.

348
00:22:36,000 --> 00:22:41,000
Kashou: I've got no one to rely on, so I don't know how things will turn out.

349
00:22:41,000 --> 00:22:47,000
Kashou: With all that's going on, I don't know if I can take care of you two. Get it?

350
00:22:47,000 --> 00:22:53,000
Kashou: I mean, it's already going to be difficult enough just looking after mysel--

351
00:22:53,000 --> 00:22:54,000
Chocola: ...... No.

352
00:22:54,000 --> 00:22:57,000
*It was a quiet voice I could barely hear.*

353
00:22:57,000 --> 00:23:00,000
*Chocola said something with her head down.*

354
00:23:00,000 --> 00:23:02,000
Kashou: Hm? What did you say?

355
00:23:02,000 --> 00:23:05,000
*I came closer and asked her to repeat herself.*

356
00:23:05,000 --> 00:23:08,000
Chocola: No way~! Chocola won't go back~!!

357
00:23:08,000 --> 00:23:11,000
Chocola: Chocola hates Master for saying that~!!!

358
00:23:11,000 --> 00:23:14,000
Kashou: Uwah?! Ah wait! Hey, Chocola...?!

359
00:23:14,000 --> 00:23:20,000
Vanilla: I will also make great haste. Or rather, I'll withdraw with the speed of a catgirl.

360
00:23:20,000 --> 00:23:22,000
Kashou: Ah! Wait, stop!

361
00:23:22,000 --> 00:23:25,000
Kashou: Vanilla, why are you running away too?!

362
00:23:25,000 --> 00:23:29,000
Chocola: Come on, come on, Master~! Chocola's over here~

363
00:23:29,000 --> 00:23:32,000
Chocola: Chocola is over here, ahahahah~ ♪

364
00:23:32,000 --> 00:23:37,000
Kashou: It's dangerous, so stop running around! If you fall, you'll get hurt!

365
00:23:37,000 --> 00:23:45,000
Vanilla: It's unnecessary to worry about catgirls like that. Although we're humanoid, catgirls are cats. Dash dash~

366
00:23:45,000 --> 00:23:50,000
Kashou: Maybe so in Chocola's case, but aren't you bad with physical activity?!

367
00:23:50,000 --> 00:23:53,000
Kashou: Come on! I've got you now, Chocola!

368
00:23:53,000 --> 00:23:58,000
Chocola: Myaah! Master, you pervert!! Just where do you think you're grabbing?!

369
00:23:58,000 --> 00:24:02,000
Vanilla: Master is grabbing Chocola's chest with an iron grip.

370
00:24:02,000 --> 00:24:06,000
Kashou: I-I am not!! It's because you two are running around!

371
00:24:06,000 --> 00:24:08,000
Chocola: Meow, an opening!

372
00:24:08,000 --> 00:24:12,000
Kashou: Hey, ah, stop it! You're still going to run?!

373
00:24:12,000 --> 00:24:14,000
Kashou: Geh, I've got you, Vanilla!

374
00:24:14,000 --> 00:24:17,000
Chocola: Tickle tickle tickle tickle~ ♪

375
00:24:17,000 --> 00:24:21,000
Kashou: Wha--! Chocola, stop! Really, sto-- Gwahaha, chocowahah!

376
00:24:21,000 --> 00:24:23,000
Vanilla: Nice assist, Chocola. Go go!

377
00:24:23,000 --> 00:24:26,000
Kashou: Like I said, stop runningggg!!!

378
00:24:26,000 --> 00:24:32,000
*The two of them didn't listen to a word I said as they continued to mess with me.*

379
00:24:32,000 --> 00:24:35,000
*And that was how the first night went.*

380
00:24:35,000 --> 00:24:39,000
Kashou: For now I'll let you stay, but only for tonight...

381
00:24:39,000 --> 00:24:42,000
Kashou: I don't have guest beds or futons, okay?

382
00:24:42,000 --> 00:24:46,000
*While all that was happening, 11 o' clock became midnight.*

383
00:24:46,000 --> 00:24:50,000
*Even if I took them home, everyone was sure to be asleep by now.*

384
00:24:50,000 --> 00:24:55,000
*The one glimmer of hope I had, that Shigure would call me back, didn't happen...*

385
00:24:55,000 --> 00:25:00,000
*... so I decided that taking them home tomorrow was my first priority.*

386
00:25:00,000 --> 00:25:04,000
Chocola: Of course, we'll be sleeping in Master's bed~ ♪

387
00:25:04,000 --> 00:25:07,000
Vanilla: I will also be okay with Master's bed.

388
00:25:07,000 --> 00:25:10,000
*... Cleverly, they had even brought pajamas.*

389
00:25:10,000 --> 00:25:14,000
*Just how much planning went into their schemes, anyway...*

390
00:25:14,000 --> 00:25:18,000
Kashou: Really. If you two sleep there, where will I?

391
00:25:18,000 --> 00:25:24,000
Chocola: What?! You're not going to sleep together with us?! You tell us that this late?!

392
00:25:24,000 --> 00:25:32,000
Vanilla: Master is male, but he doesn't know when to give up. The sleeping arrangements should go Master→ Chocola→ Me.

393
00:25:32,000 --> 00:25:37,000
Chocola: Nyaha~ ♪ Being surrounded by Master and Vanilla makes Chocola happy~ ♪

394
00:25:37,000 --> 00:25:40,000
Kashou: Don't get ahead of yourself, you two.

395
00:25:40,000 --> 00:25:44,000
Kashou: A single bed for three people is too crowded.

396
00:25:44,000 --> 00:25:49,000
Chocola: Since we're the ones that are intruding, we're fine with here, too.

397
00:25:49,000 --> 00:25:53,000
Chocola: We can curl up and sleep like catgirls, after all.

398
00:25:53,000 --> 00:26:00,000
Vanilla: We are very praiseworthy for not asking for luxuries. We're model catgirls. We'll sleep like this then.

399
00:26:00,000 --> 00:26:03,000
*I watched the two of them lie down and curl up...*

400
00:26:03,000 --> 00:26:07,000
*... on the floor of an empty room, without even curtains.*

401
00:26:07,000 --> 00:26:12,000
Kashou: ... That's way too pitiful of a sight to be called praiseworthy.

402
00:26:12,000 --> 00:26:16,000
Chocola: Since you just moved in, you have lots of boxes, right?

403
00:26:16,000 --> 00:26:22,000
Vanilla: Apparently, you can make a warm shelter out of them, so we'll manage somehow.

404
00:26:22,000 --> 00:26:26,000
Kashou: That's something only strange people would say.

405
00:26:26,000 --> 00:26:30,000
*Where did these catgirls get this information from, anyways?*

406
00:26:30,000 --> 00:26:35,000
*Well, they've probably read a lot of books and watched TV in Shigure's room.*

407
00:26:35,000 --> 00:26:41,000
*Chocola isn't good with kanji characters, so she only reads picture books though.*

408
00:26:41,000 --> 00:26:44,000
Kashou: Ahh, whatever. You two go sleep in my bed.

409
00:26:44,000 --> 00:26:48,000
Kashou: It still gets pretty cold at night in April, after all.

410
00:26:48,000 --> 00:26:52,000
Chocola: Where is Master going to sleep then? Next to Chocola?

411
00:26:52,000 --> 00:26:56,000
Kashou: I'm going to sleep on the sofa in the living room.

412
00:26:56,000 --> 00:27:02,000
Kashou: The sofa can fit one person and there's air conditioning in there if I need it.

413
00:27:02,000 --> 00:27:07,000
Chocola: No! If that's the case, then Chocola will sleep on the sofa!

414
00:27:07,000 --> 00:27:11,000
Chocola: Please sleep in the bed with Vanilla, Master!

415
00:27:11,000 --> 00:27:17,000
Vanilla: I'm more relaxed on the sofa. It's better if Chocola and Master use the bed.

416
00:27:17,000 --> 00:27:21,000
*They moved quickly towards me like lions catching their prey.*

417
00:27:21,000 --> 00:27:26,000
*I placed my hands on their heads and spoke in a clear and stern voice.*

418
00:27:26,000 --> 00:27:31,000
Kashou: Listen up. I will sleep on the sofa and you two will sleep in my bed.

419
00:27:31,000 --> 00:27:34,000
Kashou: Those are your Master's orders. Understood?

420
00:27:34,000 --> 00:27:36,000
Chocola: Auuuuh... Master...

421
00:27:36,000 --> 00:27:37,000
Vanilla: Master...

422
00:27:37,000 --> 00:27:39,000
*I said it like that deliberately.*

423
00:27:39,000 --> 00:27:44,000
*The two of them looked as if they wanted to say something, but they hesitated.*

424
00:27:44,000 --> 00:27:47,000
*They lowered their heads apologetically.*

425
00:27:47,000 --> 00:27:49,000
Chocola: ... I'm sorry, Master.

426
00:27:49,000 --> 00:27:51,000
Vanilla: ... Sorry, Master.

427
00:27:51,000 --> 00:27:56,000
*... They mustered out. They looked like they were on the verge of tears.*

428
00:27:56,000 --> 00:28:02,000
*Their obedience had the exact opposite of the effect I expected -- it filled me with guilt.*

429
00:28:02,000 --> 00:28:05,000
*I felt a prickling sensation in my chest.*

430
00:28:05,000 --> 00:28:10,000
*That pain left me as I sighed and rubbed the two of them on the head.*

431
00:28:10,000 --> 00:28:12,000
Kashou: Come on, get going.

432
00:28:12,000 --> 00:28:14,000
Chocola & Vanilla: Okay...

433
00:28:14,000 --> 00:28:18,000
Kashou: Good night. If anything happens, call for me right away.

434
00:28:18,000 --> 00:28:21,000
Chocola: All right. Good night, Master.

435
00:28:21,000 --> 00:28:23,000
Vanilla: Good night, Master.

436
00:28:23,000 --> 00:28:28,000
*I gently rubbed the heads of the two dispirited catgirls once more.*

437
00:28:28,000 --> 00:28:30,000
Kashou: See you in the morning.

438
00:28:30,000 --> 00:28:34,000
*With that said, I turned the lights off in the room.*

439
00:28:34,000 --> 00:28:35,000
Chocola: ... Master.

440
00:28:35,000 --> 00:28:40,000
Chocola: ... Uhm, Chocola is really sorry. Chocola caused you so much trouble...

441
00:28:40,000 --> 00:28:44,000
*Her vanishing voice echoed slightly in the darkened room.*

442
00:28:44,000 --> 00:28:48,000
*The pain in my heart from before became even sharper.*

443
00:28:48,000 --> 00:28:51,000
*I swallowed that pain and replied cheerfully.*

444
00:28:51,000 --> 00:28:55,000
Kashou: It's okay if it's just for one night. Don't worry about it.

445
00:28:55,000 --> 00:28:56,000
Chocola: Master...

446
00:28:56,000 --> 00:28:58,000
Kashou: Now then, go to sleep.

447
00:28:58,000 --> 00:29:02,000
Kashou: ... I really shouldn't act on my emotions, huh?

448
00:29:02,000 --> 00:29:04,000
*I laid down on the sofa.*

449
00:29:04,000 --> 00:29:07,000
*I sighed while staring at the ceiling.*

450
00:29:07,000 --> 00:29:09,000
*If I gave in to my emotions...*

451
00:29:09,000 --> 00:29:12,000
*... the result would just lead to more sadness.*

452
00:29:12,000 --> 00:29:14,000
*If I used kind or hopeful words...*

453
00:29:14,000 --> 00:29:16,000
*... they would all end up as lies.*

454
00:29:16,000 --> 00:29:20,000
Kashou: ... It's pretty uncool of me to be so passive like this.

455
00:29:20,000 --> 00:29:25,000
*While I continued to pile on insults and make excuses for my actions...*

456
00:29:25,000 --> 00:29:29,000
*... I closed my eyes and waited for sleep to take over.*

457
00:29:29,000 --> 00:29:35,000
Shigure: Regarding this situation, I want to respect Chocola and Vanilla's intentions.

458
00:29:35,000 --> 00:29:40,000
Shigure: If Chocola and Vanilla agree with it, then I'll come get them.

459
00:29:40,000 --> 00:29:45,000
*... Was what she told me when I was finally able to get in touch with her.*

460
00:29:45,000 --> 00:29:49,000
*Without any margin of negotiation space, I was struck down.*

461
00:29:49,000 --> 00:29:55,000
Kashou: But Shigure, even if you say that I don't think Chocola and Vanilla will...

462
00:29:55,000 --> 00:30:02,000
Shigure: By the way, Nii-sama. Would you whisper this morning's sweet nothings to your little sister?

463
00:30:02,000 --> 00:30:06,000
Kashou: Don't make it sound like it's a daily ritual or something.

464
00:30:06,000 --> 00:30:07,000
Kashou: In any case--

465
00:30:07,000 --> 00:30:12,000
Shigure: Ah, I'm sorry. Father is calling me, so I need to get going.

466
00:30:12,000 --> 00:30:16,000
Shigure: I love you, Nii-sama. I'll talk to you later.

467
00:30:16,000 --> 00:30:18,000
Kashou: Ah, wait! Shigure...!

468
00:30:18,000 --> 00:30:19,000
Kashou: ... Seriously?

469
00:30:19,000 --> 00:30:25,000
*As the ruthless electronic buzz of the dropped call echoed, I stared at my cell phone.*

470
00:30:25,000 --> 00:30:31,000
*... And here I thought that I could sort all this out if I could just talk to Shigure.*

471
00:30:31,000 --> 00:30:34,000
Chocola: Munch munch munch, breakfast tastes good!

472
00:30:34,000 --> 00:30:38,000
Chocola: Master's breakfast always tastes good, meow~ ♪

473
00:30:38,000 --> 00:30:42,000
Vanilla: Chocola, there's some ketchup on your cheek.

474
00:30:42,000 --> 00:30:46,000
Vanilla: It's cutely artistic. I'll lick it off. Shlurp slurp~

475
00:30:46,000 --> 00:30:51,000
*The catgirls in question were happily stuffing themselves with sandwiches.*

476
00:30:51,000 --> 00:30:56,000
*These sandwiches incidentally contained tomato, cheese, and lettuce.*

477
00:30:56,000 --> 00:31:01,000
*With an over-easy fried egg tucked inside all of that, it was a simple meal.*

478
00:31:01,000 --> 00:31:04,000
*Breakfast was pretty much like this.*

479
00:31:04,000 --> 00:31:08,000
Kashou: You two are definitely going home today, okay?

480
00:31:08,000 --> 00:31:12,000
Chocola: Is it not fun having Chocola and Vanilla around, Master?

481
00:31:12,000 --> 00:31:18,000
Chocola: Chocola is a lot of fun, you know? With Chocola, it's a world-class level of fun!

482
00:31:18,000 --> 00:31:22,000
Vanilla: Master was really looking forward to it last night too.

483
00:31:22,000 --> 00:31:25,000
Kashou: Stop with the deliberately misleading words.

484
00:31:25,000 --> 00:31:28,000
*I sighed at their happy-go-lucky mindset.*

485
00:31:28,000 --> 00:31:32,000
*I took the opportunity to fill their empty glasses with milk.*

486
00:31:32,000 --> 00:31:39,000
*The eating habits of catgirls were pretty much the same as those of humans, so that part was straightforward.*

487
00:31:39,000 --> 00:31:44,000
*Of course, what they liked and disliked depended on each individual catgirl.*

488
00:31:44,000 --> 00:31:49,000
Kashou: In the end, I wasn't able to get everything put away yesterday.

489
00:31:49,000 --> 00:31:55,000
Kashou: Today, I really do have to start getting ready for the bakery's opening, too.

490
00:31:55,000 --> 00:32:01,000
Kashou: That's why I don't have time to relax and play with you two. Be good girls and go home.

491
00:32:01,000 --> 00:32:04,000
*I said that to them with a sandwich in my hand.*

492
00:32:04,000 --> 00:32:08,000
Chocola: ... Will Chocola being around cause problems for Master?

493
00:32:08,000 --> 00:32:11,000
*She put her sandwich down on her plate...*

494
00:32:11,000 --> 00:32:15,000
*... and just like yesterday, she looked at me with upturned eyes.*

495
00:32:15,000 --> 00:32:17,000
Kashou: Yeah, it's a problem.

496
00:32:17,000 --> 00:32:19,000
*I answered her clearly.*

497
00:32:19,000 --> 00:32:22,000
Chocola: ... I see... So that's how it really is...

498
00:32:22,000 --> 00:32:25,000
*Her shoulders drooped more than before.*

499
00:32:25,000 --> 00:32:29,000
*The ears which sat atop her head drooped downheartedly, too.*

500
00:32:29,000 --> 00:32:30,000
Vanilla: Chocola...

501
00:32:30,000 --> 00:32:35,000
*Unable to make fun of anything, Vanilla could only look on with concern.*

502
00:32:35,000 --> 00:32:36,000
Kashou: ......

503
00:32:36,000 --> 00:32:38,000
*The pain from last night...*

504
00:32:38,000 --> 00:32:40,000
*... pricked at my heart again.*

505
00:32:40,000 --> 00:32:43,000
*I tilted the already-cooled coffee cup...*

506
00:32:43,000 --> 00:32:47,000
*... as my emotions dulled, unimpeded by my judgement.*

507
00:32:47,000 --> 00:32:48,000
Chocola: Besides...

508
00:32:48,000 --> 00:32:52,000
Chocola: Besides, Chocola... wants to be with Master...

509
00:32:52,000 --> 00:32:55,000
*Her usually always perky ears were drooping.*

510
00:32:55,000 --> 00:32:59,000
*Chocola was speaking clearly under her own volition.*

511
00:32:59,000 --> 00:33:02,000
Vanilla: If Chocola is here, then I am too.

512
00:33:02,000 --> 00:33:05,000
Vanilla: ... I think I want to be here too.

513
00:33:05,000 --> 00:33:08,000
*Vanilla's usually blank expression did not change.*

514
00:33:08,000 --> 00:33:11,000
*However, she showed me her strong determination.*

515
00:33:11,000 --> 00:33:12,000
Chocola: ......

516
00:33:12,000 --> 00:33:13,000
Vanilla: Hmmm...

517
00:33:13,000 --> 00:33:18,000
*"... I don't remember Chocola or Vanilla ever being this disobedient."*

518
00:33:18,000 --> 00:33:21,000
*That thought stayed at the back of my mind.*

519
00:33:21,000 --> 00:33:24,000
*But if I was going to be swayed by that...*

520
00:33:24,000 --> 00:33:26,000
*... then I wouldn't have said this.*

521
00:33:26,000 --> 00:33:28,000
Kashou: ... that. Understood?

522
00:33:28,000 --> 00:33:29,000
Kashou: Hmm?

523
00:33:29,000 --> 00:33:34,000
Tableware Seller: I'm with Royal Wood. Thank you very much for your business!

524
00:33:34,000 --> 00:33:38,000
Tableware Seller: I'm here to deliver the tea set that you ordered.

525
00:33:38,000 --> 00:33:41,000
Tableware Seller: I'll bring it on into the bakery.

526
00:33:41,000 --> 00:33:44,000
Tableware Seller: This should be all the boxes.

527
00:33:44,000 --> 00:33:50,000
Tableware Seller: If everything looks to be in order, could you please sign this invoice?

528
00:33:50,000 --> 00:33:54,000
*She smiled brightly and brought out the invoice along with a pen.*

529
00:33:54,000 --> 00:33:56,000
Kashou: Okay, let's see...

530
00:33:56,000 --> 00:34:00,000
*I looked over the sales invoice I received once more.*

531
00:34:00,000 --> 00:34:01,000
Kashou: ......

532
00:34:01,000 --> 00:34:05,000
Kashou: ... Somehow, this doesn't look like what I ordered.

533
00:34:05,000 --> 00:34:08,000
Tableware Seller: ... Huh, is that so?

534
00:34:08,000 --> 00:34:13,000
Tableware Seller: Are you saying that these... aren't the correct items?

535
00:34:13,000 --> 00:34:17,000
Kashou: No, the stuff I ordered is in here too, but...

536
00:34:17,000 --> 00:34:21,000
*I looked over at the pile of boxes inside the bakery.*

537
00:34:21,000 --> 00:34:25,000
*Inside of my tiny bakery was a mountain of boxes. A MOUNTAIN.*

538
00:34:25,000 --> 00:34:30,000
*It was as if the inside of the bakery had become completely made of boxes.*

539
00:34:30,000 --> 00:34:35,000
Kashou: As you can see, we don't need this much tableware inside the bakery...

540
00:34:35,000 --> 00:34:40,000
Tableware Seller: I-I'm sorry! I'll check with the main office right away!

541
00:34:40,000 --> 00:34:43,000
Tableware Seller: Could you give me a few moments?

542
00:34:43,000 --> 00:34:47,000
Tableware Seller: I'm sorry for the inconvenience...!

543
00:34:47,000 --> 00:34:54,000
Tableware Seller: Because of an error on our part, it appears that another order got mixed in with yours...

544
00:34:54,000 --> 00:35:00,000
Tableware Seller: I imagine that you may be in need of these items right away, Mr. Minaduki...

545
00:35:00,000 --> 00:35:06,000
Tableware Seller: So if at all possible, if you would be able to accept this order...

546
00:35:06,000 --> 00:35:08,000
Kashou: Accept this order...

547
00:35:08,000 --> 00:35:10,000
Kashou: ... Huh? From all this?

548
00:35:10,000 --> 00:35:14,000
*The mountain of cardboard boxes towered over everything.*

549
00:35:14,000 --> 00:35:16,000
*I was at a loss for words.*

550
00:35:16,000 --> 00:35:18,000
*Every box was of equal size.*

551
00:35:18,000 --> 00:35:23,000
*I wouldn't know what was inside each of them without opening them up.*

552
00:35:23,000 --> 00:35:31,000
*On top of that, looking at the sales invoice, I could see that they all contained expensive tea sets and tableware.*

553
00:35:31,000 --> 00:35:37,000
*And if I accepted it all, it would be a lot of work to deal with all the new items.*

554
00:35:37,000 --> 00:35:45,000
Kashou: Uhm, there's still things that need doing in advance of my bakery's opening, so I don't mind accepting these...

555
00:35:45,000 --> 00:35:50,000
Kashou: ... but it's going to take a while to deal with all of this.

556
00:35:50,000 --> 00:35:54,000
Tableware Seller: Of course, I would be more than happy to help!

557
00:35:54,000 --> 00:35:59,000
Tableware Seller: I have to make it to my next delivery, after all...!

558
00:35:59,000 --> 00:36:03,000
Kashou: Look, you don't need to put all this pressure on me...

559
00:36:03,000 --> 00:36:07,000
*From looks of it, it would take two hours or more...*

560
00:36:07,000 --> 00:36:11,000
*But to have it redelivered would take double the effort, too...*

561
00:36:11,000 --> 00:36:12,000
Kashou: ...... Hmm?

562
00:36:12,000 --> 00:36:14,000
Chocola & Vanilla: Stare.

563
00:36:14,000 --> 00:36:17,000
Kashou: That's right, I have a lifeline!!

564
00:36:17,000 --> 00:36:20,000
Chocola & Vanilla: Meow meow?! What is it?!

565
00:36:20,000 --> 00:36:23,000
Tableware Seller: You've really saved me, catgirls!

566
00:36:23,000 --> 00:36:27,000
Tableware Seller: Thank you! Thank you oh so very much!

567
00:36:27,000 --> 00:36:30,000
Tableware Seller: Well then, I'll be on my way!

568
00:36:30,000 --> 00:36:32,000
Kashou: ... Haah, I'm exhausted...

569
00:36:32,000 --> 00:36:36,000
*I glanced at the tableware we had finished organizing...*

570
00:36:36,000 --> 00:36:40,000
*... lowered myself into a chair and relaxed my shoulders.*

571
00:36:40,000 --> 00:36:44,000
Chocola: Master, here's some cold tea! Please enjoy it!

572
00:36:44,000 --> 00:36:47,000
Kashou: Thanks, Chocola. Don't mind if I do.

573
00:36:47,000 --> 00:36:49,000
*I downed the cold tea in one gulp.*

574
00:36:49,000 --> 00:36:53,000
*Somehow or another, the light meal tableware had arrived.*

575
00:36:53,000 --> 00:36:57,000
*Soon, I really had to get the bakery ready for its opening.*

576
00:36:57,000 --> 00:37:00,000
*... I did say I needed any help I could find.*

577
00:37:00,000 --> 00:37:03,000
*And I really did need help this time--*

578
00:37:03,000 --> 00:37:04,000
Kashou: ...... Hm?

579
00:37:04,000 --> 00:37:08,000
Chocola: Stare~ (Praise me praise me praise me praise me! ♪)

580
00:37:08,000 --> 00:37:12,000
*... I could sense the "praise me" aura coming from Chocola.*

581
00:37:12,000 --> 00:37:18,000
*She had a wide smile on her face and was in a ready stance to receive my approval.*

582
00:37:18,000 --> 00:37:22,000
Kashou: ... Thanks. I couldn't have done it without you two.

583
00:37:22,000 --> 00:37:25,000
Chocola: Yay~! Vanilla, Master is praising us~!

584
00:37:25,000 --> 00:37:27,000
Chocola: Yay~! Yahoo~!!

585
00:37:27,000 --> 00:37:32,000
Vanilla: Yes, yes. It was worth it, watching from the shadows. You did well.

586
00:37:32,000 --> 00:37:35,000
Chocola: Chocola was helpful, right, Master? Right?

587
00:37:35,000 --> 00:37:40,000
Chocola: It's difficult for Master to work alone, after all~ ♪ Right, right?

588
00:37:40,000 --> 00:37:45,000
Vanilla: Yes, yes. Assistance from a catgirl is definitely effective.

589
00:37:45,000 --> 00:37:50,000
Vanilla: If we weren't here, I imagine you'd still be sorting boxes.

590
00:37:50,000 --> 00:37:53,000
Kashou: Hey, you two are getting a bit too close...

591
00:37:53,000 --> 00:37:56,000
*They leaned forward towards me for emphasis.*

592
00:37:56,000 --> 00:38:02,000
Kashou: It is true that without you two around, this would have been a real problem...

593
00:38:02,000 --> 00:38:08,000
Kashou: ... But that's a different issue than the one from before. You two have to go back home.

594
00:38:08,000 --> 00:38:14,000
Kashou: Besides, it's not like I could ask you two to work for me or anything, okay?

595
00:38:14,000 --> 00:38:18,000
Chocola: ... Is that so... Chocola guesses it's no use then...

596
00:38:18,000 --> 00:38:22,000
*Her shoulders drooped along with her ears and tail.*

597
00:38:22,000 --> 00:38:26,000
*The enthusiasm she showed earlier had completely disappeared.*

598
00:38:26,000 --> 00:38:29,000
*She sighed deeply and looked disheartened.*

599
00:38:29,000 --> 00:38:34,000
Chocola: ... Since we're here anyways, Chocola guesses she'll go clean up...

600
00:38:34,000 --> 00:38:38,000
*She trudged up to the second floor, still dejected.*

601
00:38:38,000 --> 00:38:39,000
Kashou: ......

602
00:38:39,000 --> 00:38:41,000
*Chocola isn't an idiot.*

603
00:38:41,000 --> 00:38:45,000
*I knew she was pushing herself to be bright and full of energy.*

604
00:38:45,000 --> 00:38:50,000
*But even so, this wasn't something I was going to easily change my mind about.*

605
00:38:50,000 --> 00:38:54,000
*It was all the more with how much she cared for me.*

606
00:38:54,000 --> 00:39:00,000
Vanilla: Is it that much of a bother for us to be here, Master? Are we bad catgirls?

607
00:39:00,000 --> 00:39:02,000
*She spoke quietly in her usual way.*

608
00:39:02,000 --> 00:39:06,000
*Vanilla tilted her head as she asked that question.*

609
00:39:06,000 --> 00:39:12,000
Kashou: ... You two aren't bad catgirls, and that's why I can't have you stay here.

610
00:39:12,000 --> 00:39:16,000
Vanilla: We can't stay even though we aren't bad catgirls?

611
00:39:16,000 --> 00:39:21,000
Kashou: It's because you two are good catgirls that I can't allow it.

612
00:39:21,000 --> 00:39:22,000
Vanilla: Hmmmm...?

613
00:39:22,000 --> 00:39:25,000
*She blinked as she took in my words.*

614
00:39:25,000 --> 00:39:29,000
*It was almost as if she was trying to peer inside my heart.*

615
00:39:29,000 --> 00:39:32,000
*She stared directly at me, long and hard.*

616
00:39:32,000 --> 00:39:37,000
Vanilla: Humans are hard to understand. Catgirls do not understand such things.

617
00:39:37,000 --> 00:39:43,000
Vanilla: If we like a human, we want to be near them. At the very least, that's how I feel.

618
00:39:43,000 --> 00:39:44,000
Kashou: Vanilla...

619
00:39:44,000 --> 00:39:46,000
Vanilla: I will go check on Chocola.

620
00:39:46,000 --> 00:39:49,000
*With those words, she went upstairs.*

621
00:39:49,000 --> 00:39:56,000
*The sound of her small footsteps slowly disappeared and before long I couldn't hear them anymore.*

622
00:39:56,000 --> 00:39:59,000
Kashou: ... "Humans are hard to understand", huh?

623
00:39:59,000 --> 00:40:03,000
*Inside the bakery, now devoid of anyone but myself...*

624
00:40:03,000 --> 00:40:07,000
*... I repeated those words she had just said to me.*

625
00:40:07,000 --> 00:40:13,000
Kashou: ... Now that I think about it, that's a pretty inconsistent way of thinking, isn't it?

626
00:40:13,000 --> 00:40:15,000
**Cats do not understand that.**

627
00:40:15,000 --> 00:40:20,000
*Having heard that said aloud, I began to understand what it really meant.*

628
00:40:20,000 --> 00:40:25,000
Kashou: ... It must be pretty nice to live the simple life of a catgirl, huh?

629
00:40:25,000 --> 00:40:30,000
*I pondered as I looked at the name of the bakery affixed to the window.*

630
00:40:30,000 --> 00:40:35,000
*With a bitter smile, I began to clean up the tea sets that had arrived earlier.*

631
00:40:35,000 --> 00:40:38,000
Vanilla: Huh, that takoyaki seller isn't here today.

632
00:40:38,000 --> 00:40:43,000
*Just like yesterday, we took a walk through the park in the evening.*

633
00:40:43,000 --> 00:40:46,000
*However, that food stand was nowhere to be found.*

634
00:40:46,000 --> 00:40:52,000
*It just so happened that no one was home on the day I decided to take the two catgirls home.*

635
00:40:52,000 --> 00:40:55,000
*I had also happened to leave the house key behind.*

636
00:40:55,000 --> 00:41:00,000
*So to make good use of time, I went to do some shopping before Shigure got home.*

637
00:41:00,000 --> 00:41:03,000
Chocola: ... Eh? Ah, s-sorry, Vanilla!

638
00:41:03,000 --> 00:41:06,000
Chocola: What was it called... catnip?

639
00:41:06,000 --> 00:41:08,000
Vanilla: That sounds about right.

640
00:41:08,000 --> 00:41:11,000
Kashou: That isn't the right word at all.

641
00:41:11,000 --> 00:41:15,000
Kashou: Chocola, if you're tired, why don't we rest a bit?

642
00:41:15,000 --> 00:41:18,000
Chocola: Ah, okay. Maybe a little bit...

643
00:41:18,000 --> 00:41:22,000
Chocola: ... Ah, no, Chocola is fine. Sorry to worry you, Master.

644
00:41:22,000 --> 00:41:25,000
Kashou: ... There's no need for you to apologize.

645
00:41:25,000 --> 00:41:29,000
*She had a troubled smile on her face as she nodded.*

646
00:41:29,000 --> 00:41:33,000
*It was pretty clear why she wasn't in good spirits.*

647
00:41:33,000 --> 00:41:37,000
*That's why there was nothing I could really say to her.*

648
00:41:37,000 --> 00:41:42,000
Kashou: Well, there happens to be a bench over there, so why don't we rest a bit?

649
00:41:42,000 --> 00:41:46,000
Vanilla: In that case, I will go buy something to drink.

650
00:41:46,000 --> 00:41:49,000
Kashou: Ahh, thanks. Something for everyone, okay?

651
00:41:49,000 --> 00:41:51,000
Vanilla: Understood. Leave it to me.

652
00:41:51,000 --> 00:41:55,000
*I handed Vanilla some change and offered the bench to Chocola.*

653
00:41:55,000 --> 00:41:56,000
Chocola: ......

654
00:41:56,000 --> 00:42:00,000
*The constant sea breeze rustled the trees in the park.*

655
00:42:00,000 --> 00:42:06,000
*All that could be heard throughout the empty park were the quiet sounds of nature.*

656
00:42:06,000 --> 00:42:10,000
*I silently sat down next to the disheartened Chocola.*

657
00:42:10,000 --> 00:42:14,000
*Like the gently setting sun, time passed by slowly.*

658
00:42:14,000 --> 00:42:16,000
Chocola: ... Chocola... will go home.

659
00:42:16,000 --> 00:42:21,000
*Her voice was so quiet that I wasn't quite sure if I had heard her or not.*

660
00:42:21,000 --> 00:42:23,000
*Even so, she answered clearly.*

661
00:42:23,000 --> 00:42:28,000
*Without saying a word, I responded by gently rubbing Chocola's head.*

662
00:42:28,000 --> 00:42:33,000
Chocola: ... Is it all right if Chocola calls you sometimes, Master?

663
00:42:33,000 --> 00:42:34,000
Kashou: Yeah.

664
00:42:34,000 --> 00:42:38,000
Chocola: ... Would it be all right to go visit you as well, Master?

665
00:42:38,000 --> 00:42:39,000
Kashou: Yeah.

666
00:42:39,000 --> 00:42:43,000
Chocola: Master... Will you be sure to think about us every day...?

667
00:42:43,000 --> 00:42:50,000
Chocola: Is it all right for Chocola to... still call you Master... even if Chocola is far away from you?

668
00:42:50,000 --> 00:42:54,000
*Her voice trembled as she frantically wiped away her tears.*

669
00:42:54,000 --> 00:42:58,000
*She stifled her sobbing and her voice became strained.*

670
00:42:58,000 --> 00:43:04,000
*She looked pained as she did her best to hold back her emotions, biting her lips.*

671
00:43:04,000 --> 00:43:10,000
*I held back my irresponsible words that were on the brink of coming out with all my strength.*

672
00:43:10,000 --> 00:43:12,000
Kashou: ... Yeah. Of course, I will.

673
00:43:12,000 --> 00:43:15,000
Chocola: Uu... uuu...! U-Uwahh...!! Master...!!

674
00:43:15,000 --> 00:43:19,000
Chocola: Chocola is sorry...! Masterrr...!! Uuuwahh...!!

675
00:43:19,000 --> 00:43:23,000
*I was frustrated at myself for saying nothing. I was empty.*

676
00:43:23,000 --> 00:43:27,000
*I could only offer condolences that could not be put into words.*

677
00:43:27,000 --> 00:43:30,000
*I rubbed Chocola's head as gently as I could.*

678
00:43:30,000 --> 00:43:34,000
Chocola: Sniffle... You really are kind, aren't you Master...?

679
00:43:34,000 --> 00:43:37,000
Kashou: ... I don't really think I'm kind at all.

680
00:43:37,000 --> 00:43:41,000
Chocola: You said the same thing before, didn't you Master...

681
00:43:41,000 --> 00:43:42,000
Kashou: Before...?

682
00:43:42,000 --> 00:43:44,000
*Chocola closed her eyes and smiled.*

683
00:43:44,000 --> 00:43:48,000
Chocola: Do you remember? When Chocola and Vanilla...

684
00:43:48,000 --> 00:43:52,000
Chocola: ... were taken home by Master and Shigure-chan.

685
00:43:52,000 --> 00:43:55,000
Kashou: Ahh. Of course I remember that.

686
00:43:55,000 --> 00:43:58,000
*... It was a cold day half a year ago.*

687
00:43:58,000 --> 00:44:03,000
*Chocola and Vanilla were huddled together, crying by the side of the road.*

688
00:44:03,000 --> 00:44:07,000
*They were still so young, they couldn't even speak yet.*

689
00:44:07,000 --> 00:44:11,000
*It was that day that I embraced their small, cold bodies...*

690
00:44:11,000 --> 00:44:13,000
*... and took them home with me.*

691
00:44:13,000 --> 00:44:18,000
*There was no way I could simply forget that important day when our family grew.*

692
00:44:18,000 --> 00:44:23,000
Kashou: In the beginning, you two really couldn't get used to things at home.

693
00:44:23,000 --> 00:44:31,000
Chocola: We were scared back then because we were in an unfamiliar house with people and catgirls we didn't know...

694
00:44:31,000 --> 00:44:35,000
Kashou: You two wouldn't eat at all, which really worried Shigure.

695
00:44:35,000 --> 00:44:38,000
Chocola: Yes. We really did make her worry.

696
00:44:38,000 --> 00:44:44,000
*I started to hear a tiny bit of laughter in her voice as we reminisced about the past.*

697
00:44:44,000 --> 00:44:49,000
Chocola: ... Do you remember... when Chocola and Vanilla had a fever too...?

698
00:44:49,000 --> 00:44:52,000
Kashou: ... Ahh, I definitely do remember that.

699
00:44:52,000 --> 00:44:56,000
*It was a few days after we brought Chocola and Vanilla home.*

700
00:44:56,000 --> 00:45:00,000
*At that point, they'd only occasionally drink some water.*

701
00:45:00,000 --> 00:45:04,000
*And as always, they didn't really touch their food.*

702
00:45:04,000 --> 00:45:10,000
*The combination of malnourishment and cold weather had really begun to weaken their bodies.*

703
00:45:10,000 --> 00:45:13,000
*They both developed high fevers and were in pain.*

704
00:45:13,000 --> 00:45:16,000
Chocola: No one had realized it that night...

705
00:45:16,000 --> 00:45:20,000
Chocola: But we felt so much pain, anguish, and loneliness...

706
00:45:20,000 --> 00:45:24,000
Chocola: We couldn't speak or move our arms or legs at all...

707
00:45:24,000 --> 00:45:31,000
Chocola: All we could do was cry and cry as we kept hoping for someone -- anyone -- to come and save us...

708
00:45:31,000 --> 00:45:32,000
Chocola: And then...

709
00:45:32,000 --> 00:45:36,000
**It's all right. I'm with you two, so don't worry.**

710
00:45:36,000 --> 00:45:41,000
Chocola: With your big, warm hands... you gently rubbed our heads, Master.

711
00:45:41,000 --> 00:45:46,000
Chocola: You kept saying "Don't worry, don't worry" as you stayed by our side...

712
00:45:46,000 --> 00:45:51,000
Chocola: ... And continued to stroke and comfort both Chocola and Vanilla...

713
00:45:51,000 --> 00:45:57,000
Chocola: When morning came, you took us to the hospital. You were always, always by our side...

714
00:45:57,000 --> 00:46:03,000
Chocola: ... We felt so anxious and helpless, it felt like it was all just lies to us.

715
00:46:03,000 --> 00:46:06,000
Chocola: ... Back then, you said the same thing.

716
00:46:06,000 --> 00:46:09,000
Chocola: That you didn't think you were being kind.

717
00:46:09,000 --> 00:46:15,000
Chocola: ... But if Master hadn't saved us, Chocola and Vanilla wouldn't be here now.

718
00:46:15,000 --> 00:46:21,000
Chocola: Back then, if Master wasn't by our side, we still wouldn't be able to trust anyone.

719
00:46:21,000 --> 00:46:25,000
Chocola: Thanks to Master, we were able to eat again.

720
00:46:25,000 --> 00:46:30,000
Chocola: We were able to become friends with Shigure-chan and everyone else.

721
00:46:30,000 --> 00:46:35,000
Chocola: ... That's why, from that day forward, Master became Chocola's Master.

722
00:46:35,000 --> 00:46:41,000
Chocola: It was that day forward that Chocola began loving her kind Master, you know?

723
00:46:41,000 --> 00:46:45,000
*I wished that her tear-filled eyes would not spill over.*

724
00:46:45,000 --> 00:46:49,000
*Those tears were filled with anxiety, sadness, and happiness.*

725
00:46:49,000 --> 00:46:51,000
*She smiled all she could before me.*

726
00:46:51,000 --> 00:46:56,000
Chocola: That's why when Chocola hears that Master won't be around anymore...

727
00:46:56,000 --> 00:47:01,000
Chocola: Chocola couldn't do anything else but want to go with Master...

728
00:47:01,000 --> 00:47:04,000
Chocola: So Chocola begged Shigure-chan.

729
00:47:04,000 --> 00:47:11,000
*She said that with the faintest of smiles -- one that seemed as if would disappear at any moment.*

730
00:47:11,000 --> 00:47:14,000
*Those words were so gentle and warm.*

731
00:47:14,000 --> 00:47:19,000
*But there was also an undeniable sadness and emptiness mixed in with them.*

732
00:47:19,000 --> 00:47:20,000
Kashou: ... Chocola.

733
00:47:20,000 --> 00:47:23,000
*I was the one she was saying all this to.*

734
00:47:23,000 --> 00:47:27,000
*Even so, the only thing I could say back to her was her name.*

735
00:47:27,000 --> 00:47:34,000
Chocola: Chocola guesses catgirls don't really understand when it comes to money and other complex things...

736
00:47:34,000 --> 00:47:35,000
Chocola: ... Still.

737
00:47:35,000 --> 00:47:39,000
Chocola: No matter what, Chocola wants to be by Master's side...

738
00:47:39,000 --> 00:47:45,000
Chocola: When Master is having a tough time or is in trouble... somehow Chocola just knows.

739
00:47:45,000 --> 00:47:48,000
Chocola: ... Chocola just somehow does.

740
00:47:48,000 --> 00:47:55,000
Chocola: Whether it's cleaning, doing the laundry, or cooking, Chocola will do anything to help...!

741
00:47:55,000 --> 00:48:04,000
Chocola: Even if Chocola can't do it properly right now, Chocola will absolutely make sure that she'll be able to do things right someday...!

742
00:48:04,000 --> 00:48:06,000
Chocola: ... That's why.

743
00:48:06,000 --> 00:48:11,000
Chocola: That's why... would it be okay... to ask for one more favor...?

744
00:48:11,000 --> 00:48:14,000
Chocola: Chocola... wants to be with Master...

745
00:48:14,000 --> 00:48:17,000
*Chocola voiced her feelings clearly once again...*

746
00:48:17,000 --> 00:48:20,000
*... and barely kept her tears from overflowing.*

747
00:48:20,000 --> 00:48:23,000
**Chocola, if you could be with me--**

748
00:48:23,000 --> 00:48:27,000
*I was engulfed by my inner thoughts which were ready to overflow.*

749
00:48:27,000 --> 00:48:29,000
*She yearned for me so earnestly.*

750
00:48:29,000 --> 00:48:35,000
*For her to so innocently believe in me... There should be no reason for me to be against it.*

751
00:48:35,000 --> 00:48:40,000
*That day, Chocola and Vanilla became an important part of my family.*

752
00:48:40,000 --> 00:48:45,000
*As long as they were with me, the days would be bright and enjoyable.*

753
00:48:45,000 --> 00:48:49,000
*... I was simply selfish for just leaving home like that.*

754
00:48:49,000 --> 00:48:54,000
*I didn't want to get my dear family wrapped up in my selfishness...*

755
00:48:54,000 --> 00:48:59,000
*... or have them experience any unnecessary hardship because of me.*

756
00:48:59,000 --> 00:49:02,000
**You two are important to me, after all--**

757
00:49:02,000 --> 00:49:06,000
Vanilla: We are catgirls, so we're honest with ourselves.

758
00:49:06,000 --> 00:49:09,000
*My inner conflict was disrupted by Vanilla.*

759
00:49:09,000 --> 00:49:12,000
*Vanilla had returned at some point...*

760
00:49:12,000 --> 00:49:16,000
*... and she looked straight at me as she sat at Chocola's side.*

761
00:49:16,000 --> 00:49:20,000
Vanilla: For me, as long as it's fun, I am fine being with Chocola.

762
00:49:20,000 --> 00:49:25,000
Vanilla: Even if there are hardships, I think I am fine being with Chocola.

763
00:49:25,000 --> 00:49:30,000
Vanilla: After all, it's much more lonely and painful when we can't be together.

764
00:49:30,000 --> 00:49:31,000
Kashou: ... Vanilla.

765
00:49:31,000 --> 00:49:39,000
Vanilla: If we really love you then even if it's troublesome we want to be with you. That is a reason to want to be with you.

766
00:49:39,000 --> 00:49:42,000
Vanilla: Stuff like whether we'd be happy or not...

767
00:49:42,000 --> 00:49:48,000
Vanilla: Even though you're our Master, don't you think it's wrong for you to decide that?

768
00:49:48,000 --> 00:49:56,000
Vanilla: Besides, when a person important to us is in trouble, that's more reason for us to want to be by their side.

769
00:49:56,000 --> 00:49:59,000
Vanilla: We don't know what we can do, but...

770
00:49:59,000 --> 00:50:05,000
Vanilla: ... In tough times, we can at least be by your side to cheer you up. That we can do.

771
00:50:05,000 --> 00:50:08,000
*It was as if her gentle, warm, and soft smile...*

772
00:50:08,000 --> 00:50:10,000
*... had become the setting sun.*

773
00:50:10,000 --> 00:50:13,000
*These uncharacteristic words from Vanilla...*

774
00:50:13,000 --> 00:50:16,000
*... deeply penetrated and seeped into my heart.*

775
00:50:16,000 --> 00:50:20,000
Vanilla: That is probably why Shigure let us follow you, Master.

776
00:50:20,000 --> 00:50:25,000
Vanilla: Since Shigure can't go with you, she asked us to go in her stead, Master.

777
00:50:25,000 --> 00:50:31,000
Vanilla: That is why, if Master really cares about us, then I believe we should be with you.

778
00:50:31,000 --> 00:50:34,000
*There was not even the faintest bit of hesitation.*

779
00:50:34,000 --> 00:50:38,000
*They were such honest and absolutely straightforward words.*

780
00:50:38,000 --> 00:50:42,000
**Who am I to dictate Chocola and Vanilla's happiness?**

781
00:50:42,000 --> 00:50:46,000
*Only those words continued to strongly resonate in my mind...*

782
00:50:46,000 --> 00:50:48,000
*... which was otherwise empty.*

783
00:50:48,000 --> 00:50:54,000
Chocola: ... Even if we lived a worry-free life, we would hate it if Master wasn't around.

784
00:50:54,000 --> 00:50:59,000
Chocola: No matter how difficult, Chocola wants to be together with Master.

785
00:50:59,000 --> 00:51:04,000
Chocola: That's why Chocola begs you to allow us to be by your side, Master.

786
00:51:04,000 --> 00:51:07,000
Chocola: This is where Chocola wants to be.

787
00:51:07,000 --> 00:51:09,000
*She was on the verge of tears...*

788
00:51:09,000 --> 00:51:11,000
*... but Chocola's face lit up.*

789
00:51:11,000 --> 00:51:15,000
*They were nothing but absolutely pure, genuine words.*

790
00:51:15,000 --> 00:51:20,000
Kashou: ... Humans really are at a loss for words when it comes to catgirls, huh?

791
00:51:20,000 --> 00:51:22,000
*Saying "no" to their words...*

792
00:51:22,000 --> 00:51:25,000
*... was not something I could bring myself to do.*

793
00:51:25,000 --> 00:51:28,000
Chocola & Vanilla: Master, does that mean...

794
00:51:28,000 --> 00:51:34,000
Kashou: It won't be like it was back at home. You can't just live here however you like, got it?

795
00:51:34,000 --> 00:51:37,000
Chocola: Yes! That won't be a problem!

796
00:51:37,000 --> 00:51:41,000
Chocola: Chocola is happy as long as Master is here with her!

797
00:51:41,000 --> 00:51:44,000
Vanilla: Well, well~ Master has finally surrendered.

798
00:51:44,000 --> 00:51:49,000
Vanilla: Sometimes people say they hate what they actually love, right?

799
00:51:49,000 --> 00:51:53,000
*The dreary moment seemed to be blown away by her dazzling smile.*

800
00:51:53,000 --> 00:51:59,000
*... Despite all this talk about family, perhaps I was the one that didn't really believe in it.*

801
00:51:59,000 --> 00:52:04,000
*Thinking about all this from their perspective, it was very simple.*

802
00:52:04,000 --> 00:52:07,000
*Although I thought it was all still so immature.*

803
00:52:07,000 --> 00:52:12,000
*Perhaps catgirls were more human than humans were when it came to honesty.*

804
00:52:12,000 --> 00:52:16,000
Kashou: From here on out, we need to do our best all together.

805
00:52:16,000 --> 00:52:25,000
Chocola: Of course! ♪ Chocola is all right even if we don't have fatty tuna for dinner every night! Just occasionally is good enough!

806
00:52:25,000 --> 00:52:31,000
Vanilla: For meat, A4 grade is fine as long as it's Matsuzaka beef. Fatty meat is the best!

807
00:52:31,000 --> 00:52:35,000
Kashou: ... Is that all you guys have been eating at home?!

808
00:52:35,000 --> 00:52:38,000
*Even if the road ahead of us is uncertain...*

809
00:52:38,000 --> 00:52:42,000
*I lovingly rubbed their heads, disheveling their hair.*

810
00:52:42,000 --> 00:52:47,000
Kashou: All right, why don't we head back to the shopping district then?

811
00:52:47,000 --> 00:52:51,000
Chocola: Eh? Why is that? Aren't you done with shopping already?

812
00:52:51,000 --> 00:52:55,000
Kashou: We have to go buy that shampoo you guys liked, don't we?

813
00:52:55,000 --> 00:52:57,000
Vanilla: Ohhh~ Master is so cool!

814
00:52:57,000 --> 00:53:01,000
Vanilla: While we're at it, let's buy some Matsuzaka beef.

815
00:53:01,000 --> 00:53:04,000
Kashou: Well, today is a celebration, so why not?

816
00:53:04,000 --> 00:53:06,000
Chocola: Yay~! A celebratory party!

817
00:53:06,000 --> 00:53:10,000
Vanilla: Master is so generous...! As expected of our Master...!

818
00:53:10,000 --> 00:53:12,000
Kashou: Just this once, okay?

819
00:53:12,000 --> 00:53:15,000
*This was the beginning to a bright, new life...*

820
00:53:15,000 --> 00:53:22,000
*... and together with the happy and high-spirited Chocola and Vanilla, we took the first steps towards it...*

821
00:53:22,000 --> 00:53:24,000
Chocola: Yay~! Master, Master~!!

822
00:53:24,000 --> 00:53:26,000
Chocola: Look, look over here~!!

823
00:53:26,000 --> 00:53:31,000
Chocola: Fuwahh~! These clothes are really nice! They're super cute~!!

824
00:53:31,000 --> 00:53:35,000
Chocola: Chocola is moved! ♪ Chocola is really moved, Master! ♪

825
00:53:35,000 --> 00:53:40,000
Vanilla: Chocola, you're super cute...! Flip your skirt up just a bit!

826
00:53:40,000 --> 00:53:43,000
Chocola: Like this? Like this? Flip flip~ ♪

827
00:53:43,000 --> 00:53:47,000
Vanilla: Ah. Master is looking at you with perverted eyes, Chocola.

828
00:53:47,000 --> 00:53:49,000
Chocola: Nooo~ Master, you pervert~ ♪

829
00:53:49,000 --> 00:53:51,000
Kashou: Stop fooling around!

830
00:53:51,000 --> 00:53:56,000
*The two catgirls showed off the uniforms they had just received comedically.*

831
00:53:56,000 --> 00:54:00,000
*Swamped with work, I turned away from the two catgirls.*

832
00:54:00,000 --> 00:54:05,000
Chocola: Master! Do you think Chocola looks good in Master's shop uniform?

833
00:54:05,000 --> 00:54:08,000
Kashou: Ahh, yeah, it looks really good.

834
00:54:08,000 --> 00:54:13,000
Kashou: Although it was last minute, I'm glad that we found something decent.

835
00:54:13,000 --> 00:54:17,000
Vanilla: Yep yep, good good. I was the one who chose these though.

836
00:54:17,000 --> 00:54:22,000
Kashou: Ahh, it looks good on you too, Vanilla. I'm counting on you two, you know!

837
00:54:22,000 --> 00:54:26,000
Vanilla: ... Well, we'll do our best to the extent of our ability.

838
00:54:26,000 --> 00:54:28,000
Chocola: Yay~ Master praised us! ♪

839
00:54:28,000 --> 00:54:33,000
Chocola: From tomorrow on, let's do our best as shop catgirls, Vanilla!

840
00:54:33,000 --> 00:54:39,000
Vanilla: Since Master did prepare these uniforms for us, I guess I might as well. I will try.

841
00:54:39,000 --> 00:54:42,000
Chocola: Come on, you aren't being honest~ ♪

842
00:54:42,000 --> 00:54:49,000
Chocola: You should also give Master some eye-candy by flipping your skirt a bit, Vanilla! Come on, come on~ ♪

843
00:54:49,000 --> 00:54:54,000
Vanilla: Nyaahh... I'm not that kind of catgirl-- ahh, stop, Chocola...!

844
00:54:54,000 --> 00:54:57,000
Vanilla: Wait...! I said, don't... nyaah?!

845
00:54:57,000 --> 00:55:01,000
Vanilla: Th-That...! That isn't my skirt-- N-Nyaaaahhh?!

846
00:55:01,000 --> 00:55:04,000
Kashou: My catgirls sure are energetic.

847
00:55:04,000 --> 00:55:11,000
*I looked at the frolicking catgirls out of the corner of my eye as I wiped the trays and tableware.*

848
00:55:11,000 --> 00:55:13,000
Kashou: ... We open tomorrow, huh?

849
00:55:13,000 --> 00:55:20,000
*The necessary ingredients were already in the refrigerator and the decorative plants for the shop had arrived.*

850
00:55:20,000 --> 00:55:26,000
*I figured there would be more excitement to all of this, but naturally, that wasn't the case.*

851
00:55:26,000 --> 00:55:31,000
Kashou: Time did fly by when we were trying to get everything prepared though...

852
00:55:31,000 --> 00:55:36,000
*I reached for the business cards that had just arrived that morning.*

853
00:55:36,000 --> 00:55:41,000
Chocola: Meow meow meow?! Master, what are those?! Just what could those be?

854
00:55:41,000 --> 00:55:45,000
Vanilla: Ohh. Could those be those things called "business cards?"

855
00:55:45,000 --> 00:55:51,000
Chocola: Amazing! That's amazing, Master! It even has the shop's address and phone number on it!

856
00:55:51,000 --> 00:55:56,000
Vanilla: It's a single card that tells you everything about this shop.

857
00:55:56,000 --> 00:56:02,000
Vanilla: You have no sense of discretion in an era where everyone is protective of their privacy.

858
00:56:02,000 --> 00:56:06,000
Kashou: No, that's exactly what business cards are used for.

859
00:56:06,000 --> 00:56:11,000
*She knew about protecting personal information, but not about business cards...?*

860
00:56:11,000 --> 00:56:18,000
*Well, it was true that it would be a pain if I was in some sort of strange business or something.*

861
00:56:18,000 --> 00:56:21,000
Chocola: Congratulations! Congratulations, Master!

862
00:56:21,000 --> 00:56:29,000
Chocola: With such a pretty business card, soon they'll all be gone and replaced with a shop packed with guests instead! ♪

863
00:56:29,000 --> 00:56:33,000
Kashou: Ahh, it would be nice if everything went like that.

864
00:56:33,000 --> 00:56:39,000
*I rubbed the high-spirited Chocola on the head as if that dream had already been granted.*

865
00:56:39,000 --> 00:56:46,000
*If she was already this genuinely happy about things, I began to feel like it all might go well.*

866
00:56:46,000 --> 00:56:51,000
*... It really was reassuring to have someone else here along with me.*

867
00:56:51,000 --> 00:56:54,000
*I found myself thinking about that all again.*

868
00:56:54,000 --> 00:56:55,000
Vanilla: ...... Stare~

869
00:56:55,000 --> 00:56:57,000
Kashou: What's wrong, Vanilla?

870
00:56:57,000 --> 00:57:00,000
Vanilla: I want one. Is it okay to take it?

871
00:57:00,000 --> 00:57:02,000
Kashou: Ahh, I don't mind...

872
00:57:02,000 --> 00:57:06,000
*It was rare for Vanilla to want something like that.*

873
00:57:06,000 --> 00:57:09,000
*But I imagine even catgirls like to have mementos.*

874
00:57:09,000 --> 00:57:13,000
*I had several hundred cards, so it really wasn't a big deal.*

875
00:57:13,000 --> 00:57:17,000
Chocola: Oh, oh! Chocola, too! Master, Chocola wants one too!

876
00:57:17,000 --> 00:57:22,000
Kashou: Okay, I had a lot made so go ahead and take however many you'd like.

877
00:57:22,000 --> 00:57:25,000
Kashou: Hey, wait! You can't take all of them!

878
00:57:25,000 --> 00:57:29,000
Kashou: That's not what I meant by take however many you want!

879
00:57:29,000 --> 00:57:32,000
*I watched Chocola take the box and go.*

880
00:57:32,000 --> 00:57:35,000
*Maybe Japanese was hard for them to understand.*

881
00:57:35,000 --> 00:57:36,000
Chocola: ...... Stare~

882
00:57:36,000 --> 00:57:37,000
Vanilla: ...... Stare~

883
00:57:37,000 --> 00:57:39,000
Chocola: ...... Meow, fwahp!

884
00:57:39,000 --> 00:57:41,000
Vanilla: ...... Meow, fwahp!

885
00:57:41,000 --> 00:57:43,000
Chocola: ...... Stare...

886
00:57:43,000 --> 00:57:45,000
Vanilla: ...... Stare...

887
00:57:45,000 --> 00:57:47,000
Chocola: ...... Meow, fwahp!

888
00:57:47,000 --> 00:57:49,000
Vanilla: ...... Meow, fwahp!

889
00:57:49,000 --> 00:57:51,000
Chocola: ...... Meow! Fwahp!

890
00:57:51,000 --> 00:57:53,000
Vanilla: ...... Meow! Fwahp!

891
00:57:53,000 --> 00:57:58,000
Chocola & Vanilla: Meow meow! Meow, meow meow, meow meow!! (Fwahp fwahp!)

892
00:57:58,000 --> 00:58:00,000
Kashou: ... You two really are cats.

893
00:58:00,000 --> 00:58:05,000
*That was how I felt, watching those two get so engrossed in a regular cat toy.*

894
00:58:05,000 --> 00:58:10,000
*Well, it did say "Go Ahead," so for now, I'll just let them play with it.*

895
00:58:10,000 --> 00:58:13,000
Kashou: Hmm, where can I find books on catgirls...

896
00:58:13,000 --> 00:58:18,000
*As I looked around the store, an apron-clad shop clerk came up to me.*

897
00:58:18,000 --> 00:58:21,000
Shop Clerk: Is there anything I can help you with?

898
00:58:21,000 --> 00:58:25,000
Kashou: Do you have any books on raising cats? The humanoid kind.

899
00:58:25,000 --> 00:58:28,000
Shop Clerk: Yes, certainly! They would be over here.

900
00:58:28,000 --> 00:58:32,000
Kashou: ... Wow, there sure are a lot of books on catgirls.

901
00:58:32,000 --> 00:58:39,000
*I was so taken aback by the tightly packed amount of books on catgirls, my thoughts happened to slip out.*

902
00:58:39,000 --> 00:58:44,000
*"A Catgirl's Feelings", "Catgirl Education", "Catgirls at Full Speed... or Not!"*

903
00:58:44,000 --> 00:58:49,000
*I didn't understand the last one... but in any case, there were a lot of books.*

904
00:58:49,000 --> 00:58:57,000
Shop Clerk: While there are a lot of these kinds of books, when it comes to catgirls, each individual one is different.

905
00:58:57,000 --> 00:59:05,000
Shop Clerk: Humanoid cats can communicate with words, so if you just talk with them you should be able to work things out.

906
00:59:05,000 --> 00:59:08,000
Shop Clerk: Are you those catgirls' master?

907
00:59:08,000 --> 00:59:11,000
Kashou: Oh, no, my little sister is their owne--

908
00:59:11,000 --> 00:59:17,000
Kashou: ... Wait, no. I am their owner. I thought should do a bit of studying up on them.

909
00:59:17,000 --> 00:59:23,000
Shop Clerk: I see. I'll bring you some recommended books then. Please wait for a moment.

910
00:59:23,000 --> 00:59:27,000
*It did feel awkward to declare that I was their owner.*

911
00:59:27,000 --> 00:59:33,000
*But to be able to say that I was their owner was also something that made me a bit happy.*

912
00:59:33,000 --> 00:59:37,000
*... I would say it was a part of my caring personality.*

913
00:59:37,000 --> 00:59:44,000
*A wry smile formed on my face as I watched the two of them frantically slap the cat toy from a distance.*

914
00:59:44,000 --> 00:59:46,000
*... Wait, they're still doing that?*

915
00:59:46,000 --> 00:59:50,000
Shop Clerk: Thank you for waiting. How about this book?

916
00:59:50,000 --> 00:59:53,000
*The shop clerk came back and handed me a book.*

917
00:59:53,000 --> 00:59:55,000
*"Catgirls: Year One to Adulthood".*

918
00:59:55,000 --> 01:00:06,000
Shop Clerk: If that's what you have on your plate, then maybe it would be better to learn about the special characteristics of catgirls instead of how to raise them.

919
01:00:06,000 --> 01:00:14,000
Shop Clerk: At this point, I don't think you need to teach them how to speak, use the restroom, or take a bath, after all.

920
01:00:14,000 --> 01:00:22,000
Shop Clerk: But it also covers topics related to adult catgirls, including mating seasons and physical development.

921
01:00:22,000 --> 01:00:25,000
Kashou: Right, that would be important.

922
01:00:25,000 --> 01:00:28,000
*I rapidly flipped through the pages.*

923
01:00:28,000 --> 01:00:34,000
*"Eating habits to promote growth", "Mating season", "Stable period during pregnancy".*

924
01:00:34,000 --> 01:00:40,000
*"Catgirl training", "Ways to deal with catgirls", "Catgirl personalities", "Schooling".*

925
01:00:40,000 --> 01:00:45,000
*It covered topics all the way to athletic competitions involving catgirls.*

926
01:00:45,000 --> 01:00:51,000
Shop Clerk: Whether a partner for life, partner for work, or partner for hobbies...

927
01:00:51,000 --> 01:00:58,000
Shop Clerk: ... the relationship between owner and catgirl in various ways is like one of a family.

928
01:00:58,000 --> 01:01:06,000
Shop Clerk: It may not be great compared to books covering specific topics, but I think it's a decent one to start with.

929
01:01:06,000 --> 01:01:11,000
Shop Clerk: But even so, those catgirls over there have been raised very well...

930
01:01:11,000 --> 01:01:16,000
Shop Clerk: I think you'll be fine as long as they're able to talk like humans.

931
01:01:16,000 --> 01:01:20,000
Kashou: ... You're right. They seem better raised than I was.

932
01:01:20,000 --> 01:01:27,000
*I suddenly remembered not too long ago when Chocola and Vanilla managed to talk me out of sending them home.*

933
01:01:27,000 --> 01:01:30,000
*... As an owner, I'd better study up.*

934
01:01:30,000 --> 01:01:35,000
*With that thought in mind, I handed the book back to the shop clerk.*

935
01:01:35,000 --> 01:01:38,000
Kashou: In that case, I'd like to buy this.

936
01:01:38,000 --> 01:01:41,000
Shop Clerk: All right. Thank you very much.

937
01:01:41,000 --> 01:01:44,000
Shop Clerk: Ah, also, there is one more thing...

938
01:01:44,000 --> 01:01:46,000
Kashou: Hmm? What is it?

939
01:01:46,000 --> 01:01:53,000
Shop Clerk: Just what is going on over there? Your catgirls seem to be really into something, but...

940
01:01:53,000 --> 01:01:54,000
Kashou: Over there...?

941
01:01:54,000 --> 01:01:56,000
Chocola: Hah, hah, hah, hah...!!

942
01:01:56,000 --> 01:01:58,000
Vanilla: Hyuuh, hyuuh, hyuuh...!!

943
01:01:58,000 --> 01:02:03,000
Chocola: Dying... At this rate, Chocola will die...! Hah, hah, hah...!!

944
01:02:03,000 --> 01:02:07,000
Vanilla: I can see... the light... Hyuu, hyuu, hyuu...!!

945
01:02:07,000 --> 01:02:13,000
Vanilla: The only way you'll pass through... is over my dead body... Cough, cough, cough...!!

946
01:02:13,000 --> 01:02:18,000
Chocola: Go and tell M-Master that... until the end... Chocola was...!

947
01:02:18,000 --> 01:02:22,000
Chocola: ... his splendid catgirl... Hah, hah, haah...!!

948
01:02:22,000 --> 01:02:27,000
Kashou: ... Well, I guess I'll get that toy, too. Also, do you have any drinks?

949
01:02:27,000 --> 01:02:29,000
Shop Clerk: Thank you very much.

950
01:02:29,000 --> 01:02:34,000
*... Sometimes, I really wondered if their heads were screwed on right.*

951
01:02:34,000 --> 01:02:41,000
*Watching the two catgirls roll around as if on the verge of death suddenly made me feel anxious.*

952
01:02:41,000 --> 01:02:45,000
Chocola: S-Sorry, Master... We got a little carried away...

953
01:02:45,000 --> 01:02:53,000
Vanilla: No matter how much common knowledge we take in, we can't go against what is normal behaviour for us catgirls...

954
01:02:53,000 --> 01:02:58,000
Kashou: Well, I'll hang this up in the room, so play with it all you want.

955
01:02:58,000 --> 01:03:03,000
*Their eyes flickered towards the toy that was jutting out of the plastic bag.*

956
01:03:03,000 --> 01:03:06,000
*I guess on a genetic level, they really were cats.*

957
01:03:06,000 --> 01:03:11,000
*The shop clerk did tell me, "That's just how things are," after all.*

958
01:03:11,000 --> 01:03:15,000
Vanilla: Hey, Master. Could you stop by the drugstore?

959
01:03:15,000 --> 01:03:20,000
Kashou: Hmm? I wasn't planning on it, but was there something you wanted?

960
01:03:20,000 --> 01:03:26,000
Vanilla: Well, if you put it that way, then yes, it's something like that. Is that all right?

961
01:03:26,000 --> 01:03:29,000
Kashou: I guess if you want to go, then we can go...

962
01:03:29,000 --> 01:03:33,000
*Using such unclear words was uncharacteristic of Vanilla.*

963
01:03:33,000 --> 01:03:38,000
*Just the other day, I had bought her a full set of hair care products.*

964
01:03:38,000 --> 01:03:43,000
*I guess there was some medicine I wanted to stock up on, so I didn't mind.*

965
01:03:43,000 --> 01:03:45,000
Kashou: Okay, let's go, then.

966
01:03:45,000 --> 01:03:48,000
Vanilla: Yeah, let's go. Objective achieved.

967
01:03:48,000 --> 01:03:49,000
Kashou: Objective?

968
01:03:49,000 --> 01:03:52,000
Vanilla: Catgirls' have lots of them too, you know.

969
01:03:52,000 --> 01:03:55,000
Kashou: ...? Well, that's fine, I guess...

970
01:03:55,000 --> 01:03:58,000
*Maybe catgirls' lives aren't that easy...*

971
01:03:58,000 --> 01:04:02,000
*I thought about that as we headed towards the drugstore.*

972
01:04:02,000 --> 01:04:05,000
Chocola: Hey hey, Master. What's men-stroo-al pain?

973
01:04:05,000 --> 01:04:08,000
Chocola: Ah, could men-stroo-al pain be...

974
01:04:08,000 --> 01:04:14,000
Chocola: It's the pain in your muscles when you're cleaning, right?! Chocola is very perceptive~!

975
01:04:14,000 --> 01:04:18,000
Kashou: It's something like that. Look, can you keep it down? Okay?

976
01:04:18,000 --> 01:04:22,000
*Stares from others in the store were piercing me once again.*

977
01:04:22,000 --> 01:04:29,000
*There's no way I could get angry at their innocence either. Please try to understand my situation...*

978
01:04:29,000 --> 01:04:35,000
Kashou: In any case, why don't we go that way? There should be medicine over there.

979
01:04:35,000 --> 01:04:39,000
Chocola: Coordinates confirmed! Chocola will follow you, Master~ ♪

980
01:04:39,000 --> 01:04:43,000
Chocola: By the way, what kind of medicine are you buying, Master?

981
01:04:43,000 --> 01:04:47,000
Chocola: You take medicine when you hurt or are in pain, right?

982
01:04:47,000 --> 01:04:50,000
Chocola: Do you hurt somewhere, Master?!

983
01:04:50,000 --> 01:04:55,000
Chocola: In that case, wouldn't it be better if you go to the hospital?!

984
01:04:55,000 --> 01:04:59,000
Kashou: It's just some household medicine. Thanks for your concern.

985
01:04:59,000 --> 01:05:03,000
*I calmed down the concerned Chocola, who was right up in my face.*

986
01:05:03,000 --> 01:05:10,000
Kashou: Household medicine is the kind of medicine you buy, just in case something happens at home.

987
01:05:10,000 --> 01:05:17,000
Chocola: But when Chocola had a fever and was in pain, Master took Chocola to the hospital, right?

988
01:05:17,000 --> 01:05:21,000
Kashou: That time wasn't normal. Chocola is a catgirl too.

989
01:05:21,000 --> 01:05:28,000
Kashou: If you only have a slight cold, then medicine from the local store should be more than enough.

990
01:05:28,000 --> 01:05:34,000
Chocola: Ohhh, Chocola understands. There's a lot of different things to learn about humans.

991
01:05:34,000 --> 01:05:39,000
*She picked up various medicine boxes and looked at them with admiration.*

992
01:05:39,000 --> 01:05:44,000
*On that note, was it okay for catgirls to take regular human medicine?*

993
01:05:44,000 --> 01:05:50,000
*A while ago I saw that Shigure had some medicine that said "--ship" or something on it, but...*

994
01:05:50,000 --> 01:05:53,000
Chocola: Ah, there's a clinic next door!

995
01:05:53,000 --> 01:05:59,000
Chocola: If they don't have the right medicine here, then you can go next door, right?

996
01:05:59,000 --> 01:06:05,000
Chocola: As expected of human civilization. Everything is made to be so convenient~ ♪

997
01:06:05,000 --> 01:06:07,000
Kashou: Yeah, that's about right.

998
01:06:07,000 --> 01:06:09,000
*I answered her vaguely.*

999
01:06:09,000 --> 01:06:14,000
*Well, Chocola hasn't been to a hospital for humans before, after all.*

1000
01:06:14,000 --> 01:06:19,000
*It's all right as long as she understands more or less what they are.*

1001
01:06:19,000 --> 01:06:21,000
Kashou: ... Huh? Where's Vanilla?

1002
01:06:21,000 --> 01:06:25,000
Chocola: Huh? Now that you mention it, Chocola doesn't see her...

1003
01:06:25,000 --> 01:06:28,000
*Before I realized it, Vanilla had vanished.*

1004
01:06:28,000 --> 01:06:33,000
*Wasn't she the one that said she wanted to go to the drugstore, too...?*

1005
01:06:33,000 --> 01:06:35,000
Chocola: Sniff sniff, sniff sniff...

1006
01:06:35,000 --> 01:06:39,000
Chocola: Hah! Chocola can smell Vanilla's scent over there, Master!

1007
01:06:39,000 --> 01:06:43,000
Kashou: By "over there," do you mean... outside of the store?

1008
01:06:43,000 --> 01:06:48,000
*I turned to where Chocola was pointing and saw that she was pointing outside.*

1009
01:06:48,000 --> 01:06:51,000
Vanilla: Hmm? My dear Chocola, did you call me?

1010
01:06:51,000 --> 01:06:55,000
*All of a sudden, Vanilla came back inside the store.*

1011
01:06:55,000 --> 01:06:58,000
Kashou: Huh, Vanilla? Where did you go?

1012
01:06:58,000 --> 01:07:01,000
Vanilla: I just went to pick some flowers.

1013
01:07:01,000 --> 01:07:06,000
Kashou: No, I mean, you clearly came from outside of the store just now.

1014
01:07:06,000 --> 01:07:10,000
*I pointed towards the sign for the restrooms inside the store.*

1015
01:07:10,000 --> 01:07:13,000
*There was no reason for Vanilla to lie, though...*

1016
01:07:13,000 --> 01:07:16,000
*Wait, she is a cat, so does it mean that she...?*

1017
01:07:16,000 --> 01:07:22,000
Kashou: ... Could it be that you didn't know what a restroom was and went outside to...?

1018
01:07:22,000 --> 01:07:25,000
Vanilla: Pervert! That's really rude of you, Master!

1019
01:07:25,000 --> 01:07:28,000
Vanilla: Super pervert! What an awful person!

1020
01:07:28,000 --> 01:07:34,000
Kashou: Y-Yeah, that's true, huh? There's no way that would be the case, right. Sorry...!

1021
01:07:34,000 --> 01:07:38,000
*Vanilla's face was red with rage as I earnestly apologized.*

1022
01:07:38,000 --> 01:07:42,000
*... So that's how Vanilla looks when she gets angry, huh?*

1023
01:07:42,000 --> 01:07:45,000
*It's difficult to make sense of a catgirl's pride.*

1024
01:07:45,000 --> 01:07:52,000
Vanilla: In any case, we should hurry back and prepare for the bakery's opening. It's tomorrow, after all.

1025
01:07:52,000 --> 01:07:56,000
Chocola: Chocola and Vanilla will help out too, Master!

1026
01:07:56,000 --> 01:08:00,000
Kashou: It's going to be a tall order, so I'm counting on you two.

1027
01:08:00,000 --> 01:08:02,000
Chocola & Vanilla: Okay!

1028
01:08:02,000 --> 01:08:06,000
Chocola: Welcome! Have you decided on what you'd like to order?!

1029
01:08:06,000 --> 01:08:10,000
Vanilla: There's not enough heart in it. Be more flirty and sexy!

1030
01:08:10,000 --> 01:08:15,000
Chocola: Hrmm, hrmm. Sexy, huh? Okay, let's try once more from the top.

1031
01:08:15,000 --> 01:08:17,000
Chocola: Ahhnn, welcummm~ ♪

1032
01:08:17,000 --> 01:08:21,000
Vanilla: Sorry. Honestly, blame me. Ignore what I just said.

1033
01:08:21,000 --> 01:08:25,000
Kashou: Just for the record, this isn't that kind of bakery, okay?

1034
01:08:25,000 --> 01:08:29,000
Chocola: Welcome! ♪ Our bakery's recommendation is cakes!

1035
01:08:29,000 --> 01:08:35,000
Kashou: What good is it if a customer walks into a bakery and you recommend cakes to them?

1036
01:08:35,000 --> 01:08:40,000
Vanilla: Wouldn't it be a problem to recommend stuff aside from cakes?

1037
01:08:40,000 --> 01:08:42,000
Kashou: Well, that is true, but...

1038
01:08:42,000 --> 01:08:49,000
*While I was making preparations for tomorrow, the poster girls were off to the side practicing greetings.*

1039
01:08:49,000 --> 01:08:54,000
*I thought I heard them say they were going to help earlier, but... oh well.*

1040
01:08:54,000 --> 01:08:59,000
*Well, what I was doing could be done by one person for now, at least.*

1041
01:08:59,000 --> 01:09:01,000
Kashou: Hmm, so that's it?

1042
01:09:01,000 --> 01:09:04,000
*I had a taste of the custard I'd just made.*

1043
01:09:04,000 --> 01:09:09,000
*There were no clumps and the taste was uniform. The sweetness was superb too.*

1044
01:09:09,000 --> 01:09:13,000
Kashou: Now then, next I need to work on the pie dough--

1045
01:09:13,000 --> 01:09:16,000
Chocola & Vanilla: Stare~ ♪ C'mon c'mon c'mon!!

1046
01:09:16,000 --> 01:09:19,000
Kashou: ...... Did you two want to have a taste?

1047
01:09:19,000 --> 01:09:25,000
Chocola & Vanilla: Meow, just as expected of Master~ ♪\nMeow, as expected of Master♪

1048
01:09:25,000 --> 01:09:28,000
*I handed the custard-covered spatula over to them.*

1049
01:09:28,000 --> 01:09:29,000
Chocola: Munch, mmm...

1050
01:09:29,000 --> 01:09:32,000
Chocola: It's so goooood! It tastes good, Master~ ♪

1051
01:09:32,000 --> 01:09:39,000
Vanilla: Oh...! Lick lick, this not overly-sweet sweetness... Lick lick, it makes me want to lick it more...!

1052
01:09:39,000 --> 01:09:42,000
Chocola: Master, could we have a second taste test?

1053
01:09:42,000 --> 01:09:45,000
Vanilla: I would also like a second serving.

1054
01:09:45,000 --> 01:09:49,000
Kashou: Okay, okay. Understood. This is the last one, okay?

1055
01:09:49,000 --> 01:09:52,000
*This time, I gave each of them a small spoon.*

1056
01:09:52,000 --> 01:09:55,000
Chocola: Lick lick lick lick lick lick~!

1057
01:09:55,000 --> 01:09:58,000
Vanilla: Lick lick lick lick lick lick...!

1058
01:09:58,000 --> 01:10:00,000
*Fast -- just like a cat.*

1059
01:10:00,000 --> 01:10:04,000
*The two of them were wholeheartedly licking their spoons.*

1060
01:10:04,000 --> 01:10:08,000
*Well, I suppose their straightforwardness was sort of cute.*

1061
01:10:08,000 --> 01:10:14,000
Kashou: ... Well, even though I did ask for assistance, you two are just catgirls after all--

1062
01:10:14,000 --> 01:10:16,000
Chocola: Th-Th-Th-That's not true!!

1063
01:10:16,000 --> 01:10:18,000
Chocola: Chocola CAN help Master!!

1064
01:10:18,000 --> 01:10:23,000
Chocola: It's not like Chocola came here just so she could taste test it!!

1065
01:10:23,000 --> 01:10:28,000
Kashou: Uwah, don't jump up like that all of a sudden! It's dangerous!

1066
01:10:28,000 --> 01:10:34,000
Vanilla: I'm just a catgirl, so I'm fine with taste testing. Another serving, Master.

1067
01:10:34,000 --> 01:10:40,000
Kashou: Hey, Vanilla, don't just go and take more yourself! That's a lot more than a mere taste!

1068
01:10:40,000 --> 01:10:45,000
Chocola: It's okay! If you run out, Chocola will make a lot more, so don't worry!

1069
01:10:45,000 --> 01:10:53,000
Vanilla: Oh, Chocola is getting fired up. I'm compelled to be excited with expectation about this. Stop right there, Master.

1070
01:10:53,000 --> 01:10:57,000
Kashou: Nuwah, Vanilla, let go of me! All right, I'll make it!

1071
01:10:57,000 --> 01:11:03,000
Chocola: Chocola watched Master make it, so it will be all right! ♪ Leave it to Chocola!

1072
01:11:03,000 --> 01:11:07,000
Chocola: Uhm... First, you pour milk in the bowl... then, uhm...

1073
01:11:07,000 --> 01:11:11,000
Chocola: ... Then you put in sunflower seeds... was it?

1074
01:11:11,000 --> 01:11:15,000
Kashou: It's vanilla bean! The customers aren't hamsters, you know!

1075
01:11:15,000 --> 01:11:22,000
Vanilla: Chocola, since you have the opportunity, you should make a lot. Then we'll be in custard heaven.

1076
01:11:22,000 --> 01:11:25,000
Chocola: Roger that! Leave it to Chocola~!

1077
01:11:25,000 --> 01:11:31,000
Vanilla: Putting fresh cream in there should make it even more yummy. Leave it to me.

1078
01:11:31,000 --> 01:11:34,000
Chocola: Ah...! Hah...! Ah, wait, this is heavy...!!

1079
01:11:34,000 --> 01:11:40,000
Vanilla: Ah, Chocola. Could it be that this is what one might call extremely dangerou--

1080
01:11:40,000 --> 01:11:43,000
Chocola & Vanilla: Myaaaaaaaaaaaahhh!!!!!

1081
01:11:43,000 --> 01:11:45,000
Chocola: Meow~ ♪ Baths feel good~ ♪

1082
01:11:45,000 --> 01:11:49,000
Vanilla: Meowph...! Master, there's water in my eyes...!

1083
01:11:49,000 --> 01:11:55,000
Kashou: That's why I told you not to open your eyes. I'm going to wash you off again.

1084
01:11:55,000 --> 01:11:58,000
Vanilla: Myauuu~ I can't get used to baths meow...

1085
01:11:58,000 --> 01:12:02,000
Kashou: You reap what you sow, right? Come on, close your eyes.

1086
01:12:02,000 --> 01:12:07,000
*I washed all the milk and fresh cream off Chocola and Vanilla in the shower.*

1087
01:12:07,000 --> 01:12:12,000
Kashou: It's a small blessing that the damage was just limited to you two, huh?

1088
01:12:12,000 --> 01:12:16,000
Kashou: Although, cleaning the bakery up did take a lot of effort.

1089
01:12:16,000 --> 01:12:23,000
Chocola: Chocola is seowwy, but she's happy since it's been a long time since we've had a bath with Master~ ♪

1090
01:12:23,000 --> 01:12:26,000
Kashou: Ah, now that you mention it, that's true.

1091
01:12:26,000 --> 01:12:32,000
Vanilla: Considering that, Master's bathing techniques haven't improved even a bit... meowph?!

1092
01:12:32,000 --> 01:12:37,000
Kashou: Come on, you get that for opening your mouth. Just keep quiet for a bit.

1093
01:12:37,000 --> 01:12:41,000
Vanilla: Myauuu~ You're being unreasonable, Myaster...

1094
01:12:41,000 --> 01:12:46,000
*When they were young catgirls, I did occasionally bathe with them...*

1095
01:12:46,000 --> 01:12:52,000
*... but once they started to mature, I refrained from getting in the bath with them.*

1096
01:12:52,000 --> 01:12:56,000
*... It wasn't because I felt guilty or anything, though.*

1097
01:12:56,000 --> 01:13:03,000
*Ever since they were small, I've thought of them like little sisters -- maybe even daughters -- in a way.*

1098
01:13:03,000 --> 01:13:07,000
*... Besides, they've become more feminine to some degree, too.*

1099
01:13:07,000 --> 01:13:12,000
*Wait a minute, they're catgirls. What am I doing, thinking stuff like that?!*

1100
01:13:12,000 --> 01:13:16,000
Chocola: What's wrong, Master? You're shivering like a wet kitten.

1101
01:13:16,000 --> 01:13:18,000
Kashou: Huh? Ah, it's nothing at all.

1102
01:13:18,000 --> 01:13:23,000
Kashou: Uhh, right! I was just thinking that your hair has gotten longer.

1103
01:13:23,000 --> 01:13:31,000
Chocola: Shigure-chan said our hair had a nice gloss to it, so we should let it grow out. We've done so since then~ ♪

1104
01:13:31,000 --> 01:13:39,000
Chocola: The fact that Master noticed that it's gotten longer is because you haven't bathed with us in a long time, right~?

1105
01:13:39,000 --> 01:13:43,000
Vanilla: Master thinks it's a pain, so it can't be helped.

1106
01:13:43,000 --> 01:13:48,000
Vanilla: He's someone who doesn't listen to the requests of his catgirls.

1107
01:13:48,000 --> 01:13:53,000
Kashou: Though you two are catgirls, you're also maturing girls as well.

1108
01:13:53,000 --> 01:13:56,000
Kashou: Have some shame. At least a bit.

1109
01:13:56,000 --> 01:14:00,000
Chocola: Shay-mnh? Shigure-chan says that word from time to time...

1110
01:14:00,000 --> 01:14:05,000
Chocola: But when someone says that, nothing really comes to mind, meow~

1111
01:14:05,000 --> 01:14:13,000
Vanilla: For catgirls who haven't entered mating season yet, human emotions like those are difficult to understand.

1112
01:14:13,000 --> 01:14:18,000
Kashou: Sheesh, you two act like cats only when it's convenient, huh...

1113
01:14:18,000 --> 01:14:21,000
Kashou: Come on, I'll wash your heads now.

1114
01:14:21,000 --> 01:14:26,000
*With shampoo in my hands, I went to work it into a lather in their hair.*

1115
01:14:26,000 --> 01:14:32,000
*Their hair was beautiful and free of split ends thanks to Shigure's constant care.*

1116
01:14:32,000 --> 01:14:38,000
*Even to the untrained eye, I could see the merit in having them grow out their hair.*

1117
01:14:38,000 --> 01:14:43,000
Vanilla: Master, how can you say that when you're clearly happy about it? Pervert.

1118
01:14:43,000 --> 01:14:48,000
Chocola: Me-me-meow...?! Master, why are you looking at Chocola that way...?!

1119
01:14:48,000 --> 01:14:51,000
Vanilla: Heheh, you can't fool a catgirl's eyes.

1120
01:14:51,000 --> 01:14:55,000
Kashou: Your eyes have been closed the whole time though, Vanilla.

1121
01:14:55,000 --> 01:14:59,000
Kashou: Besides, to think I'd lust for catgirls like you two...

1122
01:14:59,000 --> 01:15:03,000
Kashou: ... when you're just like troublesome daughters to me!

1123
01:15:03,000 --> 01:15:08,000
Chocola: Meow~ ♪ So Master is our papa, then? That's not bad, either! ♪

1124
01:15:08,000 --> 01:15:12,000
Vanilla: It isn't a bad idea, so I'm willing to allow it.

1125
01:15:12,000 --> 01:15:14,000
Kashou: Yes, yes, it's my honor.

1126
01:15:14,000 --> 01:15:19,000
*Pleasant thoughts floated through my head as I stroked their hair.*

1127
01:15:19,000 --> 01:15:24,000
*The idea of taking care of cute daughters didn't sound so bad to me.*

1128
01:15:24,000 --> 01:15:29,000
*After all, even Shigure used to constantly follow me around long ago.*

1129
01:15:29,000 --> 01:15:34,000
*I suppose it's okay for me to say I'm rather good at taking care of others.*

1130
01:15:34,000 --> 01:15:43,000
Kashou: Come on, while I'm washing your hair, you'd better make sure to wash the rest of you, too! Don't forget your tails, either!

1131
01:15:43,000 --> 01:15:47,000
Chocola: Since we have the chance, please do it for us, Master~ ♪

1132
01:15:47,000 --> 01:15:51,000
Kashou: I already have my hands full with washing your hair.

1133
01:15:51,000 --> 01:15:56,000
Vanilla: Instead of our stingy master, why I don't I wash your tail as usual.

1134
01:15:56,000 --> 01:15:58,000
Kashou: Yeah, why don't you do that?

1135
01:15:58,000 --> 01:16:04,000
Kashou: I'm gonna pour water over you again. Close your eyes and mouth and hold your breath.

1136
01:16:04,000 --> 01:16:09,000
Vanilla: Meowph...! Master, you deliberately poured it on my face...!

1137
01:16:09,000 --> 01:16:12,000
Vanilla: Meow, it's in my ears...! M-Myaaaahhh...!

1138
01:16:12,000 --> 01:16:16,000
Chocola: Myahah~ ♪ Please give Chocola a shower too, Master! ♪

1139
01:16:16,000 --> 01:16:18,000
Kashou: Okay okay~ You're up next!

1140
01:16:18,000 --> 01:16:23,000
*... It was a lot of effort, but this kind of change of pace might've been good.*

1141
01:16:23,000 --> 01:16:27,000
*As I carefully washed their hair, that thought crossed my mind.*

1142
01:16:27,000 --> 01:16:32,000
Kashou: ... Okay, looks like the sponge cake dough has a good consistency.

1143
01:16:32,000 --> 01:16:37,000
*I covered the bowl of dough with plastic wrap and put it in the refrigerator.*

1144
01:16:37,000 --> 01:16:41,000
*It's not like we'll have a packed house on opening day...*

1145
01:16:41,000 --> 01:16:44,000
*... so this much dough should be enough.*

1146
01:16:44,000 --> 01:16:49,000
*All that was left was to be prepared for when the bakery actually opens.*

1147
01:16:49,000 --> 01:16:57,000
Kashou: Okay! The only thing that still needs to be done is to cut up the fruit for the toppings and then I'm done.

1148
01:16:57,000 --> 01:17:04,000
*I stretched and then looked at the clock. The hour hand had already moved from 11 o'clock to midnight.*

1149
01:17:04,000 --> 01:17:09,000
Kashou: Chocola, Vanilla. I'm almost done, so you two can go and sleep first--

1150
01:17:09,000 --> 01:17:10,000
Kashou: ...... Hmm?

1151
01:17:10,000 --> 01:17:12,000
Chocola: Hwah... hwah...

1152
01:17:12,000 --> 01:17:13,000
Vanilla: Zzz... Zzz...

1153
01:17:13,000 --> 01:17:18,000
*I looked over my shoulder to see the two of them sleeping fitfully on the sofa.*

1154
01:17:18,000 --> 01:17:24,000
*They leaned against each other cozily, smiling as if in the middle of a wonderful dream.*

1155
01:17:24,000 --> 01:17:28,000
Kashou: ... And they said they'd be awake until I finished.

1156
01:17:28,000 --> 01:17:33,000
*They'd been full of activity since the morning, so they were probably exhausted.*

1157
01:17:33,000 --> 01:17:36,000
*I crouched down and poked both of their cheeks.*

1158
01:17:36,000 --> 01:17:38,000
Chocola: Mmm... yesh, welcome...

1159
01:17:38,000 --> 01:17:43,000
Chocola: Chocola is La Sholeil's poster catgirl, Chocoleth... ♪ Zzz...

1160
01:17:43,000 --> 01:17:46,000
Vanilla: Meow... Master, we're... out of tea...

1161
01:17:46,000 --> 01:17:51,000
Vanilla: Hurry up and bake the next cakes... Huhree huhree... Zzz...

1162
01:17:51,000 --> 01:17:56,000
*Chocola and Vanilla were one step ahead, acting as waitresses in their dreams.*

1163
01:17:56,000 --> 01:18:00,000
*It sounded like they were in a rush, as if La Soleil was packed.*

1164
01:18:00,000 --> 01:18:04,000
Kashou: ... They really are still children, aren't they.

1165
01:18:04,000 --> 01:18:08,000
*They were cute, like children excited before the start of a trip.*

1166
01:18:08,000 --> 01:18:11,000
*I gently rubbed them both on the head...*

1167
01:18:11,000 --> 01:18:16,000
*... and the sweet smell of their leave-in hair treatment tickled my nose.*

1168
01:18:16,000 --> 01:18:21,000
Kashou: Come on, you two. You can't sleep here, okay? You're going to bed.

1169
01:18:21,000 --> 01:18:27,000
Chocola: Meowmmnn... You shouldn't touch Chocola while we're working, Master... ♪ Zzz...

1170
01:18:27,000 --> 01:18:33,000
Vanilla: That's... sexual harassment... Master, you can't do that to customers... Zzz...

1171
01:18:33,000 --> 01:18:36,000
Vanilla: Even I'm holding back... Zzz...

1172
01:18:36,000 --> 01:18:39,000
Kashou: What are you two talking about?

1173
01:18:39,000 --> 01:18:43,000
*It didn't look like they had any intention of waking up.*

1174
01:18:43,000 --> 01:18:49,000
*Without any other choice, I picked them up one at a time and carried them to the bedroom.*

1175
01:18:49,000 --> 01:18:52,000
Chocola: Zzz... zzz... Master... zzz...

1176
01:18:52,000 --> 01:18:55,000
Vanilla: Meowmh... Chocola... zzz... zzz...

1177
01:18:55,000 --> 01:18:58,000
Kashou: You two really are a handful...

1178
01:18:58,000 --> 01:19:02,000
*I covered the two closely curled up catgirls with a blanket.*

1179
01:19:02,000 --> 01:19:07,000
*Once more, I gently rubbed their heads before I quietly closed the bedroom door.*

1180
01:19:07,000 --> 01:19:09,000
Kashou: ... Okay, just one last bit!

1181
01:19:09,000 --> 01:19:13,000
*Alone in the living room, I stretched and took a deep breath.*

1182
01:19:13,000 --> 01:19:19,000
Kashou: I need to work even harder tomorrow... for Chocola and Vanilla's sake, too.

1183
01:19:19,000 --> 01:19:26,000
*As I murmured the names of my precious family members, I stretched my hands out and continued my preparations.*

1184
01:19:26,000 --> 01:19:29,000
Chocola: Master! Someone is approaching the bakery!

1185
01:19:29,000 --> 01:19:33,000
Chocola: Everyone in battle stances?! Are... you... ready?!

1186
01:19:33,000 --> 01:19:39,000
Vanilla: It would be quicker to go forth and capture them. I'll do it well, so leave it to me.

1187
01:19:39,000 --> 01:19:43,000
Kashou: Wait, wait, wait. It's only been 5 minutes since we opened!

1188
01:19:43,000 --> 01:19:47,000
*The two of them hid by the window as if stalking prey.*

1189
01:19:47,000 --> 01:19:54,000
*Even though we're finally open, there were -- unsurprisingly -- no customers waiting to come in.*

1190
01:19:54,000 --> 01:20:00,000
*I placed my elbows on the counter while I gazed at the backs of the two catgirls.*

1191
01:20:00,000 --> 01:20:06,000
Kashou: It's fine if you wait for the customers to come in before interacting with them.

1192
01:20:06,000 --> 01:20:12,000
Kashou: If you brace yourself like that from the start, then you'll get tired quickly.

1193
01:20:12,000 --> 01:20:16,000
Chocola: Vanilla, look! That girl walking over there!

1194
01:20:16,000 --> 01:20:20,000
Chocola: She looks like someone who really likes sweets!

1195
01:20:20,000 --> 01:20:25,000
Vanilla: Ohh, sweets! But Chocola, that's not really a nice thing to say.

1196
01:20:25,000 --> 01:20:30,000
Vanilla: You should be careful of saying that in front of customers.

1197
01:20:30,000 --> 01:20:33,000
Kashou: ... Not that she can hear you.

1198
01:20:33,000 --> 01:20:37,000
*The two catgirls didn't so much as turn an ear in my direction.*

1199
01:20:37,000 --> 01:20:42,000
*Well, to see them that hopeful for customers did pain me a bit as their owner.*

1200
01:20:42,000 --> 01:20:46,000
Kashou: Well, since we just started, we should be patient--

1201
01:20:46,000 --> 01:20:48,000
Female Customer: Excuse me.

1202
01:20:48,000 --> 01:20:52,000
Chocola & Vanilla: M-Meow, w-welcommmmme!!\nM-Meow, w-welcome!!

1203
01:20:52,000 --> 01:20:55,000
Female Customer: Hyaaaaah?! Wh-Wh-What is going on?!

1204
01:20:55,000 --> 01:20:58,000
Chocola: W-What would you like to meowrder?!

1205
01:20:58,000 --> 01:21:03,000
Chocola: Ah, o-our special is that... that thing! Uhm, that!! Cake!!

1206
01:21:03,000 --> 01:21:08,000
Vanilla: We also have black tea...! Uhm, the warm kind and the cold kind...!

1207
01:21:08,000 --> 01:21:12,000
Vanilla: U-Uhm, the hot kind and uhm, the cold kind...!!

1208
01:21:12,000 --> 01:21:14,000
Kashou: Will you two calm down?

1209
01:21:14,000 --> 01:21:20,000
*I pulled them back after they quickly set themselves upon the customer who'd just walked in.*

1210
01:21:20,000 --> 01:21:25,000
Kashou: I'm terribly sorry for that. I'm the owner of this bakery, Minaduki.

1211
01:21:25,000 --> 01:21:29,000
Kashou: Our menu is over here. Please peruse it at your leisur--

1212
01:21:29,000 --> 01:21:30,000
Kashou: ...... Hmm?

1213
01:21:30,000 --> 01:21:31,000
Kashou: ... Miss...?

1214
01:21:31,000 --> 01:21:39,000
Female Customer: Hrmm, hrmm. Taking into account the location and use of color, this is quite a splendid storefront.

1215
01:21:39,000 --> 01:21:49,000
Female Customer: The introspective feel makes for a simple basis of design, while the knick knacks and such create a relaxing atmosphere. How wonderful!

1216
01:21:49,000 --> 01:21:55,000
*There was an uncharacteristically large pair of glasses that didn't suit her face or build.*

1217
01:21:55,000 --> 01:22:00,000
*Then there was her anachronistic Taisho-era mantle and military cap.*

1218
01:22:00,000 --> 01:22:06,000
*Finally, there was her grandiose way of speaking, which didn't match the familiar voice.*

1219
01:22:06,000 --> 01:22:13,000
Female Customer: Hrmm, I've taken a liking to this place! I shall buy every cake you have available!

1220
01:22:13,000 --> 01:22:18,000
Female Customer: Now then, good sir, you may pack up all the cakes here!

1221
01:22:18,000 --> 01:22:21,000
Female Customer: Ah, you do take credit cards, yes?

1222
01:22:21,000 --> 01:22:24,000
Kashou: Uh, Shigure, what are you doing?

1223
01:22:24,000 --> 01:22:30,000
Shigure?: Ha ha ha! Who is this Shigure? Sir, you must have mistaken me for someone else!

1224
01:22:30,000 --> 01:22:33,000
Kashou: Say what you like, but that's your name.

1225
01:22:33,000 --> 01:22:43,000
Shigure?: There's no way a young lass, such a pretty and earnest little sister to her older brother, would grace such a place like this with her presence!

1226
01:22:43,000 --> 01:22:51,000
Shigure?: Very well, I won't pay heed to such rudeness! There's no reason to put a damper on your grand opening, after all!

1227
01:22:51,000 --> 01:22:55,000
Kashou: In that case, could you cut the crazy routine?

1228
01:22:55,000 --> 01:22:59,000
Kashou: Besides, how did you even know where my bakery is?

1229
01:22:59,000 --> 01:23:01,000
Kashou: I didn't tell anyone.

1230
01:23:01,000 --> 01:23:09,000
Shigure?: I-In any case, just scurry along and prepare all the cakes that you have! I will pay your asking price!! Quickly!!

1231
01:23:09,000 --> 01:23:11,000
Kashou: What, now you're a robber?

1232
01:23:11,000 --> 01:23:16,000
Shigure?: What rudeness to only show deference to certain customers!

1233
01:23:16,000 --> 01:23:24,000
Shigure?: That attitude might chase away, say, a high-class customer who'd come in every day at opening and buy you out!

1234
01:23:24,000 --> 01:23:32,000
Shigure?: When it comes to business, you won't get anywhere if you don't jump at every opportunity to make money!

1235
01:23:32,000 --> 01:23:38,000
Shigure?: Besides, to see Nii-sama give me such a cold look is making me sad! I'm sad!

1236
01:23:38,000 --> 01:23:44,000
Shigure?: And after I held back until today to do something to help you too...! Uuuu...!!

1237
01:23:44,000 --> 01:23:47,000
Kashou: Look, I'm not being picky here...

1238
01:23:47,000 --> 01:23:52,000
*Not only had she now burst into tears, but her façade was in shambles.*

1239
01:23:52,000 --> 01:23:54,000
*I had no clue what to say.*

1240
01:23:54,000 --> 01:23:59,000
Chocola: Ah, Shigure-chan~! It's been a while~ ♪ How have you been~?!

1241
01:23:59,000 --> 01:24:04,000
Vanilla: Shigure, what's with that outfit? Is that what people are wearing now?

1242
01:24:04,000 --> 01:24:09,000
Shigure?: Y-You're mistaken! I am not this Shigure-chan you speak of...!

1243
01:24:09,000 --> 01:24:13,000
Shigure?: Ah, stop! Don't pull on my cloak... ahh, ah... wait.

1244
01:24:13,000 --> 01:24:14,000
Shigure?: Ahhhh--!

1245
01:24:14,000 --> 01:24:17,000
Azuki: Yo. It's been a few days, Chocola, Vanilla.

1246
01:24:17,000 --> 01:24:23,000
Maple: Oh, are those your uniforms? Aren't they cute~ Talk about dressing to suit your body type!

1247
01:24:23,000 --> 01:24:26,000
Cinnamon: I'm glad that you two are doing well.

1248
01:24:26,000 --> 01:24:31,000
Cinnamon: I got worried when you two suddenly disappeared, you know~?

1249
01:24:31,000 --> 01:24:34,000
Coconut: Yeah, we were really, really worried!

1250
01:24:34,000 --> 01:24:39,000
Coconut: You should've just told us you were going with Kashou-sama.

1251
01:24:39,000 --> 01:24:43,000
Chocola: Ahaha, sorry! It was kind of a spur-of-the-moment thing.

1252
01:24:43,000 --> 01:24:50,000
Vanilla: If we can see each other again, then it's not a problem. I'm glad that everyone is doing well.

1253
01:24:50,000 --> 01:24:57,000
Shigure: Mmhmm! Seeing the catgirls having a happy, emotional reunion together is simply the best!

1254
01:24:57,000 --> 01:24:59,000
Kashou: The best, you say...

1255
01:24:59,000 --> 01:25:02,000
*Suddenly, the bakery was at max capacity.*

1256
01:25:02,000 --> 01:25:06,000
*Not to mention they were all family... uninvited family, at that.*

1257
01:25:06,000 --> 01:25:11,000
Shigure: It's been a while, Nii-sama. I'm relieved to see that you are doing well.

1258
01:25:11,000 --> 01:25:15,000
*As usual, Shigure smiled and greeted me with polite words.*

1259
01:25:15,000 --> 01:25:19,000
*My little sister is, as a rule, calm and courteous.*

1260
01:25:19,000 --> 01:25:22,000
*There are times when she acts strange, though.*

1261
01:25:22,000 --> 01:25:24,000
Kashou: It's only been a few days.

1262
01:25:24,000 --> 01:25:28,000
Kashou: How did you even find this place? I didn't tell you.

1263
01:25:28,000 --> 01:25:33,000
Shigure: That is a foolish question to ask your own little sister, Nii-sama.

1264
01:25:33,000 --> 01:25:37,000
Shigure: Let's just say it was the power of a little sister's love~

1265
01:25:37,000 --> 01:25:41,000
Kashou: Look, I don't have time for that stuff right now.

1266
01:25:41,000 --> 01:25:47,000
Shigure: Please stop insisting that this is an act! Shigure is being honest~ ... Oopsie.

1267
01:25:47,000 --> 01:25:50,000
*Shigure placed her hand over her mouth.*

1268
01:25:50,000 --> 01:25:54,000
*A piece of paper fell from her kimono to the ground.*

1269
01:25:54,000 --> 01:25:56,000
Kashou: What is that...

1270
01:25:56,000 --> 01:26:00,000
Shigure: It's a wonderful business card. How like you, Nii-sama.

1271
01:26:00,000 --> 01:26:03,000
Kashou: Wait, I haven't distributed these yet.

1272
01:26:03,000 --> 01:26:06,000
*As I said that, I suddenly realized something.*

1273
01:26:06,000 --> 01:26:09,000
Kashou: ... This is your doing, isn't it, Vanilla?

1274
01:26:09,000 --> 01:26:16,000
Vanilla: This was in exchange for us being allowed to go with you when you moved. It was a necessary evil.

1275
01:26:16,000 --> 01:26:24,000
*So when she disappeared at the drugstore the other day, she had slipped out to send the card to Shigure, huh...*

1276
01:26:24,000 --> 01:26:29,000
*That's why she had said "Objective achieved" and evaded my question.*

1277
01:26:29,000 --> 01:26:33,000
Kashou: So earlier, when I couldn't get ahold of you...

1278
01:26:33,000 --> 01:26:39,000
Kashou: ... and Chocola and Vanilla stowing away in the boxes... this was all part of your plan?

1279
01:26:39,000 --> 01:26:42,000
Shigure: Yes, that is absolutely correct.

1280
01:26:42,000 --> 01:26:46,000
Shigure: In other words, Chocola and Vanilla did nothing wrong.

1281
01:26:46,000 --> 01:26:52,000
Shigure: So, if you are going to scold your bad little sister, I ask that you be firm yet kind.

1282
01:26:52,000 --> 01:26:55,000
Kashou: What do you mean, "firm yet kind..."

1283
01:26:55,000 --> 01:26:59,000
*Sometimes, I have no idea what my little sister is talking about.*

1284
01:26:59,000 --> 01:27:03,000
*Well, she's always been like this, so I let it slide. Still...*

1285
01:27:03,000 --> 01:27:09,000
Kashou: ... Well, it was also wrong of me to move out without saying anything to you.

1286
01:27:09,000 --> 01:27:12,000
*I awkwardly scratched my cheek while looking away.*

1287
01:27:12,000 --> 01:27:19,000
*She's been such a clingy, adoring little sister in the past that people even made fun of her for it.*

1288
01:27:19,000 --> 01:27:23,000
*That is why I had to use such a roundabout, high-handed tactic.*

1289
01:27:23,000 --> 01:27:28,000
*In a sense, she worried about me more than even Chocola and Vanilla.*

1290
01:27:28,000 --> 01:27:31,000
*That's why I didn't really feel like complaining.*

1291
01:27:31,000 --> 01:27:32,000
Shigure: Nii-sama...

1292
01:27:32,000 --> 01:27:39,000
Shigure: ... It was. Shigure has been rather worried about you, Nii-sama. I'm glad you are in good health.

1293
01:27:39,000 --> 01:27:43,000
Kashou: It's only been a few days, so nothing's really happened.

1294
01:27:43,000 --> 01:27:47,000
*Shigure had a gallant smile on her face as I rubbed her head.*

1295
01:27:47,000 --> 01:27:54,000
*She let out a small laugh and smiled -- it must have felt as good for her as it does for the catgirls.*

1296
01:27:54,000 --> 01:28:00,000
Azuki: Oh, Kashou. Why so reserved? It's not like Shigure's a stranger or something.

1297
01:28:00,000 --> 01:28:04,000
Azuki: Shigure's really been uneasy these last few days, you know?

1298
01:28:04,000 --> 01:28:07,000
Azuki: Enough to forget about our food.

1299
01:28:07,000 --> 01:28:10,000
Maple: Listen, she really was worried.

1300
01:28:10,000 --> 01:28:17,000
Maple: She'd just pace around the room in circles like an animal in a cage and sigh. Lots of sighing.

1301
01:28:17,000 --> 01:28:22,000
Maple: It would have been better if you would at least had told her your address.

1302
01:28:22,000 --> 01:28:28,000
Maple: Unless you wanted to cut ties with us... but that would be something else entirely.

1303
01:28:28,000 --> 01:28:36,000
Azuki: Well, we know why he did it, right? It's because he thought he'd look cool if he left by himself without telling anyone.

1304
01:28:36,000 --> 01:28:41,000
Maple: Ah, probably! Probably that! Human males really are troublesome, huh?

1305
01:28:41,000 --> 01:28:46,000
*The two of them deliberately raised their hands and grinned at me bitterly.*

1306
01:28:46,000 --> 01:28:52,000
*Azuki and Maple were being a little too harsh, but even so, I didn't try to argue it.*

1307
01:28:52,000 --> 01:28:55,000
Kashou: Sorry about that, Azuki, Maple.

1308
01:28:55,000 --> 01:28:59,000
Kashou: I already feel guilty enough as it is, so lay off, okay?

1309
01:28:59,000 --> 01:29:04,000
Cinnamon: Ahaha! But Azu-chan and Mei-chan were really worried too, you know~

1310
01:29:04,000 --> 01:29:12,000
Cinnamon: The two of them went hunting for Kashou-san's name in Shigure-chan's computer and cell phone frantically~ ♪

1311
01:29:12,000 --> 01:29:17,000
Coconut: Humph. The two of them aren't very honest, despite being older.

1312
01:29:17,000 --> 01:29:23,000
Coconut: But if it came to it, I was ready to go searching for you instead of Shigure.

1313
01:29:23,000 --> 01:29:27,000
Kashou: Cinnamon, Coconut, I'm sorry to have worried you guys, too.

1314
01:29:27,000 --> 01:29:31,000
Kashou: It won't happen again, so please cut me some slack.

1315
01:29:31,000 --> 01:29:34,000
*I lowered my head towards Cinnamon and Coconut.*

1316
01:29:34,000 --> 01:29:38,000
*And just like that, all the catgirls in my family were assembled.*

1317
01:29:38,000 --> 01:29:42,000
*I appreciated the warmth of having my family here right now.*

1318
01:29:42,000 --> 01:29:46,000
Shigure: I won't let Father know about this, so please don't worry.

1319
01:29:46,000 --> 01:29:51,000
Kashou: Ahh, I appreciate it. You've been through a lot, too. Sorry.

1320
01:29:51,000 --> 01:29:53,000
Shigure: It was nothing.

1321
01:29:53,000 --> 01:29:58,000
Shigure: I will always come and visit you, Nii-sama. I'll be cheering you on.

1322
01:29:58,000 --> 01:30:01,000
*She wrapped her small hands around my hand.*

1323
01:30:01,000 --> 01:30:06,000
*She didn't say anything about me slipping out without telling anyone.*

1324
01:30:06,000 --> 01:30:08,000
*She simply just forgave me.*

1325
01:30:08,000 --> 01:30:13,000
*Even my little sister seems to have grown up well. Flawless, at that.*

1326
01:30:13,000 --> 01:30:17,000
Shigure: However, Mother is rather worried about you, Nii-sama.

1327
01:30:17,000 --> 01:30:23,000
Shigure: Once things settle down, it would put her at ease if you'd call her at least once.

1328
01:30:23,000 --> 01:30:25,000
Kashou: All right. I'll do that.

1329
01:30:25,000 --> 01:30:28,000
Shigure: Okay! Let's pinky-swear on it.

1330
01:30:28,000 --> 01:30:35,000
*We linked our pinky fingers together. When we were little, we always made promises with a pinky-swear.*

1331
01:30:35,000 --> 01:30:40,000
*Shigure smiled like a mischievous child once we'd done this. It was rather cute.*

1332
01:30:40,000 --> 01:30:46,000
Shigure: ... I was sort of looking forward to some gentle scolding from Nii-sama, though.

1333
01:30:46,000 --> 01:30:49,000
Kashou: My wonderful little sister is so spoiled.

1334
01:30:49,000 --> 01:30:52,000
*Well, even so, she's still my little sister.*

1335
01:30:52,000 --> 01:30:57,000
*Things always seemed to go this way between us, so we didn't mind.*

1336
01:30:57,000 --> 01:31:01,000
Shigure: But honestly, this is a fine and lovely bakery.

1337
01:31:01,000 --> 01:31:06,000
Shigure: I'm happy my beloved Nii-sama no longer has to hide his love of baking.

1338
01:31:06,000 --> 01:31:12,000
Kashou: You and the catgirls have been helping to destroy all the evidence, though.

1339
01:31:12,000 --> 01:31:21,000
Shigure: Huhu~ That's because while I do like the traditional candy our family makes, Nii-sama's cakes are number one in the world.

1340
01:31:21,000 --> 01:31:28,000
Shigure: ... Even though the thought of Nii-sama never returning home makes me sick with loneliness...

1341
01:31:28,000 --> 01:31:33,000
Shigure: ... I'm sure many customers will come to show their love for this bakery.

1342
01:31:33,000 --> 01:31:36,000
*She said that with a slightly troubled smile.*

1343
01:31:36,000 --> 01:31:41,000
*Shigure, Chocola, and Vanilla said the same thing with the same smile.*

1344
01:31:41,000 --> 01:31:45,000
Kashou: It would be nice if everything would go that smoothly.

1345
01:31:45,000 --> 01:31:52,000
*Just like before with Chocola and Vanilla, I rubbed her head and said the same thing I had told them.*

1346
01:31:52,000 --> 01:31:58,000
Shigure: Wow~ This is the first time I've seen the kitchen of a Western-style confectionery!

1347
01:31:58,000 --> 01:32:04,000
Shigure: It's not fitted out quite like the Minadukis' traditional candymaking kitchen, is it...

1348
01:32:04,000 --> 01:32:11,000
*Shigure seemed really intrigued as she looked around at the mixers, rollers, and other tools in the kitchen.*

1349
01:32:11,000 --> 01:32:17,000
*There was a lot of similar equipment, of course, but there were minute differences.*

1350
01:32:17,000 --> 01:32:21,000
Shigure: Nii-sama, this is where you make cakes, isn't it?

1351
01:32:21,000 --> 01:32:30,000
Shigure: I prefer seeing Nii-sama in traditional Japanese clothing, but I'm sure you in your bakery uniform will make girls' hearts sing, too.

1352
01:32:30,000 --> 01:32:37,000
Shigure: Ahh...! If I could, I would install a live camera so I could watch my beloved Nii-sama 24/7...!

1353
01:32:37,000 --> 01:32:40,000
Kashou: There's no way I'd be okay with that.

1354
01:32:40,000 --> 01:32:45,000
*Not that there was any way I'd be there baking for 24 hours straight.*

1355
01:32:45,000 --> 01:32:49,000
*As usual, my little sister said some pretty questionable things.*

1356
01:32:49,000 --> 01:32:54,000
Shigure: ... But I am glad that both Chocola and Vanilla are doing well.

1357
01:32:54,000 --> 01:32:58,000
Shigure: I had no doubt that you'd let them stay, Nii-sama. Teehee~

1358
01:32:58,000 --> 01:33:04,000
*Shigure took the book on raising catgirls that had been left in the kitchen and giggled.*

1359
01:33:04,000 --> 01:33:09,000
Kashou: I'm just learning, so there's still lots of stuff I don't understand.

1360
01:33:09,000 --> 01:33:16,000
*Once I'd read the book, I'd realized once again that my family's catgirls were particularly excellent.*

1361
01:33:16,000 --> 01:33:25,000
*Apparently, the fact that they were fluent in our language and able to live comfortably with humans made them quite exceptional.*

1362
01:33:25,000 --> 01:33:33,000
Kashou: The more I read, the more I realize how much of an education freak you are, and just how well you raised them.

1363
01:33:33,000 --> 01:33:40,000
Shigure: It's all because of their strict upbringing mixed with love. It was for their sakes as well.

1364
01:33:40,000 --> 01:33:45,000
*She spoke like a mother, closing her eyes and tapping her chest proudly.*

1365
01:33:45,000 --> 01:33:52,000
*Although she was young, I could see that she was reliable and confident enough to raise six catgirls.*

1366
01:33:52,000 --> 01:33:57,000
*Seeing that unexpected side of Shigure made me proud to be her older brother.*

1367
01:33:57,000 --> 01:34:01,000
Kashou: I will take responsibility and act as a good owner.

1368
01:34:01,000 --> 01:34:04,000
Shigure: Yes, I don't doubt that one bit, Nii-sama.

1369
01:34:04,000 --> 01:34:11,000
Shigure: But if you're going to get them working in this bakery, certain qualifications are necessary.

1370
01:34:11,000 --> 01:34:16,000
Kashou: Qualifications? Are you talking about a cooking certification?

1371
01:34:16,000 --> 01:34:20,000
Shigure: Teehee~ Not that, Nii-sama. It isn't that...

1372
01:34:20,000 --> 01:34:25,000
Shigure: Regarding, allowing catgirls to work independently as employees...

1373
01:34:25,000 --> 01:34:31,000
Shigure: A catgirl needs to have an "Independent Action Permit" in terms of qualifications.

1374
01:34:31,000 --> 01:34:37,000
Shigure: Without that permit, a catgirl can be arrested by the police if they are out and about.

1375
01:34:37,000 --> 01:34:41,000
Shigure: Besides, they can't be employed without that permit.

1376
01:34:41,000 --> 01:34:45,000
Shigure: Working for free is a different story, though.

1377
01:34:45,000 --> 01:34:52,000
Kashou: A permit... but our family's catgirls have never had one of those when they leave home, right?

1378
01:34:52,000 --> 01:34:58,000
*I tried to remember the times when our family's catgirls went out while under Shigure's watch.*

1379
01:34:58,000 --> 01:35:02,000
*I really didn't recall seeing any sort of permits...*

1380
01:35:02,000 --> 01:35:05,000
Shigure: Teehee, everyone always has it on them.

1381
01:35:05,000 --> 01:35:09,000
Shigure: Now then, Nii-sama, if you'll come this way...

1382
01:35:09,000 --> 01:35:13,000
*At Shigure's urging, we stepped out of the kitchen.*

1383
01:35:13,000 --> 01:35:16,000
Kashou: Wow, so the Bell is their permit...

1384
01:35:16,000 --> 01:35:20,000
Maple: Well, catgirls don't carry anything except their Bell.

1385
01:35:20,000 --> 01:35:26,000
Maple: It's inconvenient to not be able to go about freely, so we kind of have to keep it on us.

1386
01:35:26,000 --> 01:35:30,000
Azuki: That means we were selected out of a bunch of catgirls!

1387
01:35:30,000 --> 01:35:34,000
Azuki: That is why we're different from other catgirls!

1388
01:35:34,000 --> 01:35:38,000
Cinnamon: They say that only one in ten catgirls pass, you know~

1389
01:35:38,000 --> 01:35:42,000
Cinnamon: The studying was so hard! I was totally fed up with it~

1390
01:35:42,000 --> 01:35:46,000
Coconut: Belonging to Shigure-sama and not having a Bell...

1391
01:35:46,000 --> 01:35:50,000
Coconut: ... would be an embarrassment to our master.

1392
01:35:50,000 --> 01:35:52,000
*Everyone proudly shook their Bells.*

1393
01:35:52,000 --> 01:35:55,000
*I never knew the Bell had that sort of meaning.*

1394
01:35:55,000 --> 01:35:58,000
*I thought it was just Shigure's preference...*

1395
01:35:58,000 --> 01:36:04,000
Shigure: It can be shown in place of catgirl identification papers, so it is rather convenient.

1396
01:36:04,000 --> 01:36:09,000
Shigure: It allows them to enter buildings and events where pets aren't allowed.

1397
01:36:09,000 --> 01:36:13,000
Shigure: It also has a GPS feature, so they won't get lost.

1398
01:36:13,000 --> 01:36:18,000
Shigure: There shouldn't be any complaints if they work inside your store a bit...

1399
01:36:18,000 --> 01:36:26,000
Shigure: ... but if you intend to employ them officially, you should make sure they have the proper qualifications.

1400
01:36:26,000 --> 01:36:31,000
Kashou: I see. There's a lot to deal with when it comes to catgirls.

1401
01:36:31,000 --> 01:36:36,000
*As an owner, I'd better take everything Shigure was teaching me to heart.*

1402
01:36:36,000 --> 01:36:42,000
Shigure: I was just thinking it was about time to have Chocola and Vanilla get their Bells.

1403
01:36:42,000 --> 01:36:45,000
Shigure: So this might be perfect timing.

1404
01:36:45,000 --> 01:36:47,000
Shigure: Right, Chocola, Vanilla?

1405
01:36:47,000 --> 01:36:52,000
Chocola: If we can be of help to Master, then we'll do our best! We really will~!

1406
01:36:52,000 --> 01:36:58,000
Vanilla: This way, we'll be able to go out with everyone. It's lonely without company.

1407
01:36:58,000 --> 01:37:04,000
Shigure: Of course, Nii-sama, as their owner you will also need to assist them, okay?

1408
01:37:04,000 --> 01:37:08,000
Kashou: Yeah. Just pampering them won't do them any good, right?

1409
01:37:08,000 --> 01:37:10,000
Shigure: Exactly, teehee!

1410
01:37:10,000 --> 01:37:15,000
Shigure: Learning more about human society will lead to a richer life.

1411
01:37:15,000 --> 01:37:21,000
Chocola: Yay~! When Chocola has a Bell, Chocola wants to go to an amusement park with Master!

1412
01:37:21,000 --> 01:37:26,000
Vanilla: Amusement parks are fine too, but I want to go to an aquarium.

1413
01:37:26,000 --> 01:37:30,000
Vanilla: I want to see dolphins, penguins, and blue whales.

1414
01:37:30,000 --> 01:37:34,000
Kashou: There aren't any aquariums that have blue whales, though.

1415
01:37:34,000 --> 01:37:42,000
Coconut: Yep, yep! I was always left behind at home before I got my Bell, so I know all too well what it's like to be lonely.

1416
01:37:42,000 --> 01:37:48,000
Coconut: I'll cheer for you two, so do your best and pass it in one shot, Chocola, Vanilla!

1417
01:37:48,000 --> 01:37:53,000
Azuki: Yeah, yeah~ That's why this big-headed Maine Coon is troublesome, right...

1418
01:37:53,000 --> 01:37:59,000
Azuki: It's not a matter of how many times it takes you to pass or what kind of Bell you get.

1419
01:37:59,000 --> 01:38:06,000
Azuki: What's important is being proud of yourself and not acting so immature that you reveal your upbringing.

1420
01:38:06,000 --> 01:38:11,000
Azuki: If you do that, you might as well just go eat baby food, heh!

1421
01:38:11,000 --> 01:38:18,000
Coconut: You failed the test twice yourself, Azuki, so there's no reason to feel inferior about it.

1422
01:38:18,000 --> 01:38:25,000
Coconut: Ah, or could it be that you're at a disadvantage because of your stubby little arms and legs~?

1423
01:38:25,000 --> 01:38:30,000
Azuki: The hell did you say?! Those are the trademark of a Munchkin catgirl!!

1424
01:38:30,000 --> 01:38:36,000
Azuki: You damn brats are twenty million years too young to talk cat with me, you gobby fish!!

1425
01:38:36,000 --> 01:38:41,000
Coconut: I'm not going to treat you like my senior just because you're older.

1426
01:38:41,000 --> 01:38:45,000
Coconut: If you want me to respect you, then give me a reason to.

1427
01:38:45,000 --> 01:38:49,000
Chocola: F-Fighting isn't allowed~! Calm down, you two! Okay?!

1428
01:38:49,000 --> 01:38:54,000
Cinnamon: Th-That's right~! If you get too stressed, you'll get bald spots~!

1429
01:38:54,000 --> 01:38:59,000
Chocola: Ah, Chocola knows! There's that toy that Master bought the other day!

1430
01:38:59,000 --> 01:39:05,000
Chocola: If they play with it, they'll get distracted and everything will be fine, right, right?!

1431
01:39:05,000 --> 01:39:11,000
Maple: Azuki and Coconut really don't get tired of fighting like this day in and day out, huh.

1432
01:39:11,000 --> 01:39:17,000
Maple: Ah, geez. If you're going to fight and kick up dust, then do it outside. Out-si-de!

1433
01:39:17,000 --> 01:39:22,000
Vanilla: Just another normal day for the Minaduki family. And for La Soleil, too.

1434
01:39:22,000 --> 01:39:28,000
Vanilla: Maple, I'm going to go make some tea. What would you like? Our speciality is Darjeelimy.

1435
01:39:28,000 --> 01:39:32,000
Maple: Vanilla, you're cute when you're obedient like that.

1436
01:39:32,000 --> 01:39:38,000
Maple: All right, I'll take you up on your recommendation. Also, it's called Darjeeling, okay?

1437
01:39:38,000 --> 01:39:43,000
Vanilla: O-kay, leave it to me. Maple will be the first customer I pour tea for.

1438
01:39:43,000 --> 01:39:44,000
Kashou: ......

1439
01:39:44,000 --> 01:39:49,000
*... Seen from this angle, none of this seemed particularly intelligent.*

1440
01:39:49,000 --> 01:39:55,000
*The only accurate thing Vanilla said was that this was a normal day for the Minaduki family.*

1441
01:39:55,000 --> 01:40:00,000
*But it did make me think that things would be better outside instead.*

1442
01:40:00,000 --> 01:40:02,000
Shigure: Okay, no more fighting now~

1443
01:40:02,000 --> 01:40:04,000
All: Humph!Hm?Huh?\nHoe?Yes!Yes.

1444
01:40:04,000 --> 01:40:10,000
Shigure: Just what do you think you're doing, fighting on the day of Nii-sama's new start?

1445
01:40:10,000 --> 01:40:16,000
Shigure: As a Bell-carrying catgirl of the Minaduki family, you ought to be ashamed!

1446
01:40:16,000 --> 01:40:20,000
Chocola: Chocola and Vanilla don't have a Bell yet, though.

1447
01:40:20,000 --> 01:40:24,000
Vanilla: Right? So we don't feel embarrassed about it.

1448
01:40:24,000 --> 01:40:26,000
Maple: I wasn't fighting, either.

1449
01:40:26,000 --> 01:40:30,000
Maple: Haah~ It's because of the dummies that we got involved.

1450
01:40:30,000 --> 01:40:37,000
Azuki: What did you say, punk? That's big talk coming from the most skittish catgirl of the bunch of us!

1451
01:40:37,000 --> 01:40:45,000
Coconut: You can't even go to the bathroom at night without turning on all the lights in your bedroom and in the hallway!

1452
01:40:45,000 --> 01:40:52,000
Maple: Meowrgh! I told you I'm not the type of catgirl who has nocturnal instincts, you dumb catgirl!!

1453
01:40:52,000 --> 01:40:57,000
Cinnamon: That side of you is one of your cute points though, Mei-chan~

1454
01:40:57,000 --> 01:41:03,000
Cinnamon: That normally domineering side of you is starting to becoming cute, too~ ♪

1455
01:41:03,000 --> 01:41:10,000
Maple: Grrrahhh! How dare you make fun of me when you're the one in that stupid magical girl get-up?!

1456
01:41:10,000 --> 01:41:14,000
Maple: I'll upload your magic incantation video to YouChube!!

1457
01:41:14,000 --> 01:41:20,000
Cinnamon: Huwaaah?! Th-That's mean~ If that goes online, it'll be out there forever~!!

1458
01:41:20,000 --> 01:41:27,000
Cinnamon: And Shigure-chan said the magical girl look suited me, so what's wrong with it~?! Meowaaaahh~!!

1459
01:41:27,000 --> 01:41:31,000
Shigure: Okay okay okay okay okay! Silence! Silence!!

1460
01:41:31,000 --> 01:41:39,000
Shigure: Once again... today is a day of celebration for the start of Nii-sama's new life. I'm declaring it a new holiday.

1461
01:41:39,000 --> 01:41:43,000
Shigure: I have also already purchased all the cakes here.

1462
01:41:43,000 --> 01:41:48,000
Shigure: Therefore, for today only, you may all eat however many you'd like.

1463
01:41:48,000 --> 01:41:51,000
Azuki: For real, Shigure?! I can have two of them?!

1464
01:41:51,000 --> 01:41:54,000
Coconut: W-We can eat however many we like...?!

1465
01:41:54,000 --> 01:41:58,000
Coconut: So are you saying we can eat an entire cake ourselves...?!

1466
01:41:58,000 --> 01:42:02,000
Kashou: Yeah, she bought them all... huh? Wait, Shigure-san...?!

1467
01:42:02,000 --> 01:42:08,000
Maple: Since it's cake, could you get me some Earl Grey to go with it? Ah, lukewarm, of course.

1468
01:42:08,000 --> 01:42:14,000
Chocola: Okay~! Leave it to Chocola~ ♪ Master, Shigure-chan, are you fine with a black tea, too~?

1469
01:42:14,000 --> 01:42:18,000
Vanilla: I'll help. It'll be my first job as a poster catgirl.

1470
01:42:18,000 --> 01:42:22,000
Cinnamon: Yay~ ♪ I'll put up a "SOLD OUT - CLOSED" sign outside~ ♪

1471
01:42:22,000 --> 01:42:27,000
Kashou: No... hey, wait a minute...! H-Hey! I said to wait a moment!

1472
01:42:27,000 --> 01:42:32,000
Shigure: Nii-sama~? Your little sister is requesting that you feed her~ ♪

1473
01:42:32,000 --> 01:42:37,000
Shigure: I think that would be a nice bonus for this large purchase. Ahnn~! ♪

1474
01:42:37,000 --> 01:42:40,000
Azuki: Woahh?! It's good... This is really good!!

1475
01:42:40,000 --> 01:42:44,000
Azuki: Hey, Kashou! You're not bad, aren't ya? Armph, munch munch!!

1476
01:42:44,000 --> 01:42:52,000
Coconut: Fuwahh... ♪ To think that there would be a day in my catgirl-life that I could eat a whole cake myself...!

1477
01:42:52,000 --> 01:42:58,000
Coconut: Ahh, happiness! I am so incredibly, incredibly happy right now...! Munch, munch...!

1478
01:42:58,000 --> 01:43:04,000
Maple: Mmm~ What a wonderful smell. For a cat's tongue, lukewarm is definitely best, right~ ♪

1479
01:43:04,000 --> 01:43:07,000
Maple: Want to trade my tea cake for your apple pie?

1480
01:43:07,000 --> 01:43:11,000
Cinnamon: But I wanted to try this freshly baked apple pie~!

1481
01:43:11,000 --> 01:43:15,000
Cinnamon: Kashou-san, please! This is my one wish in life~!

1482
01:43:15,000 --> 01:43:18,000
Chocola: Master, we're out of cream puffs now~!

1483
01:43:18,000 --> 01:43:21,000
Chocola: Requesting increase in production! Salute!

1484
01:43:21,000 --> 01:43:26,000
Vanilla: Hrmm...! Master, I can't reach the tea leaf stock... Get it for me...!!

1485
01:43:26,000 --> 01:43:29,000
Kashou: ... Do what you like. Don't mind me.

1486
01:43:29,000 --> 01:43:37,000
*And just like that, half an hour into opening day, and suddenly there was a "SOLD OUT" sign on the door of my bakery.*

1487
01:43:37,000 --> 01:43:38,000
Kashou: I'm back~

1488
01:43:38,000 --> 01:43:42,000
Chocola: Master~! Please look at this, Master~! It's amazing~!

1489
01:43:42,000 --> 01:43:46,000
Vanilla: It's so cute! It's really amazing, it really is!

1490
01:43:46,000 --> 01:43:49,000
Kashou: What happened? You both are so excited...

1491
01:43:49,000 --> 01:43:55,000
*I had just come back from shopping to find the two of them in really high spirits.*

1492
01:43:55,000 --> 01:44:01,000
*I couldn't imagine what had changed so drastically in the little time I had been out...*

1493
01:44:01,000 --> 01:44:05,000
*Well, maybe they were really getting into that cat toy.*

1494
01:44:05,000 --> 01:44:10,000
Chocola: Please, just come and take a look! It's really something! It really is!

1495
01:44:10,000 --> 01:44:14,000
Kashou: Yeah, I get that it's amazing, but what exactly is it?

1496
01:44:14,000 --> 01:44:20,000
Vanilla: Just come here. Seeing is believing. It would be faster for you to just have a look.

1497
01:44:20,000 --> 01:44:24,000
Kashou: Faster to have a look...? That's just an empty room.

1498
01:44:24,000 --> 01:44:28,000
*Chocola and Vanilla pulled me towards the empty room.*

1499
01:44:28,000 --> 01:44:30,000
Kashou: Whoa...?! Wh-What the...?!

1500
01:44:30,000 --> 01:44:36,000
*The moment the door was opened, there was a pink and white spread before my eyes.*

1501
01:44:36,000 --> 01:44:43,000
*The colors overflowed from the floor, bed, dresser, and cushions with their antique rose design.*

1502
01:44:43,000 --> 01:44:48,000
*There also seemed to be a sweet, high class scent wafting throughout it.*

1503
01:44:48,000 --> 01:44:53,000
*Clearly, a room that wasn't here before was spread out before my eyes.*

1504
01:44:53,000 --> 01:44:58,000
*I immediately started to wonder if I'd somehow walked into another dimension.*

1505
01:44:58,000 --> 01:45:03,000
Chocola: Shigure-chan arranged for all of this~! It's super-duper cute~!

1506
01:45:03,000 --> 01:45:11,000
Vanilla: Shigure felt pity and prepared this for us. This way, Master can say goodbye to his days of sleeping on the sofa.

1507
01:45:11,000 --> 01:45:17,000
Kashou: ... Now that you mention it, it has the same feel as your room back home, huh?

1508
01:45:17,000 --> 01:45:21,000
*I found myself greatly confused as I leaned against the wall.*

1509
01:45:21,000 --> 01:45:28,000
*I remembered it was one of Shigure's hobbies to decorate each of the catgirls' rooms to something like this.*

1510
01:45:28,000 --> 01:45:40,000
*Because of our traditional parents, Shigure herself had a relatively normal Japanese-style room, so it seemed like she poured all her effort into their rooms instead of her own.*

1511
01:45:40,000 --> 01:45:48,000
*Shigure did also say that she dressed the catgirls according to her own tastes too. All of them except for Maple.*

1512
01:45:48,000 --> 01:45:52,000
Chocola: Yay~ The bed is really fluffy-wuffy and smells nice~ ♪

1513
01:45:52,000 --> 01:45:57,000
Vanilla: It's super huge. This will be more than enough for Chocola and me.

1514
01:45:57,000 --> 01:46:04,000
*While Shigure might have been an education freak, I'd forgotten how much she really did spoil them.*

1515
01:46:04,000 --> 01:46:09,000
*Speaking of which, when did that girl have time to set all this up...?*

1516
01:46:09,000 --> 01:46:16,000
*She must have brought this all in while I was out. That really speaks volumes about her abilities.*

1517
01:46:16,000 --> 01:46:20,000
Kashou: ... Well, this your room, so use it as you wish.

1518
01:46:20,000 --> 01:46:22,000
Chocola: Eheheh, are you jealous~?

1519
01:46:22,000 --> 01:46:26,000
Kashou: Well, you do have that expensive-looking bed and all.

1520
01:46:26,000 --> 01:46:31,000
Vanilla: Heheh. Shigure said that Master would say something like that~

1521
01:46:31,000 --> 01:46:32,000
Kashou: ...... Huh?

1522
01:46:32,000 --> 01:46:38,000
Chocola: Meow~ Master's room is a lot like ours and it's really nice too, you know~ ♪

1523
01:46:38,000 --> 01:46:43,000
Vanilla: Master's bed is equally impressive. It's big and fluffy-wuffy.

1524
01:46:43,000 --> 01:46:48,000
Chocola: What do you think, what do you think~? Are you happy, Master~?

1525
01:46:48,000 --> 01:46:53,000
Vanilla: I really must take my hat off to how much Shigure loves you.

1526
01:46:53,000 --> 01:46:55,000
Kashou: Shigureeeeeeeeeeeeee!!!

1527
01:46:55,000 --> 01:47:00,000
*There was no way I could just throw out all the new things in the room.*

1528
01:47:00,000 --> 01:47:04,000
*And so, I became burdened with a glorious fantasy princess room.*

1529
01:47:04,000 --> 01:47:09,000
*... But surprisingly, I slept extremely well, so I didn't complain.*

1530
01:47:09,000 --> 01:47:14,000
Chocola: Thank you very much~ ♪ We look forward to seeing you again soon!

1531
01:47:14,000 --> 01:47:20,000
Chocola: Welcome! The menu is right over there and specials are listed on this sign here! ♪

1532
01:47:20,000 --> 01:47:26,000
Vanilla: Thank you for waiting. Here is your seasonal mille-feuille and chocolate montblanc.

1533
01:47:26,000 --> 01:47:32,000
Chocola: Ah, if you'll be dining in, please come right this way~ ♪ Here is the menu!

1534
01:47:32,000 --> 01:47:39,000
Vanilla: Here is your receipt. Will you be needing some dry ice to keep it cool while you carry it home?

1535
01:47:39,000 --> 01:47:46,000
Kashou: ... All right. Maybe I'll take this moment to bake some more sponge cake for the shortcakes.

1536
01:47:46,000 --> 01:47:53,000
*I looked through the window onto the bakery floor and saw that the customer traffic had calmed down a bit.*

1537
01:47:53,000 --> 01:47:57,000
*Glancing at the clock, I saw that it was almost 3 PM.*

1538
01:47:57,000 --> 01:48:03,000
*... It seemed that selling out and closing early on opening day actually got us noticed.*

1539
01:48:03,000 --> 01:48:10,000
*Thanks to some tweets and blog posts, word of mouth had spread and we were really busy the next day.*

1540
01:48:10,000 --> 01:48:17,000
*You could argue that it was just a big coincidence, but this was definitely all because of Shigure.*

1541
01:48:17,000 --> 01:48:22,000
Chocola: Master! We're almost out of fruit shortcakes! Ah, cream puffs too!

1542
01:48:22,000 --> 01:48:25,000
Kashou: Got it. I'll start making more now, then.

1543
01:48:25,000 --> 01:48:31,000
Vanilla: Master, we've received an order for a birthday cake. I'll leave the form over here.

1544
01:48:31,000 --> 01:48:34,000
Kashou: All right. I'll check it later.

1545
01:48:34,000 --> 01:48:39,000
Kashou: To think Chocola and Vanilla are actually able to help out this much...

1546
01:48:39,000 --> 01:48:44,000
*I watched as the two of them quickly and energetically engaged the customers.*

1547
01:48:44,000 --> 01:48:50,000
*Chocola was as enthusiastic as always while Vanilla showed her attention to detail.*

1548
01:48:50,000 --> 01:48:56,000
*They greatly contributed to the rising fame of the bakery as La Soleil's poster catgirls.*

1549
01:48:56,000 --> 01:49:02,000
*I really didn't expect much when I sought their assistance, but they've been a big help.*

1550
01:49:02,000 --> 01:49:05,000
Kashou: ... Well, it's about time for a break, huh.

1551
01:49:05,000 --> 01:49:08,000
Kashou: This one is almost done anyways.

1552
01:49:08,000 --> 01:49:16,000
*I lightly stretched my neck side to side as I took the ingredients for the next batch and put them in the refrigerator.*

1553
01:49:16,000 --> 01:49:18,000
Kashou: Good work, you two.

1554
01:49:18,000 --> 01:49:21,000
Chocola & Vanilla: Ohhh---!! T-This is...!!

1555
01:49:21,000 --> 01:49:24,000
Chocola: M-Master...! I-Is this cheesecake?!

1556
01:49:24,000 --> 01:49:31,000
Vanilla: Not only that, it's the rare kind too! It's rare cheesecake, Chocola...! The surface is all glossy...!

1557
01:49:31,000 --> 01:49:37,000
Kashou: This is because you two have been working so hard. As requested, here is your reward.

1558
01:49:37,000 --> 01:49:41,000
Chocola: Master...! You made this rare cheesecake for us?

1559
01:49:41,000 --> 01:49:47,000
Vanilla: You are so kind, Master...! This is the kind of joy you get from working hard...!

1560
01:49:47,000 --> 01:49:53,000
*The eyes of the two catgirls were sparkling as they looked at the rare cheesecake with delight.*

1561
01:49:53,000 --> 01:49:56,000
*It was worth it to see them this happy.*

1562
01:49:56,000 --> 01:50:00,000
*I sat down into a chair and poured hot water into the teapot.*

1563
01:50:00,000 --> 01:50:06,000
Chocola: Vanilla! Chocola was thinking we should share some of this happiness with Shigure-chan!

1564
01:50:06,000 --> 01:50:10,000
Vanilla: But neither of us have a cell phone. How regretful...

1565
01:50:10,000 --> 01:50:15,000
Chocola: Chocola sees. We can't take a picture of it with a phone then, huh...

1566
01:50:15,000 --> 01:50:18,000
Vanilla: Catgirls without cameras are helpless...

1567
01:50:18,000 --> 01:50:26,000
Chocola: Chocola knows! If we don't have a camera, then let's draw something! We'll put our emotions into a picture!

1568
01:50:26,000 --> 01:50:32,000
Vanilla: Now, Master, I would like you to draw Chocola and me. Be quick now. Glimmer~

1569
01:50:32,000 --> 01:50:36,000
Kashou: Just hurry up and eat it. Break time is almost over.

1570
01:50:36,000 --> 01:50:39,000
*I calmly urged them as I poured three cups of tea.*

1571
01:50:39,000 --> 01:50:48,000
*As always, these two catgirls had limitless energy, but I seriously wondered if they were trying to act as silly as they were being.*

1572
01:50:48,000 --> 01:50:52,000
Chocola: In that case, let's try some! Bite, munch munch munch...

1573
01:50:52,000 --> 01:50:57,000
Chocola: It's soooooooo tastyyyyyyy~!! I love how soft and rich it is~!!

1574
01:50:57,000 --> 01:51:01,000
Chocola: I can-- I can feel Master's love in this...!

1575
01:51:01,000 --> 01:51:06,000
Chocola: Chocola is the happiest catgirl in the world right noooooow...!!

1576
01:51:06,000 --> 01:51:13,000
Vanilla: Fuwah~ ♪ This exquisite amount of sweetness and slight burst of lemon... It's delicious~ ♪

1577
01:51:13,000 --> 01:51:20,000
Vanilla: The cookie crust at the bottom is also... mmph~ ♪ The slight bitterness makes it so... eheheh~ ♪

1578
01:51:20,000 --> 01:51:22,000
Kashou: I'm glad you two like it.

1579
01:51:22,000 --> 01:51:25,000
Kashou: I made some sauces for it, too.

1580
01:51:25,000 --> 01:51:29,000
Kashou: It'd help if you two could give me some feedback on them.

1581
01:51:29,000 --> 01:51:34,000
Chocola: Fuwahh...! Meow! Isn't that Chocola's favorite chocolate sauce~?!

1582
01:51:34,000 --> 01:51:39,000
Vanilla: This is my favorite berry sauce. It even has matcha powder...?!

1583
01:51:39,000 --> 01:51:43,000
Chocola: Is it all right for everything to be this perfect?!

1584
01:51:43,000 --> 01:51:46,000
Chocola: Are we allowed to be this happy?!

1585
01:51:46,000 --> 01:51:55,000
Vanilla: Ahhh, delicious...! Both of them enhance the natural flavor of the unbaked cream cheese and double the deliciousness...!

1586
01:51:55,000 --> 01:52:01,000
Chocola: So good~! It really is delicious, Master~ ♪ It tastes just like a professional's!

1587
01:52:01,000 --> 01:52:06,000
Vanilla: It really does tastes like a professional's work. Master is super cool.

1588
01:52:06,000 --> 01:52:10,000
Kashou: Well, I am a beginner, but I can at least do this.

1589
01:52:10,000 --> 01:52:16,000
*They've probably been waiting for an opportunity to praise me, so I suppose it's a good thing.*

1590
01:52:16,000 --> 01:52:25,000
*After hearing their request, I actually secretly did some research on making rare cheesecakes, but I'll leave that as a secret.*

1591
01:52:25,000 --> 01:52:29,000
Chocola: Master's reward makes Chocola so happy, meow~ ♪

1592
01:52:29,000 --> 01:52:36,000
Chocola: On top of being praised, Chocola gets to eat something delicious too. Chocola's so happy, meow~ ♪

1593
01:52:36,000 --> 01:52:40,000
Vanilla: We're working really hard out there, after all!

1594
01:52:40,000 --> 01:52:45,000
Vanilla: It would have been hard if Master was all alone, right? Mhmm!

1595
01:52:45,000 --> 01:52:49,000
Kashou: You're right. You two really were a big help. There, there.

1596
01:52:49,000 --> 01:52:54,000
*I patted both the genuinely happy Chocola and the proud Vanilla on the head.*

1597
01:52:54,000 --> 01:52:58,000
Chocola: Chocola will work even harder for Master's sake!

1598
01:52:58,000 --> 01:53:02,000
Chocola: Chocola's gonna work really really hard! Right, Vanilla?

1599
01:53:02,000 --> 01:53:09,000
Vanilla: I'll work so that my food expenses are covered. Just enough that you can't call me a freeloader.

1600
01:53:09,000 --> 01:53:14,000
Chocola: Geez, you aren't being honest. You like working here too, right, Vanilla?

1601
01:53:14,000 --> 01:53:21,000
Vanilla: It's because it's fun to work with Chocola. That is all. That really is all there is to it.

1602
01:53:21,000 --> 01:53:24,000
Chocola: Ahaha! Vanilla's face is getting red!

1603
01:53:24,000 --> 01:53:28,000
Chocola: Girls like that get their cheeks poked. Poke poke~ ♪

1604
01:53:28,000 --> 01:53:31,000
Vanilla: I'm not turning red-- mm, mmph...!

1605
01:53:31,000 --> 01:53:38,000
Vanilla: Hey, cut it out. Even Master says not to do stuff like this while eatin-- mm, mmph, mmm...!

1606
01:53:38,000 --> 01:53:42,000
*My poster catgirls were such adorable little things.*

1607
01:53:42,000 --> 01:53:46,000
*I watched them go at it as I poured another cup of tea.*

1608
01:53:46,000 --> 01:53:50,000
*I can understand why catgirls make great mascots though.*

1609
01:53:50,000 --> 01:53:55,000
*It was heartwarming and sweet to see them act like such happy sisters.*

1610
01:53:55,000 --> 01:54:01,000
Kashou: Since you two are helping me this much, you're going to have to really study hard, right?

1611
01:54:01,000 --> 01:54:04,000
Chocola: Study? For what? How to make cakes?

1612
01:54:04,000 --> 01:54:10,000
Vanilla: Ah, management? You've already decided to retire from your executive position, Master?

1613
01:54:10,000 --> 01:54:14,000
Kashou: No. You think I'm going to retire a few days after opening?

1614
01:54:14,000 --> 01:54:20,000
Kashou: Studying for your qualifications. You two remember what Shigure said, right?

1615
01:54:20,000 --> 01:54:26,000
*Upon hearing my words, their blank expressions changed as their eyes began to shine.*

1616
01:54:26,000 --> 01:54:29,000
Chocola & Vanilla: Qualifications, as in a Bell?

1617
01:54:29,000 --> 01:54:34,000
Kashou: Yep. You two are working really hard as poster catgirls, after all.

1618
01:54:34,000 --> 01:54:36,000
Chocola: Master, does that mean...!

1619
01:54:36,000 --> 01:54:40,000
*Chocola and Vanilla turned to each other with looks of amazement.*

1620
01:54:40,000 --> 01:54:44,000
*Suddenly, they both stood up and bent forward across the table.*

1621
01:54:44,000 --> 01:54:48,000
Chocola: Does that mean that Chocola and Vanilla have been helpful?

1622
01:54:48,000 --> 01:54:52,000
Vanilla: Does that mean that we've been doing a good job?

1623
01:54:52,000 --> 01:54:55,000
Kashou: Of course. That's what I said, right?

1624
01:54:55,000 --> 01:55:01,000
Kashou: If you two weren't around, I don't think I'd be able to keep the bakery going.

1625
01:55:01,000 --> 01:55:05,000
*Just like before, I tapped their heads in thanks again.*

1626
01:55:05,000 --> 01:55:09,000
Chocola: Will Master be happy if Chocola gets a Bell?

1627
01:55:09,000 --> 01:55:11,000
Kashou: Ahh, of course.

1628
01:55:11,000 --> 01:55:16,000
Vanilla: Master would be proud to have his two poster catgirls earn their Bells.

1629
01:55:16,000 --> 01:55:19,000
Kashou: Yeah, I'm proud of you two. But...

1630
01:55:19,000 --> 01:55:24,000
Kashou: As your owner, I want to have proof that I raised you two well too.

1631
01:55:24,000 --> 01:55:31,000
Kashou: That's why you two should work for your own sake as well. I'll also do my best alongside you two.

1632
01:55:31,000 --> 01:55:33,000
*I ruffled their hair.*

1633
01:55:33,000 --> 01:55:37,000
*They closed their eyes and smiled even more brightly than before.*

1634
01:55:37,000 --> 01:55:42,000
Chocola: Okay! Chocola will work hard. Chocola will do her absolute best~!

1635
01:55:42,000 --> 01:55:47,000
Chocola: Chocola will work so hard that Master will always need Chocola~!

1636
01:55:47,000 --> 01:55:52,000
Vanilla: If we receive our Bells, will you take us out to play, too?

1637
01:55:52,000 --> 01:55:56,000
Vanilla: There are a lot of places I want to go to, okay?

1638
01:55:56,000 --> 01:56:02,000
Kashou: Ahh, sure. Whether it's an amusement park or the aquarium, I'll take you two there.

1639
01:56:02,000 --> 01:56:08,000
Chocola: Yay~ ♪ Going to the amusement park with Master would make Chocola so happy~!

1640
01:56:08,000 --> 01:56:12,000
Chocola: Chocola wants to go to the Little Mouse Kingdom!

1641
01:56:12,000 --> 01:56:17,000
Vanilla: I want to see an aurora. Or a crater on the Moon. Or both. Both is good.

1642
01:56:17,000 --> 01:56:21,000
Kashou: Uh, within reason, okay? Are you two listening?

1643
01:56:21,000 --> 01:56:26,000
*The two catgirls were lost in their own fantasy worlds while their eyes gleamed.*

1644
01:56:26,000 --> 01:56:31,000
*I never thought that they'd start dreaming of going overseas or even space...*

1645
01:56:31,000 --> 01:56:37,000
*A catgirl's dreams obviously weren't something to make light of. They were... incredible.*

1646
01:56:37,000 --> 01:56:43,000
Chocola: On the other hand, if it's anywhere we want, then Master's bed is good too! Muhaa~!

1647
01:56:43,000 --> 01:56:47,000
Vanilla: The first catgirl in history to go into outer space...!

1648
01:56:47,000 --> 01:56:51,000
Vanilla: Better yet, perhaps we could go as far as Mars...!

1649
01:56:51,000 --> 01:56:54,000
Kashou: Hey! Break's over, you two. Go get to it!

1650
01:56:54,000 --> 01:57:02,000
*It was a bit of a struggle to bring Chocola and Vanilla back to reality after they had travelled so far mentally.*

1651
01:57:02,000 --> 01:57:04,000
*--- A few days later on a day off*

1652
01:57:04,000 --> 01:57:08,000
Shigure: This is the first step towards getting your own Bell!

1653
01:57:08,000 --> 01:57:11,000
Shigure: Are you ready? Chocola, Vanilla!

1654
01:57:11,000 --> 01:57:16,000
Chocola: Yes, ma'am! All preparations are go, Professor Shigure-chan!

1655
01:57:16,000 --> 01:57:19,000
Vanilla: Yes, ma'am. All preparations are go!

1656
01:57:19,000 --> 01:57:28,000
Shigure: Listen carefully, okay? In order to receive a Bell, you must meet the requirement: "for a single catgirl to fit into human society."

1657
01:57:28,000 --> 01:57:33,000
Shigure: The entire test will focus on this one principle! Okay, now repeat!

1658
01:57:33,000 --> 01:57:38,000
Chocola & Vanilla: "The entire test will focus on this one principle!"

1659
01:57:38,000 --> 01:57:45,000
Shigure: Wrong! You were supposed to repeat the other bit! If this were the exam, you'd already be failing it!!

1660
01:57:45,000 --> 01:57:49,000
Kashou: I guess you could have misunderstood it like that though.

1661
01:57:49,000 --> 01:57:55,000
*I sipped some tea in the living room while I watched what the catgirls and Shigure were doing.*

1662
01:57:55,000 --> 01:58:00,000
*On that note, I hadn't realized that Shigure's motherly mode was so intense...*

1663
01:58:00,000 --> 01:58:09,000
Kashou: I've been with her since she was born, but this is the first time I've seen her like this, including that headband of hers.

1664
01:58:09,000 --> 01:58:16,000
Azuki: It's because you asked her to "teach them how to prepare for the qualification exam," after all.

1665
01:58:16,000 --> 01:58:23,000
Azuki: Shigure's intensity has totally been through the roof these past few days. It's been a total pain. Sigh~

1666
01:58:23,000 --> 01:58:28,000
Coconut: It seems like she's happy that you asked her for help, Kashou-sama.

1667
01:58:28,000 --> 01:58:35,000
Coconut: She got so impatient waiting for a day when the bakery was closed, she started teaching us instead.

1668
01:58:35,000 --> 01:58:41,000
*Azuki and Coconut, who had came with Shigure, nodded their heads as they drank their tea.*

1669
01:58:41,000 --> 01:58:46,000
*Looks like Shigure's been bothering those two without me knowing, huh?*

1670
01:58:46,000 --> 01:58:51,000
*I'll give them some cakes to take home later. Yep, that should be okay.*

1671
01:58:51,000 --> 01:58:57,000
Shigure: Listen carefully, you two! This is regarding the "Independent Action Permit," okay?

1672
01:58:57,000 --> 01:59:08,000
Shigure: Are you able to understand human society's common sense and rules without giving in to a catgirl's habits and instincts, and use reasoning to guide your actions?

1673
01:59:08,000 --> 01:59:13,000
Shigure: A catgirl that can surpass this has what it takes to be a real catgirl.

1674
01:59:13,000 --> 01:59:18,000
Chocola: N-No way...?! Chocola isn't a real catgirl?! What should Chocola do?!

1675
01:59:18,000 --> 01:59:24,000
Vanilla: Well, catgirls are catgirls. There's no reason to get flustered. Calm down.

1676
01:59:24,000 --> 01:59:28,000
Shigure: Vanilla, you shouldn't say that so nonchalantly!

1677
01:59:28,000 --> 01:59:35,000
Shigure: It's important to be independent so you can become a mature, grown-up catgirl as soon as possible.

1678
01:59:35,000 --> 01:59:42,000
Shigure: Chocola, Vanilla. You two both want to become Nii-sama's partners as soon as possible, right?

1679
01:59:42,000 --> 01:59:46,000
Chocola: Ma'am! Chocola wants to be Master's partner, ma'am!

1680
01:59:46,000 --> 01:59:53,000
Vanilla: Well, so long as I'm Chocola's partner. After that, I don't care too much as long as I don't get fired.

1681
01:59:53,000 --> 02:00:01,000
Azuki: Vanilla really lacks ambition, huh? She just takes it easy with all those deadpan jokes of hers. Munch, crunch, crunch.

1682
02:00:01,000 --> 02:00:08,000
Coconut: She works hard when it's needed. She just doesn't show her effort, munch, crunch, crunch.

1683
02:00:08,000 --> 02:00:11,000
Kashou: You two take it pretty easy too, though.

1684
02:00:11,000 --> 02:00:15,000
*I joked back at them as I prepared some more snacks.*

1685
02:00:15,000 --> 02:00:18,000
*That's just how catgirls were, though.*

1686
02:00:18,000 --> 02:00:27,000
Shigure: There's a human saying: "The proof is in the pudding." Basically, "you learn more from experience than from explanations."

1687
02:00:27,000 --> 02:00:30,000
Shigure: Let's consider Azuki as an example.

1688
02:00:30,000 --> 02:00:37,000
Shigure: Azuki, as the oldest catgirl, show your younger sisters how a catgirl with a Bell should act.

1689
02:00:37,000 --> 02:00:41,000
Azuki: Huh? Why? What a pain. I'd better get something out of this.

1690
02:00:41,000 --> 02:00:44,000
Chocola: We're counting on you, Azuki-chan!

1691
02:00:44,000 --> 02:00:46,000
Vanilla: Please, Azuki.

1692
02:00:46,000 --> 02:00:52,000
Shigure: Now then, observe the strong will of a Bell-holding catgirl. Nii-sama, watch carefully.

1693
02:00:52,000 --> 02:00:58,000
*With pride, Shigure reached into her kimono, rummaged around, and pulled something out.*

1694
02:00:58,000 --> 02:01:04,000
Shigure: Here I have a sparkling piece of fatty tuna that any catgirl would clamor for.

1695
02:01:04,000 --> 02:01:08,000
Kashou: Eh? Where did you pull that plate of fatty tuna from?

1696
02:01:08,000 --> 02:01:15,000
Shigure: Heheh, I prepared it just for today. In a sense, you could call it my love for you, Nii-sama.

1697
02:01:15,000 --> 02:01:21,000
Kashou: Uh, no, I'm not asking why you did it. I'm asking about where you got it from.

1698
02:01:21,000 --> 02:01:25,000
Shigure: Let's just ignore the small details for now.

1699
02:01:25,000 --> 02:01:27,000
*I was completely shot down.*

1700
02:01:27,000 --> 02:01:32,000
*I felt like this was more than enough slapstick for now, though. Yep.*

1701
02:01:32,000 --> 02:01:40,000
Shigure: When confronted with their favorite food, a normal catgirl would give in to instinct and leap right for it.

1702
02:01:40,000 --> 02:01:44,000
Shigure: However, when I hang this in front of Azuki's eyes...

1703
02:01:44,000 --> 02:01:45,000
Azuki: Meooooow!!

1704
02:01:45,000 --> 02:01:46,000
Shigure: Haawah?!

1705
02:01:46,000 --> 02:01:48,000
Azuki: Munch, munch, munch, munch.

1706
02:01:48,000 --> 02:01:49,000
Shigure: ......

1707
02:01:49,000 --> 02:01:52,000
Azuki: Munch, munch, munch, munch, munch, munch.

1708
02:01:52,000 --> 02:01:53,000
Shigure: ......

1709
02:01:53,000 --> 02:01:55,000
Shigure: ... Uhm, Azu--

1710
02:01:55,000 --> 02:01:57,000
Azuki: Meow, meow, meow, meow~!!

1711
02:01:57,000 --> 02:01:59,000
Shigure: Ah, wait...! Azuki...!!

1712
02:01:59,000 --> 02:02:00,000
Shigure: ......

1713
02:02:00,000 --> 02:02:02,000
Chocola & Vanilla: ......

1714
02:02:02,000 --> 02:02:03,000
Kashou: ......

1715
02:02:03,000 --> 02:02:09,000
Shigure: ... Ahem. That right there was a bad example. Azuki will be punished after this.

1716
02:02:09,000 --> 02:02:12,000
Kashou: Ah, so there are punishments, then.

1717
02:02:12,000 --> 02:02:16,000
Shigure: Coconut! Show us your resistance to feather lures!

1718
02:02:16,000 --> 02:02:18,000
Shigure: Are you ready, Coconut?

1719
02:02:18,000 --> 02:02:21,000
Coconut: Leave it to me, Shigure-sama.

1720
02:02:21,000 --> 02:02:28,000
Shigure: Here it comes! Nii-sama, are you watching carefully? I'll show you something different this time.

1721
02:02:28,000 --> 02:02:32,000
Kashou: This'll be more useful for Chocola and Vanilla than me.

1722
02:02:32,000 --> 02:02:35,000
Shigure: I'm counting on you, Coconut!

1723
02:02:35,000 --> 02:02:37,000
*She's not listening at all.*

1724
02:02:37,000 --> 02:02:42,000
*Well, so long as Chocola and Vanilla are watching, it should be okay.*

1725
02:02:42,000 --> 02:02:43,000
Shigure: Okay.

1726
02:02:43,000 --> 02:02:44,000
Shigure: Ready...?

1727
02:02:44,000 --> 02:02:45,000
Coconut: ......

1728
02:02:45,000 --> 02:02:51,000
Chocola: Ohhh...! So amazing! As expected of Coco-chan. That lack of reaction is impressive!

1729
02:02:51,000 --> 02:02:56,000
Vanilla: She's not reacting to it at all. Quite an impressive display.

1730
02:02:56,000 --> 02:03:01,000
Coconut: Teehee~ Something like this isn't even special enough to warrant praise!

1731
02:03:01,000 --> 02:03:09,000
Coconut: Something of this level is to be expected from one of Shigure's catgirls! I could keep this up this for hours...

1732
02:03:09,000 --> 02:03:10,000
Coconut: ...... Hm?

1733
02:03:10,000 --> 02:03:11,000
Fly: Bzzzzz~

1734
02:03:11,000 --> 02:03:12,000
Coconut: ......

1735
02:03:12,000 --> 02:03:15,000
Chocola: ... Hm? What's wrong, Coco-chan?

1736
02:03:15,000 --> 02:03:16,000
Fly: Bzzzzzzzzz~

1737
02:03:16,000 --> 02:03:17,000
Coconut: ......

1738
02:03:17,000 --> 02:03:18,000
Chocola: ...??

1739
02:03:18,000 --> 02:03:19,000
Fly: Bzzzzzzzzzzzzz~

1740
02:03:19,000 --> 02:03:20,000
Coconut: ............

1741
02:03:20,000 --> 02:03:21,000
Chocola: ???

1742
02:03:21,000 --> 02:03:23,000
Shocola & Coconut: Ouch?!\nMeow!!

1743
02:03:23,000 --> 02:03:28,000
Chocola: Uwaaahn! Coco-chan cat-punched Chocola~! Myaaahn, that's mean~!

1744
02:03:28,000 --> 02:03:30,000
Coconut: S-Sorry, Chocola! I just...!

1745
02:03:30,000 --> 02:03:38,000
Vanilla: That was pretty intense. I guess you could say that it can't be helped since you're a catgirl. There, there.

1746
02:03:38,000 --> 02:03:43,000
Kashou: ... Are you all right? The catgirls at home are like that...?

1747
02:03:43,000 --> 02:03:50,000
Shigure: For what it's worth, both Azuki and Coconut passed with perfect marks for the most part, but... huh~?

1748
02:03:50,000 --> 02:03:53,000
*Those two couldn't act independently at all.*

1749
02:03:53,000 --> 02:03:58,000
Shigure: Nii-sama, rest assured, this time there will be no problems.

1750
02:03:58,000 --> 02:04:00,000
Shigure: I can guarantee that.

1751
02:04:00,000 --> 02:04:04,000
Maple: All right. It's a bit of a hassle, but I'm here...

1752
02:04:04,000 --> 02:04:10,000
Cinnamon: Hello, Kashou-san~ While I may not be the greatest, I am at your absolute disposal~

1753
02:04:10,000 --> 02:04:15,000
Kashou: Sorry to make you come all the way out here, Maple, Cinnamon.

1754
02:04:15,000 --> 02:04:20,000
Maple: Honestly! I came all the way out here, so be a bit more thankful!

1755
02:04:20,000 --> 02:04:26,000
Cinnamon: This is for the sake of our cute little sisters, so please don't worry about it~ ♪

1756
02:04:26,000 --> 02:04:31,000
Shigure: I will have you two watch as Maple and Cinnamon take the written exam.

1757
02:04:31,000 --> 02:04:36,000
Kashou: Written exam? So does that mean we're done with actual training for today?

1758
02:04:36,000 --> 02:04:42,000
Chocola: We'll do our best with our studies, ma'am! Everyone, please teach us well!

1759
02:04:42,000 --> 02:04:44,000
Vanilla: Roger, roger. Treat us well.

1760
02:04:44,000 --> 02:04:49,000
*... There was no point in even making a joke here. Yeah, I got that.*

1761
02:04:49,000 --> 02:04:56,000
*Well, considering what happened earlier, things should be all right from here on out... probably.*

1762
02:04:56,000 --> 02:05:00,000
Shigure: We'll leave it in the younger catgirls capable paws.

1763
02:05:00,000 --> 02:05:06,000
Shigure: Now then, why don't we go have tea together, just the two of us, Nii-sama?

1764
02:05:06,000 --> 02:05:11,000
Kashou: Huh? Is this what studying for a written exam is supposed to be like?

1765
02:05:11,000 --> 02:05:19,000
Shigure: Considering how many teachers are already here for them, we should leave. You know, too many cooks and all that.

1766
02:05:19,000 --> 02:05:28,000
Shigure: Ah, speaking of which, I brought along some bite-sized ohagi I made. I'd be ever so delighted if you tried some, Nii-sama.

1767
02:05:28,000 --> 02:05:32,000
Shigure: I have some wonderful tea leaves to go with them, as well.

1768
02:05:32,000 --> 02:05:36,000
Shigure: I'll be borrowing the kitchen~ How exciting!

1769
02:05:36,000 --> 02:05:42,000
Kashou: ... Well, even if she's like this, she did help the four of them pass that exam.

1770
02:05:42,000 --> 02:05:46,000
*In any case, I said nothing and continued to watch them.*

1771
02:05:46,000 --> 02:05:52,000
Maple: A Russian character forms the mouth. It's pretty useful if you can remember that.

1772
02:05:52,000 --> 02:05:57,000
Chocola: Wow~! Maple-chan, that's amazing!! There's no emoticon you can't make!

1773
02:05:57,000 --> 02:06:01,000
Chocola: A master! You're an emoticon master! So cool~!

1774
02:06:01,000 --> 02:06:04,000
Maple: Heehee, Chocola really is getting in this...

1775
02:06:04,000 --> 02:06:10,000
Maple: Do emoticons really warrant that much of a fuss? I'll show you LIME stamps next.

1776
02:06:10,000 --> 02:06:16,000
Chocola: Whaa~! Cute...!! That's super cute~! What is this?! What is this exactly?!

1777
02:06:16,000 --> 02:06:19,000
Cinnamon: Vanilla-chan, are you ready for this~?

1778
02:06:19,000 --> 02:06:25,000
Cinnamon: You know about flowers, right~? They have something called a stamen and pistil, okay~?

1779
02:06:25,000 --> 02:06:29,000
Cinnamon: A-And you know? T-The stamen and pistil, right?

1780
02:06:29,000 --> 02:06:37,000
Cinnamon: Uhm, so when they embrace... it gets all sticky... it gets sticky, and then a baby... you know...? Haah... ♪

1781
02:06:37,000 --> 02:06:42,000
Vanilla: Cinnamon, stop getting hot and bothered and do some actual teaching!

1782
02:06:42,000 --> 02:06:48,000
Cinnamon: I-I'm not getting a-aroused, meow...! I-I'm a big sister with a Bell, after all...!

1783
02:06:48,000 --> 02:06:55,000
Cinnamon: No way! How do I not have any science textbooks... I-I don't have any health textbooks, either...!

1784
02:06:55,000 --> 02:06:58,000
Vanilla: Onee-chan, this is disappointing.

1785
02:06:58,000 --> 02:07:02,000
Cinnamon: Myaaah...! Don't look at me that way...! Myaaaahn.. .♪

1786
02:07:02,000 --> 02:07:05,000
Kashou: ... Just what are they up to now?

1787
02:07:05,000 --> 02:07:13,000
Shigure: It's important to be educated in common knowledge and achieve at least an elementary school reading level.

1788
02:07:13,000 --> 02:07:23,000
Shigure: Lately, there have been crimes committed by catgirls, as well. It's necessary to be well-versed in the general education of human society.

1789
02:07:23,000 --> 02:07:30,000
Kashou: To me, it looks like they're only playing with a phone app and reading strange books, though...

1790
02:07:30,000 --> 02:07:35,000
Shigure: Oh, Nii-sama! This kinako powder one is really yummy. Say ah~

1791
02:07:35,000 --> 02:07:40,000
*I continued to watch the study session as I took the ohagi Shigure handed me.*

1792
02:07:40,000 --> 02:07:46,000
*They absolutely weren't studying. I really did not think this was studying in the slightest.*

1793
02:07:46,000 --> 02:07:52,000
*At the very least, it seemed fundamentally different from the sort of studying I knew.*

1794
02:07:52,000 --> 02:07:57,000
*I started to wonder if leaving this up to her really was a good idea.*

1795
02:07:57,000 --> 02:08:02,000
Shigure: Now then, Nii-sama, please have a look here. Isn't this stamp cute?

1796
02:08:02,000 --> 02:08:09,000
Shigure: I decided to give it a try and made some. I think these could become rather popular, right?

1797
02:08:09,000 --> 02:08:13,000
Kashou: Huh...? Chocola and Vanilla? And... our bakery uniforms...?

1798
02:08:13,000 --> 02:08:17,000
*On the screen were super-deformed images of Chocola and Vanilla.*

1799
02:08:17,000 --> 02:08:23,000
*There were some of them holding signs or sleeping, but all of them did seem quite cute.*

1800
02:08:23,000 --> 02:08:26,000
*I don't really know much about LIME, though.*

1801
02:08:26,000 --> 02:08:31,000
*But it definitely was true that, as mascot characters, they could sell.*

1802
02:08:31,000 --> 02:08:35,000
Kashou: ... You've always had many strange talents, haven't you?

1803
02:08:35,000 --> 02:08:42,000
Shigure: I thought that this would be a way to help Nii-sama's bakery continue to grow from the sidelines.

1804
02:08:42,000 --> 02:08:49,000
Shigure: Nii-sama, you have a gift for making sweets, but you have no idea how to promote yourself.

1805
02:08:49,000 --> 02:08:54,000
*Shigure had always been really knowledgeable about the internet...*

1806
02:08:54,000 --> 02:09:00,000
*It was true. I did find our sudden increase in customers on our second day mysterious.*

1807
02:09:00,000 --> 02:09:07,000
*Now it made sense to me why a lot of customers said they heard about us "on the internet" or "on Dwitter".*

1808
02:09:07,000 --> 02:09:13,000
Shigure: This is also part of your little sister's love for you. Would you please praise me?

1809
02:09:13,000 --> 02:09:18,000
Kashou: Yeah, thanks for your help. I really appreciate it. Pat pat!

1810
02:09:18,000 --> 02:09:22,000
Shigure: Eheheh~ I love it when Nii-sama rubs my head. Eheheh~ ♪

1811
02:09:22,000 --> 02:09:27,000
*With a pampered voice, Shigure closed her eyes and smiled happily.*

1812
02:09:27,000 --> 02:09:32,000
*It really was a big help to have a little sister who was quick on the uptake.*

1813
02:09:32,000 --> 02:09:37,000
*To show my gratitude to this small, central figure, I rubbed her head.*

1814
02:09:37,000 --> 02:09:43,000
Maple: Well, when there is trouble, it seems okay in general to dial 1-1-0 on the phone.

1815
02:09:43,000 --> 02:09:49,000
Maple: Also, if you're hurt, then dial 1-1-9. You'll be good if you can remember all that.

1816
02:09:49,000 --> 02:09:55,000
Chocola: Maple-chan, the smart phone says that it will rain tomorrow! It's going to be drizzly!

1817
02:09:55,000 --> 02:10:00,000
Cinnamon: Y-You know about i-insects, right? Well, they carry s-sperm... semen...!

1818
02:10:00,000 --> 02:10:05,000
Cinnamon: Ah, no! They carry p-pollen...! It's pollen, okay? Haaah... ♪

1819
02:10:05,000 --> 02:10:12,000
Cinnamon: And then the pistil, right? They take that and put it inside and it gets pregnant and haaahh~ ♪

1820
02:10:12,000 --> 02:10:16,000
Vanilla: So they have sex with the insect instead? Substitute sex?

1821
02:10:16,000 --> 02:10:21,000
Cinnamon: Myaaaahn... ♪ D-Don't say embarrassing things like "sex"... ♪

1822
02:10:21,000 --> 02:10:25,000
Cinnamon: Girls... h-have to have some shame, you know...?!

1823
02:10:25,000 --> 02:10:32,000
Cinnamon: To think Vanilla would say something so dirty like that... Cinnamon is gonna drooooool~ ♪

1824
02:10:32,000 --> 02:10:35,000
Vanilla: Cinnamon, you shouldn't drool. Wipe, wipe.

1825
02:10:35,000 --> 02:10:38,000
Kashou: ... So, I have to ask this, but...

1826
02:10:38,000 --> 02:10:45,000
Kashou: ... Is having a Bell really a good enough qualification for catgirls to go out by themselves?

1827
02:10:45,000 --> 02:10:49,000
Shigure: All the catgirls in our family are all excellent.

1828
02:10:49,000 --> 02:10:53,000
Shigure: I will be doing their reviews, so worry not, Nii-sama.

1829
02:10:53,000 --> 02:11:00,000
Shigure: Since I figured something of this sort might happen, I also have the cheat sheets of the Bell manual.

1830
02:11:00,000 --> 02:11:06,000
Shigure: As Chocola and Vanilla's owner, please read this and do your best, Nii-sama.

1831
02:11:06,000 --> 02:11:09,000
Kashou: As their owner, I'll do my best.

1832
02:11:09,000 --> 02:11:11,000
*So she was expecting this.*

1833
02:11:11,000 --> 02:11:15,000
*Even I was suckered in to thinking she was just playing around.*

1834
02:11:15,000 --> 02:11:19,000
*I went back to watching the catgirls' dead-end study session.*

1835
02:11:19,000 --> 02:11:24,000
Kashou: All right! All that's left is the filling for the apple pie.

1836
02:11:24,000 --> 02:11:29,000
*I murmured that as I ran my finger down the prep sheet to confirm.*

1837
02:11:29,000 --> 02:11:33,000
*I looked at the clock and saw that it was past 9 o'clock.*

1838
02:11:33,000 --> 02:11:41,000
*Although studying for the Bell exam took up my time, I still had enough energy to do preparations on a day off.*

1839
02:11:41,000 --> 02:11:45,000
Chocola: Master~ Master~! Look! Please look at this~!

1840
02:11:45,000 --> 02:11:50,000
Vanilla: We've finally transcended the limits of catgirls. Perfection.

1841
02:11:50,000 --> 02:11:52,000
Kashou: You sure got there quickly.

1842
02:11:52,000 --> 02:11:56,000
Chocola: That is because we adore you profoundly, Master! Ehen~

1843
02:11:56,000 --> 02:11:59,000
Kashou: You don't need to mimic Shigure.

1844
02:11:59,000 --> 02:12:07,000
*Shigure and the others were gone, but it hadn't been more than two hours since they'd started their independent study.*

1845
02:12:07,000 --> 02:12:11,000
*I suppose they were now able to do multiplication or something.*

1846
02:12:11,000 --> 02:12:18,000
Vanilla: Hmph. Judging by Master's face, he just thought we've only gotten as far as learning division.

1847
02:12:18,000 --> 02:12:20,000
*Close. I didn't go that far ahead.*

1848
02:12:20,000 --> 02:12:23,000
*I stayed silent so as to not dampen their spirit.*

1849
02:12:23,000 --> 02:12:26,000
Chocola: Hehehee~ Master! Please rub my neck!

1850
02:12:26,000 --> 02:12:30,000
Chocola: Chocola will use her poker face and hide her purring!

1851
02:12:30,000 --> 02:12:32,000
Kashou: Like this? Rub rub rub...

1852
02:12:32,000 --> 02:12:34,000
Chocola: Purrrrrrrrrrrrrrrr~ ♪

1853
02:12:34,000 --> 02:12:36,000
Kashou: Well, that didn't work.

1854
02:12:36,000 --> 02:12:41,000
Chocola: Meoww! Chocola can't help it! Chocola just loves her Master so much!

1855
02:12:41,000 --> 02:12:47,000
Chocola: Please don't think Chocola is some cheap catgirl who just purrs over any old thing!!

1856
02:12:47,000 --> 02:12:50,000
Vanilla: I'm gonna rub your neck, Chocola~

1857
02:12:50,000 --> 02:12:52,000
Chocola: Purrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrr~ ♪

1858
02:12:52,000 --> 02:12:54,000
Kashou: That didn't work at all.

1859
02:12:54,000 --> 02:12:56,000
*She did that, even with Vanilla.*

1860
02:12:56,000 --> 02:12:59,000
*What exactly was she trying to show off to me?*

1861
02:12:59,000 --> 02:13:03,000
Chocola: W-Well, why don't you try, Vanilla? Can you do it?!

1862
02:13:03,000 --> 02:13:08,000
Vanilla: Of course I can. I won't blink even if you clap in front of my face.

1863
02:13:08,000 --> 02:13:12,000
Vanilla: Come on, Master! Why don't you give it your best shot?

1864
02:13:12,000 --> 02:13:16,000
Kashou: Okay, how about like this, then. Rub rub rub...

1865
02:13:16,000 --> 02:13:19,000
Vanilla: Mm... haa, mmph...♪ M-Mmph, mmm~...♪

1866
02:13:19,000 --> 02:13:22,000
Kashou: ...... Rub rub rub rub rub rub...

1867
02:13:22,000 --> 02:13:27,000
Chocola: Look, Master! Vanilla's tail! Her tail is sticking straight up!!

1868
02:13:27,000 --> 02:13:33,000
Chocola: It's stiff enough to pierce the heavens! Vanilla must be feeling really good!!

1869
02:13:33,000 --> 02:13:35,000
Vanilla: N-No...! This isn't, uhm...!

1870
02:13:35,000 --> 02:13:41,000
Vanilla: Yeah, th-this is just how I show my love for Chocola when she's near me...!

1871
02:13:41,000 --> 02:13:45,000
Kashou: You'll probably be near her during the test too, you know.

1872
02:13:45,000 --> 02:13:49,000
*I couldn't shake the fact that this was an excuse out of her.*

1873
02:13:49,000 --> 02:13:54,000
*Given Vanilla's quietness, she was honestly trying not to lose to Chocola.*

1874
02:13:54,000 --> 02:13:57,000
Chocola: This was just a minor setback!

1875
02:13:57,000 --> 02:14:01,000
Chocola: Please test us in other ways! We'll definitely be fine!

1876
02:14:01,000 --> 02:14:06,000
Vanilla: Yes, we'll definitely pass all of the rest of them, so don't worry.

1877
02:14:06,000 --> 02:14:11,000
Vanilla: You can test us on every one of these catgirl killer tests.

1878
02:14:11,000 --> 02:14:13,000
Kashou: Hmmm, from this list, huh...

1879
02:14:13,000 --> 02:14:18,000
*I scanned over the questions from previous tests in the cheat sheets.*

1880
02:14:18,000 --> 02:14:23,000
*There really were a lot of questions about various catgirl behaviors.*

1881
02:14:23,000 --> 02:14:27,000
Kashou: Okay, why don't we go in order from the top, then.

1882
02:14:27,000 --> 02:14:31,000
Chocola: Please leave it to us! We're Master's catgirls, after all!

1883
02:14:31,000 --> 02:14:32,000
Vanilla: Don't worry.

1884
02:14:32,000 --> 02:14:33,000
Kashou: Okay then.

1885
02:14:33,000 --> 02:14:36,000
Chocola & Vanilla: Sniff sniff, sniff sniff.

1886
02:14:36,000 --> 02:14:39,000
Kashou: Resisting sniffing test, failed.

1887
02:14:39,000 --> 02:14:44,000
Kashou: By the way, what these fingers touched earlier was blue cheese.

1888
02:14:44,000 --> 02:14:46,000
Chocola & Vanilla: Unyaaaaahhh...!!

1889
02:14:46,000 --> 02:14:50,000
Kashou: Okay, you failed the Flehmen response test, as well.

1890
02:14:50,000 --> 02:14:51,000
Kashou: Okay, next.

1891
02:14:51,000 --> 02:14:54,000
Chocola & Vanilla: Guhhmeooow?!\nMeooow?!

1892
02:14:54,000 --> 02:14:57,000
Chocola: Ahh... A-Ahhh... M-Master... Auuuuuh~

1893
02:14:57,000 --> 02:15:00,000
Vanilla: Hiss! Just what are you doing?! Hiss!

1894
02:15:00,000 --> 02:15:03,000
Kashou: Clapping-in-the-face test, also failed.

1895
02:15:03,000 --> 02:15:06,000
Chocola: Meow meow! Meow, meow meow meow!!

1896
02:15:06,000 --> 02:15:09,000
Vanilla: Meow meow! Meow, meow meow meow!!

1897
02:15:09,000 --> 02:15:13,000
Chocola: Guhmeow meow meow meow! Meow meow! Meow meow meow!!

1898
02:15:13,000 --> 02:15:17,000
Vanilla: Guhmeow meow meow meow! Meow meow! Meow meow meow!!

1899
02:15:17,000 --> 02:15:19,000
Kashou: Feather lure test, failed!

1900
02:15:19,000 --> 02:15:23,000
Chocola: Weheheheh~ ♪ Th-This is nothing, this is nothing~ ♪

1901
02:15:23,000 --> 02:15:28,000
Chocola: Catnip is da best...! It really is da bomb~ Purrrrrrrrrrr~ ♪

1902
02:15:28,000 --> 02:15:34,000
Vanilla: It feels like my brain is melting... It can't be beat, it really can't... ♪

1903
02:15:34,000 --> 02:15:38,000
Vanilla: More! I need more of this~! Myaheheh, meohohoh~ ♪

1904
02:15:38,000 --> 02:15:40,000
Kashou: Catnip test, also failed.

1905
02:15:40,000 --> 02:15:44,000
Chocola: Myahahaha~ ♪ Vanilla, we failed~ Myahahaha~ ♪

1906
02:15:44,000 --> 02:15:50,000
Vanilla: It doesn't even matter anymore~ I'm taking this catnip and going to sleep~ Zzz...

1907
02:15:50,000 --> 02:15:54,000
*Their first time on catnip and they're basically little drunks.*

1908
02:15:54,000 --> 02:15:57,000
*... Will they really be fine after all this?*

1909
02:15:57,000 --> 02:16:02,000
*Well, it's the first day, anyways. I'll just leave it at that. Yeah.*

1910
02:16:02,000 --> 02:16:06,000
Kashou: Come on, if you're gonna sleep, do it in your own bed...

1911
02:16:06,000 --> 02:16:09,000
Chocola: Myaahn~ ♪ "Bed?" Master, you pervert~ ♪

1912
02:16:09,000 --> 02:16:14,000
Vanilla: Just what are you planning to do to us while we're intoxicated like this~

1913
02:16:14,000 --> 02:16:16,000
Kashou: You two really are a pain.

1914
02:16:16,000 --> 02:16:20,000
Kashou: Come on, let's go. I've got a grip on you, so stand up.

1915
02:16:20,000 --> 02:16:23,000
Chocola: Myaahn~ ♪ Master, I want you to carry me~ ♪

1916
02:16:23,000 --> 02:16:27,000
Vanilla: I-I can't feel any love in the way you're holding me~

1917
02:16:27,000 --> 02:16:31,000
*This is not good at all. I can't help but feel this is bad.*

1918
02:16:31,000 --> 02:16:36,000
*I thought about that as I carried the two drunken catgirls to their bed.*

1919
02:16:36,000 --> 02:16:41,000
*After that, I threw myself completely into reading those cheat sheets.*

1920
02:16:41,000 --> 02:16:42,000
Chocola: We're back~!

1921
02:16:42,000 --> 02:16:43,000
Vanilla: We're back~

1922
02:16:43,000 --> 02:16:45,000
Kashou: Oh, welcome home, you two.

1923
02:16:45,000 --> 02:16:48,000
Kashou: Any problems with delivery or payment?

1924
02:16:48,000 --> 02:16:52,000
Chocola: Of course not! It was a totally perfect delivery!

1925
02:16:52,000 --> 02:16:56,000
Vanilla: Mission completed without incident. Perfect.

1926
02:16:56,000 --> 02:16:59,000
Chocola: After all, Chocola and Vanilla...

1927
02:16:59,000 --> 02:17:02,000
Chocola: ... are splendid, Bell-holding catgirls! ♪

1928
02:17:02,000 --> 02:17:07,000
Vanilla: Worrying is unnecessary with two Bell-holding catgirls around.

1929
02:17:07,000 --> 02:17:12,000
*The brand new Bells around Chocola and Vanilla's necks glittered brightly.*

1930
02:17:12,000 --> 02:17:15,000
*Chocola had a silver colored Bell...*

1931
02:17:15,000 --> 02:17:17,000
*... And Vanilla a gold colored one.*

1932
02:17:17,000 --> 02:17:25,000
*With proof that they had become independent catgirls, they both had blossoming smiles, full of pride on their faces.*

1933
02:17:25,000 --> 02:17:29,000
Kashou: Well, they were really close to failing though.

1934
02:17:29,000 --> 02:17:33,000
Chocola: Even if it was just by a hair, a pass is a pass~ ♪

1935
02:17:33,000 --> 02:17:38,000
Vanilla: They say that the rate of passing on the first try is 5 percent.

1936
02:17:38,000 --> 02:17:46,000
Vanilla: Besides, Chocola and I were the youngest catgirls in our group to pass. I think that calls for a bit more praise.

1937
02:17:46,000 --> 02:17:51,000
Kashou: All right, all right. You two are La Soleil's star poster catgirls.

1938
02:17:51,000 --> 02:17:54,000
*I answered, rubbing their heads as always.*

1939
02:17:54,000 --> 02:18:00,000
*Actually, this was the first time we had received a delivery order from a customer.*

1940
02:18:00,000 --> 02:18:09,000
*With my cell phone I was able to check up on them to make sure everything was all right every few minutes through the GPS in their Bells.*

1941
02:18:09,000 --> 02:18:13,000
*I really did want to follow behind them, but I restrained myself.*

1942
02:18:13,000 --> 02:18:20,000
*It was their first errand, so naturally as their owner, I was fraught with worry and couldn't sit still.*

1943
02:18:20,000 --> 02:18:24,000
Chocola: We made sure to say hi to everyone along the way too!

1944
02:18:24,000 --> 02:18:29,000
Vanilla: We made sure to advertise the store perfectly as walking poster catgirls.

1945
02:18:29,000 --> 02:18:35,000
Vanilla: If we raise the sales of the cafe, then I'll hope that we'll receive a reward.

1946
02:18:35,000 --> 02:18:41,000
Chocola: Yay~ ♪ Chocola is fine with gaining the privilege to take baths with Master!

1947
02:18:41,000 --> 02:18:49,000
Chocola: Ah, but Chocola would also be happy if you bought clothes and stuff for her too~ ♪ That's good from time to time!

1948
02:18:49,000 --> 02:18:56,000
Vanilla: I also desire clothing. At the very least, I will put up with Master's perverted interests.

1949
02:18:56,000 --> 02:19:02,000
Kashou: I wasn't going to acknowledge you, but since when did I have such interests?!

1950
02:19:02,000 --> 02:19:08,000
Vanilla: I was thinking it would be a good idea to throw in a joke as a proud Bell-holder.

1951
02:19:08,000 --> 02:19:13,000
*I didn't think having a Bell was a qualification to become an entertainer...*

1952
02:19:13,000 --> 02:19:19,000
*Perhaps this was some of the additional vocabulary they had learned when studying for the exam.*

1953
02:19:19,000 --> 02:19:23,000
*It didn't seem like they were any different from before though.*

1954
02:19:23,000 --> 02:19:29,000
Kashou: Okay, I'll think up something special. Don't get your hopes up though, okay?

1955
02:19:29,000 --> 02:19:31,000
Chocola: Yay! Chocola loves Master~!

1956
02:19:31,000 --> 02:19:33,000
Vanilla: Master is the best...!

1957
02:19:33,000 --> 02:19:37,000
*Taking a bath with me is completely out of the question though.*

1958
02:19:37,000 --> 02:19:41,000
*But saying that is a bit of a pain, so I won't mention anything.*

1959
02:19:41,000 --> 02:19:46,000
Chocola: Meow~ ♪ Chocola's so happy that you're pleased with us meow~ ♪

1960
02:19:46,000 --> 02:19:50,000
Chocola: "You two are La Soleil's star poster catgirls."

1961
02:19:50,000 --> 02:19:55,000
Chocola: That's what you said~! Chocola is about to die from happiness~♪

1962
02:19:55,000 --> 02:19:57,000
Kashou: Ouch! Ouch! Stop, that hurts!

1963
02:19:57,000 --> 02:20:00,000
Vanilla: Now Master can't live without us.

1964
02:20:00,000 --> 02:20:05,000
Chocola: Meow, do you really think so?! Bells are amazing! So amazing!!

1965
02:20:05,000 --> 02:20:09,000
Kashou: Don't say things to deliberately confuse Chocola.

1966
02:20:09,000 --> 02:20:15,000
Chocola: Chocola guesses that's true. We only just got our Bells after all. Ahaha...

1967
02:20:15,000 --> 02:20:18,000
Vanilla: Ah, Chocola just got super depressed.

1968
02:20:18,000 --> 02:20:21,000
Kashou: I told you not to do that, you trickster.

1969
02:20:21,000 --> 02:20:25,000
Vanilla: Master's worth went way up, so now it's just right.

1970
02:20:25,000 --> 02:20:29,000
Vanilla: Chocola will be back to normal soon anyways.

1971
02:20:29,000 --> 02:20:33,000
Vanilla: Besides, Chocola looks so cute when she's down.

1972
02:20:33,000 --> 02:20:35,000
Kashou: Aren't you clever.

1973
02:20:35,000 --> 02:20:38,000
*Well, I suppose I agree with her though.*

1974
02:20:38,000 --> 02:20:42,000
*She looks beyond cute when she's all sulky like this.*

1975
02:20:42,000 --> 02:20:50,000
Kashou: Ah, looks like we're running low on supplies. I'm going to have to go out and buy a couple things on my break.

1976
02:20:50,000 --> 02:20:54,000
Chocola: Shopping?! Chocola also wants to go! A shopping date!!

1977
02:20:54,000 --> 02:20:57,000
Vanilla: See, she's already back to normal.

1978
02:20:57,000 --> 02:21:01,000
Kashou: Well, there isn't a lot of time, so we need to get going.

1979
02:21:01,000 --> 02:21:04,000
Chocola: Okay! Chocola's going to go get changed~ ♪

1980
02:21:04,000 --> 02:21:07,000
*Today was just another normal day at La Soleil.*

1981
02:21:07,000 --> 02:21:11,000
Chocola: Huh? The takoyaki seller isn't here today either.

1982
02:21:11,000 --> 02:21:15,000
Vanilla: We haven't seen them since the bakery opened.

1983
02:21:15,000 --> 02:21:22,000
Kashou: Maybe it's their day off today or maybe they're only open when there's a lot of people around.

1984
02:21:22,000 --> 02:21:27,000
Chocola: I was hoping that young catgirl would drop by our bakery too, meow.

1985
02:21:27,000 --> 02:21:33,000
Vanilla: I even brought our bakery's business card to give to her. How unfortunate.

1986
02:21:33,000 --> 02:21:36,000
Kashou: Well, we'll see them again some day.

1987
02:21:36,000 --> 02:21:41,000
Kashou: You never know! We'll probably see them sometime in the future.

1988
02:21:41,000 --> 02:21:44,000
Chocola: That's true. It's definitely possible~ ♪

1989
02:21:44,000 --> 02:21:47,000
Vanilla: After all, our battle has only just begun.

1990
02:21:47,000 --> 02:21:51,000
*We crossed the park path that we had grown used to walking.*

1991
02:21:51,000 --> 02:21:55,000
*There was a gentle breeze blowing in from the coast.*

1992
02:21:55,000 --> 02:21:59,000
Chocola: Mm~ This breeze feels nice. Chocola loves it.

1993
02:21:59,000 --> 02:22:05,000
Vanilla: This is a place you can get used to living in. A new town isn't bad, either.

1994
02:22:05,000 --> 02:22:09,000
*The faintly salty breeze blew into their squinted eyes.*

1995
02:22:09,000 --> 02:22:13,000
*I turned around and saw a bench enter my line of vision.*

1996
02:22:13,000 --> 02:22:17,000
Kashou: Well, there's still time, so why don't we take a break?

1997
02:22:17,000 --> 02:22:21,000
Chocola: Yay, that sounds good~ ♪ Let's take a break!

1998
02:22:21,000 --> 02:22:27,000
Vanilla: In that case, I shall go buy some drinks. With courageous heroism. Please give me money.

1999
02:22:27,000 --> 02:22:30,000
Kashou: Thank you very much, Miss Vanilla.

2000
02:22:30,000 --> 02:22:33,000
*I gave the graceful poster catgirl money.*

2001
02:22:33,000 --> 02:22:37,000
*With light steps, Vanilla walked towards the vending machine.*

2002
02:22:37,000 --> 02:22:40,000
Chocola: We sat here like this last time too, huh.

2003
02:22:40,000 --> 02:22:43,000
Kashou: That's right. Just like this, huh.

2004
02:22:43,000 --> 02:22:46,000
*She was talking about the day after I moved.*

2005
02:22:46,000 --> 02:22:49,000
*It seemed like it was quite a while ago now.*

2006
02:22:49,000 --> 02:22:54,000
Kashou: I wonder how things would've turned out if I had ended up on my own.

2007
02:22:54,000 --> 02:22:56,000
Chocola: Chocola wonders too.

2008
02:22:56,000 --> 02:23:01,000
Chocola: But one thing is certain. There's no point in thinking about it.

2009
02:23:01,000 --> 02:23:03,000
*Chocola fondly looked at me.*

2010
02:23:03,000 --> 02:23:07,000
Kashou: That's true. No reason to talk about ifs and buts.

2011
02:23:07,000 --> 02:23:10,000
Chocola: That's not it either, though.

2012
02:23:10,000 --> 02:23:11,000
Kashou: It's not...?

2013
02:23:11,000 --> 02:23:13,000
Kashou: ... What do you mean?

2014
02:23:13,000 --> 02:23:16,000
*Not understanding what she meant, I asked again.*

2015
02:23:16,000 --> 02:23:22,000
*She closed her eyes a bit and I could see a faintly mischievous smile creep across her face.*

2016
02:23:22,000 --> 02:23:27,000
Chocola: No matter what happens, Chocola will always be there with Master.

2017
02:23:27,000 --> 02:23:33,000
Chocola: So that's why there's no point in thinking about things if you were by yourself.

2018
02:23:33,000 --> 02:23:34,000
Kashou: ... Chocola.

2019
02:23:34,000 --> 02:23:37,000
*Unexpectedly, my heart began to beat loudly.*

2020
02:23:37,000 --> 02:23:39,000
*... My face felt flushed.*

2021
02:23:39,000 --> 02:23:43,000
*I couldn't bear looking at such a genuine smile any longer.*

2022
02:23:43,000 --> 02:23:48,000
*As I averted my gaze away, the color of her silver Bell caught my eye.*

2023
02:23:48,000 --> 02:23:54,000
*... I always thought of her like a daughter, but she's growing up with each passing day.*

2024
02:23:54,000 --> 02:23:57,000
*Once again, I realized something that obvious.*

2025
02:23:57,000 --> 02:24:00,000
*I took a deep breath, cooling my flushed face.*

2026
02:24:00,000 --> 02:24:04,000
Kashou: Ahh, please always be by my side from here on out.

2027
02:24:04,000 --> 02:24:07,000
Kashou: I'm so happy when you're with me.

2028
02:24:07,000 --> 02:24:09,000
*I answered her honestly.*

2029
02:24:09,000 --> 02:24:12,000
*I rubbed Chocola's head more gently than usual.*

2030
02:24:12,000 --> 02:24:15,000
Chocola: M-Master...?! Eh...? Fuwah...!

2031
02:24:15,000 --> 02:24:16,000
Chocola: ......

2032
02:24:16,000 --> 02:24:18,000
Kashou: Hmm? What's wrong, Chocola?

2033
02:24:18,000 --> 02:24:21,000
Chocola: I-It's nothing... meow...! Y-Yeah...!

2034
02:24:21,000 --> 02:24:23,000
Kashou: You say it's nothing, but...

2035
02:24:23,000 --> 02:24:27,000
Chocola: I-It's really is nothing...! Nothing at all meow...!

2036
02:24:27,000 --> 02:24:35,000
Chocola: Well, actually, there's a really sweet smell... coming from you, Master, which kinda made Chocola space out...

2037
02:24:35,000 --> 02:24:37,000
Kashou: A sweet smell... Hm?

2038
02:24:37,000 --> 02:24:40,000
*I tried to smell what she was talking about.*

2039
02:24:40,000 --> 02:24:43,000
*Of course, I didn't smell anything sweet.*

2040
02:24:43,000 --> 02:24:48,000
Chocola: A sweet like... tingly feeling? It's like everything has become light...

2041
02:24:48,000 --> 02:24:53,000
Chocola: B-But it's not a bad thing though. It feels kind of nice actually...

2042
02:24:53,000 --> 02:24:59,000
Chocola: Ah, it's a bit like the sensation we had from that catnip before... Hauuu~

2043
02:24:59,000 --> 02:25:01,000
*She let out a long feverish sigh.*

2044
02:25:01,000 --> 02:25:05,000
*As she sighed, she gazed downwards with her face flushed red.*

2045
02:25:05,000 --> 02:25:08,000
*She glanced up at me, her eyes gleaming.*

2046
02:25:08,000 --> 02:25:12,000
Chocola: Master...? Chocola will... uhm, will work even harder...!

2047
02:25:12,000 --> 02:25:17,000
Chocola: So that Master will be even happier... Chocola will work hard...!

2048
02:25:17,000 --> 02:25:21,000
*She squeezed her hands tightly in front of her chest...*

2049
02:25:21,000 --> 02:25:26,000
*... as she said that to me with a sorrowful voice and forlorn look on her face.*

2050
02:25:26,000 --> 02:25:30,000
*... Things somehow feel a bit different than before.*

2051
02:25:30,000 --> 02:25:36,000
*I knew that she was happy, but it seemed like she was holding something back at the same time.*

2052
02:25:36,000 --> 02:25:40,000
*She wasn't like her usual feverish and energetic self.*

2053
02:25:40,000 --> 02:25:42,000
*It was almost as if--*

2054
02:25:42,000 --> 02:25:43,000
Vanilla: Chocola?

2055
02:25:43,000 --> 02:25:46,000
Chocola & Vanilla: Meoooooowwww?!\nMeoowww?!

2056
02:25:46,000 --> 02:25:47,000
Kashou: Uwahh?!

2057
02:25:47,000 --> 02:25:53,000
Chocola: Y-You surprised Chocola! You really did!! What are you trying to do, Vanilla? Sheesh!!

2058
02:25:53,000 --> 02:25:59,000
Vanilla: Oh, this is what you'd call a false accusation. Or an unfounded suspicion.

2059
02:25:59,000 --> 02:26:02,000
Kashou: Y-You two surprised me too...!

2060
02:26:02,000 --> 02:26:09,000
Vanilla: It's your fault because you were using me to be able to get all close and lovey-dovey with Chocola.

2061
02:26:09,000 --> 02:26:14,000
Kashou: I wasn't doing anything other than rubbing Chocola's head like always.

2062
02:26:14,000 --> 02:26:19,000
Vanilla: Your scent is different. A catgirl's nose can't be fooled. Sniff sniff~

2063
02:26:19,000 --> 02:26:26,000
Vanilla: In any case, I think I'm going to sit between Master and Chocola here. Move out of my way.

2064
02:26:26,000 --> 02:26:33,000
Vanilla: If you don't make some space, I'm going to have to use force. I'm going to sit down here either way.

2065
02:26:33,000 --> 02:26:38,000
Kashou: Wait up, wait up, wait up! You're pretty heavy there, Vanilla-san.

2066
02:26:38,000 --> 02:26:40,000
Vanilla: Am not. Master is so rude.

2067
02:26:40,000 --> 02:26:42,000
Kashou: That's not what I mean.

2068
02:26:42,000 --> 02:26:49,000
Chocola: Meow~! That's not fair, getting to sit on Master's lap like that! Chocola wants to too! Here I go!

2069
02:26:49,000 --> 02:26:53,000
Chocola: Give me one of Master's legs! That's fair, okay?

2070
02:26:53,000 --> 02:26:57,000
Vanilla: This is what humans call "two blessings at once," right.

2071
02:26:57,000 --> 02:27:03,000
Kashou: Before that, you two do know about the concept of public morals in society, right...

2072
02:27:03,000 --> 02:27:07,000
Kashou: In any case, please get off my lap. Seriously, now.

2073
02:27:07,000 --> 02:27:10,000
Vanilla: But you're enjoying this though. Denied.

2074
02:27:10,000 --> 02:27:14,000
Chocola: Okay then, Chocola also denies your request~ Purr purr~ ♪

2075
02:27:14,000 --> 02:27:17,000
*Before I knew it, Chocola was her old self again.*

2076
02:27:17,000 --> 02:27:22,000
*Well, as long as she's happy, there's nothing to worry about, but...*

2077
02:27:22,000 --> 02:27:27,000
*In the end, my breaktime ended up not feeling like a break at all...*

2078
02:27:27,000 --> 02:27:30,000
*... and was completely spent with the two of them.*

2079
02:27:30,000 --> 02:27:34,000
Vanilla: Chocola, can you give this invoice to Master?

2080
02:27:34,000 --> 02:27:38,000
Chocola: Ah, o-okay. Understood! Chocola will go do that now!

2081
02:27:38,000 --> 02:27:42,000
Chocola: Master, here is the invoice for tomorrow's order.

2082
02:27:42,000 --> 02:27:45,000
Kashou: Sounds good, I'll take a look at it later.

2083
02:27:45,000 --> 02:27:48,000
Chocola: Okay, I'll put it in the usual place then.

2084
02:27:48,000 --> 02:27:49,000
Chocola: ...... Stare.

2085
02:27:49,000 --> 02:27:50,000
Chocola: ......

2086
02:27:50,000 --> 02:27:51,000
Chocola: ...... Pat.

2087
02:27:51,000 --> 02:27:52,000
Kashou: ...... Hmm?

2088
02:27:52,000 --> 02:27:55,000
Chocola: Sniff, sniff. Sniff, sniff, sniff...

2089
02:27:55,000 --> 02:27:57,000
Chocola: Huff~ Pant... Huff~ ♪

2090
02:27:57,000 --> 02:27:59,000
Kashou: ... Uhm, Chocola-san?

2091
02:27:59,000 --> 02:28:01,000
Chocola: Meow. What's up, Master~?

2092
02:28:01,000 --> 02:28:05,000
Kashou: Uh, "Meow. What's up?" isn't the answer I'm looking for...

2093
02:28:05,000 --> 02:28:06,000
Chocola: Hmm~? Mmm~?

2094
02:28:06,000 --> 02:28:08,000
Chocola: Meow?! Meow, meow, meow?!

2095
02:28:08,000 --> 02:28:11,000
Chocola: Wh-Why is Chocola stuck to Master's back?!

2096
02:28:11,000 --> 02:28:15,000
Chocola: Master, you shouldn't force Chocola onto your back, okay?!

2097
02:28:15,000 --> 02:28:20,000
Kashou: Hold up, hold up. Clearly, you stuck yourself onto me, Chocola.

2098
02:28:20,000 --> 02:28:23,000
Chocola: Huh...? Chocola did? To Master?

2099
02:28:23,000 --> 02:28:25,000
Kashou: Yeah. Exactly that.

2100
02:28:25,000 --> 02:28:27,000
Chocola: Hmm...? Hmmmm...?

2101
02:28:27,000 --> 02:28:31,000
Chocola: ... Even with that said, I don't think I would've...?

2102
02:28:31,000 --> 02:28:35,000
*Puzzled, she frantically tilted her head left and right.*

2103
02:28:35,000 --> 02:28:38,000
*... Is she sick with some terrible disease?*

2104
02:28:38,000 --> 02:28:42,000
*This just started happening mere seconds ago though.*

2105
02:28:42,000 --> 02:28:44,000
Kashou: Are you all right?

2106
02:28:44,000 --> 02:28:49,000
Kashou: You've been kind of out of it since we got back from our break.

2107
02:28:49,000 --> 02:28:54,000
Chocola: Ch-Chocola is fine! Chocola is a Bell-holding catgirl after all!

2108
02:28:54,000 --> 02:28:58,000
Chocola: Anyways, I left the invoice over there! Later!

2109
02:28:58,000 --> 02:29:03,000
Kashou: ... Well, if she says she's fine, then I guess there's nothing wrong.

2110
02:29:03,000 --> 02:29:08,000
*It didn't seem like she was making any particular mistakes while working either.*

2111
02:29:08,000 --> 02:29:12,000
*I'll think about things after observing her a bit more.*

2112
02:29:12,000 --> 02:29:15,000
*I thought about that as I watched her head back.*

2113
02:29:15,000 --> 02:29:17,000
Chocola: Sigh... pant... sigh~

2114
02:29:17,000 --> 02:29:19,000
Vanilla: Are you all right, Chocola?

2115
02:29:19,000 --> 02:29:24,000
Chocola: Meow? Ah, yeah, Chocola was just thinking that today is kinda hot.

2116
02:29:24,000 --> 02:29:28,000
Vanilla: I don't think it's any hotter than usual though...

2117
02:29:28,000 --> 02:29:31,000
Chocola: Ah, we're almost out of mille-feuille.

2118
02:29:31,000 --> 02:29:34,000
Chocola: Chocola's going to go let Master know.

2119
02:29:34,000 --> 02:29:36,000
Vanilla: Ah, Chocola...

2120
02:29:36,000 --> 02:29:38,000
Kashou: Oh, Chocola. What's wrong?

2121
02:29:38,000 --> 02:29:39,000
Chocola: Ah, Master...

2122
02:29:39,000 --> 02:29:44,000
Chocola: Meow, uhm... well, uhm... What did Chocola need to tell you again?

2123
02:29:44,000 --> 02:29:46,000
Kashou: You're telling me...

2124
02:29:46,000 --> 02:29:50,000
*Chocola spaced out as she tilted her head in confusion again.*

2125
02:29:50,000 --> 02:29:53,000
*It didn't seem like she was doing it on purpose...*

2126
02:29:53,000 --> 02:29:55,000
*I wonder what's gotten into her?*

2127
02:29:55,000 --> 02:29:58,000
*It was clear that she wasn't herself.*

2128
02:29:58,000 --> 02:30:01,000
*Somehow, she looks a bit flushed too.*

2129
02:30:01,000 --> 02:30:05,000
Kashou: I'm just going to feel your forehead here, okay?

2130
02:30:05,000 --> 02:30:07,000
Chocola: Hyaugh...! M-Master...!

2131
02:30:07,000 --> 02:30:09,000
*I touched her small forehead.*

2132
02:30:09,000 --> 02:30:11,000
*Her body shivered with a twitch.*

2133
02:30:11,000 --> 02:30:16,000
*I could feel Chocola shivering slightly through the palm of my hand.*

2134
02:30:16,000 --> 02:30:20,000
*It didn't particularly seem like she had a fever or anything...*

2135
02:30:20,000 --> 02:30:22,000
Chocola: Au... haa, Master...

2136
02:30:22,000 --> 02:30:24,000
Kashou: Huh, Chocola...?

2137
02:30:24,000 --> 02:30:27,000
Chocola: Meow~ ♪ Sniff, sniff... meowww, Master~ ♪

2138
02:30:27,000 --> 02:30:29,000
Kashou: Wait, Chocola...? H-Hey...

2139
02:30:29,000 --> 02:30:33,000
Chocola: Sniff, sniff... Master smells so sweet~ ♪ Haah, meow~ ♪

2140
02:30:33,000 --> 02:30:36,000
*She cooed in a sweet voice I hadn't heard before.*

2141
02:30:36,000 --> 02:30:40,000
*Still clinging to me, she rubbed her cheek against mine.*

2142
02:30:40,000 --> 02:30:43,000
Chocola: Master... Master~ ♪ Purr, purr, purr~ ♪

2143
02:30:43,000 --> 02:30:46,000
*It was clear that she wasn't feeling like herself.*

2144
02:30:46,000 --> 02:30:49,000
*Her voice was especially sugary sweet.*

2145
02:30:49,000 --> 02:30:53,000
*You could even say that there was a stickiness to it.*

2146
02:30:53,000 --> 02:30:55,000
*Her grip on my back tightened.*

2147
02:30:55,000 --> 02:30:59,000
*I could feel a certain degree of sensuality in her actions.*

2148
02:30:59,000 --> 02:31:02,000
Chocola: Ah...! Ch-Chocola is sorry...!!

2149
02:31:02,000 --> 02:31:08,000
Chocola: U-Uhm... Oh, errands! Chocola had errands to do, right?! Uhm... uhm, well...!

2150
02:31:08,000 --> 02:31:11,000
*She suddenly came to her senses and let go of me.*

2151
02:31:11,000 --> 02:31:15,000
*She flailed her arms about as she howled in confusion.*

2152
02:31:15,000 --> 02:31:18,000
Vanilla: Chocola, about the mille-feuille...

2153
02:31:18,000 --> 02:31:22,000
Chocola: Ah, yes! That's it! Thanks for the help, Vanilla!

2154
02:31:22,000 --> 02:31:28,000
Chocola: Master, we're almost out of mille-feuille, so Chocola's going to bring out some more!

2155
02:31:28,000 --> 02:31:33,000
Chocola: It's in the back refrigerator, right? Mille-feuille, mille-feuille...

2156
02:31:33,000 --> 02:31:34,000
Vanilla: ......

2157
02:31:34,000 --> 02:31:38,000
Kashou: Hey, Vanilla. Do you know what's with Chocola?

2158
02:31:38,000 --> 02:31:41,000
Kashou: She's acting weird today, right?

2159
02:31:41,000 --> 02:31:46,000
Vanilla: She can be silly sometimes, but she's definitely being weird today.

2160
02:31:46,000 --> 02:31:47,000
*A breakthrough.*

2161
02:31:47,000 --> 02:31:48,000
*This felt promising.*

2162
02:31:48,000 --> 02:31:51,000
Kashou: By the way, I've been curious, but...

2163
02:31:51,000 --> 02:31:54,000
Kashou: Do I smell strange or something?

2164
02:31:54,000 --> 02:31:55,000
Vanilla: Normal.

2165
02:31:55,000 --> 02:31:56,000
Kashou: ... Right?

2166
02:31:56,000 --> 02:32:00,000
*It was somewhat relieving to hear that I smelled normal.*

2167
02:32:00,000 --> 02:32:04,000
*Well, it meant that I didn't smell especially sweet or anything.*

2168
02:32:04,000 --> 02:32:08,000
Vanilla: Could it be...? Hrmm. There's no proof though...

2169
02:32:08,000 --> 02:32:09,000
Kashou: ?

2170
02:32:09,000 --> 02:32:12,000
*Vanilla was drawn in by what I had said.*

2171
02:32:12,000 --> 02:32:15,000
*It seemed as if she realized something.*

2172
02:32:15,000 --> 02:32:20,000
Kashou: Either way, can you tell Chocola to go up to her room to rest?

2173
02:32:20,000 --> 02:32:23,000
Vanilla: Okay, but what about the bakery?

2174
02:32:23,000 --> 02:32:29,000
Kashou: It's starting to calm down out there, so I'll take care of things afterwards.

2175
02:32:29,000 --> 02:32:32,000
Chocola: Wh-What?! Chocola is totally fine though!

2176
02:32:32,000 --> 02:32:38,000
Chocola: After all, Chocola has a Bell, a Bell! This is proof that Chocola is a mature catgir--

2177
02:32:38,000 --> 02:32:43,000
Vanilla: Mission acknowledged. Chocola has been captured. Engaging Eviction Mode.

2178
02:32:43,000 --> 02:32:48,000
Chocola: Meowwwwwww! Master, s-save me...! Chocola... Chocola is--!!

2179
02:32:48,000 --> 02:32:49,000
Kashou: ......

2180
02:32:49,000 --> 02:32:53,000
Kashou: Let's see, we needed some more mille-feuille, right.

2181
02:32:53,000 --> 02:32:58,000
*Surprisingly, Vanilla was the type who could rise to a challenge when necessary.*

2182
02:32:58,000 --> 02:33:01,000
*I stood in front of the wide-open refrigerator...*

2183
02:33:01,000 --> 02:33:08,000
*... and despite the distance, I could still hear the voices of my poster catgirls right behind me.*

2184
02:33:08,000 --> 02:33:10,000
Chocola: Pant... mm, pant...

2185
02:33:10,000 --> 02:33:15,000
Chocola: Oh no... Chocola can't stop her heart from beating so fast...

2186
02:33:15,000 --> 02:33:19,000
Chocola: Just thinking about... Master's scent... Hauuu...

2187
02:33:19,000 --> 02:33:25,000
Chocola: This feeling... inside Chocola's body... it's so hot... and overwhelming... Haah...

2188
02:33:25,000 --> 02:33:29,000
Chocola: Mm... ah, it... it feels good to touch Chocola here...

2189
02:33:29,000 --> 02:33:32,000
Chocola: Mmph, myah... haah, auu... M-mmph...

2190
02:33:32,000 --> 02:33:35,000
Kashou: Are you feeling any better, Chocola?

2191
02:33:35,000 --> 02:33:37,000
Chocola: Meeeeeeeeeeowwwww?!

2192
02:33:37,000 --> 02:33:38,000
Kashou: Uwaagh?!

2193
02:33:38,000 --> 02:33:44,000
Chocola: M-Master! I-It's common courtesy to knock when coming into someone's room meow!!

2194
02:33:44,000 --> 02:33:47,000
Kashou: Huh? A-Ahh. Really? Sorry about that...

2195
02:33:47,000 --> 02:33:51,000
*I didn't really get why, but she was pretty mad at me.*

2196
02:33:51,000 --> 02:33:55,000
*I've never knocked on their doors before now though...*

2197
02:33:55,000 --> 02:33:59,000
*Besides, Chocola would enter my room without knocking too.*

2198
02:33:59,000 --> 02:34:06,000
Kashou: Okay, well, I'll be sure to be careful next time, but more importantly, how are you feeling?

2199
02:34:06,000 --> 02:34:11,000
Kashou: I'd like to take you to the clinic, but do you feel up to walking there?

2200
02:34:11,000 --> 02:34:13,000
Chocola: Huh...? The clinic...?

2201
02:34:13,000 --> 02:34:16,000
Chocola: Ah, Master... What about the bakery...?

2202
02:34:16,000 --> 02:34:20,000
Kashou: We're closed. We decided to close up early today.

2203
02:34:20,000 --> 02:34:22,000
Chocola: Closed... Huh, wh-why?

2204
02:34:22,000 --> 02:34:27,000
Kashou: Do you think I could leave you be when you're not feeling well?

2205
02:34:27,000 --> 02:34:33,000
Kashou: Just listen to me and let's go up to the clinic. Do you think you can stand?

2206
02:34:33,000 --> 02:34:36,000
Chocola: D-Don't...! If you come too close...!

2207
02:34:36,000 --> 02:34:41,000
Kashou: What are you talking about? You look like you're about to fall over.

2208
02:34:41,000 --> 02:34:44,000
Kashou: Come on, I'll give you a hand.

2209
02:34:44,000 --> 02:34:47,000
*I stood next to Chocola and put my arm around her.*

2210
02:34:47,000 --> 02:34:50,000
Chocola: Ahhh...! M-Master... Haah, meowwww...!

2211
02:34:50,000 --> 02:34:53,000
Kashou: Wh-What's wrong? Did I hurt you?

2212
02:34:53,000 --> 02:34:58,000
Chocola: I-It isn't pain...! Fuwahh... It's just that sweet smell of yours...

2213
02:34:58,000 --> 02:35:04,000
Chocola: Pant, pant... Chocola really doesn't need to go to the clinic, so... myaahhh...

2214
02:35:04,000 --> 02:35:07,000
*She slurred her words as she refused my request.*

2215
02:35:07,000 --> 02:35:11,000
*She was definitely acting a lot stranger than before.*

2216
02:35:11,000 --> 02:35:15,000
Kashou: Enough with that now. I'm taking you to the clinic, okay?

2217
02:35:15,000 --> 02:35:21,000
Kashou: That's the whole reason why I decided to close the bakery today anyways. Come on now.

2218
02:35:21,000 --> 02:35:25,000
Chocola: Ch-Chocola ishh a mature Bell-holdin' catgrrrl thoughhh...

2219
02:35:25,000 --> 02:35:33,000
Chocola: Chocola's Bell ishh rational proof that sheesh a catgrrrl that can hold back from her instinctshh... Hauun...

2220
02:35:33,000 --> 02:35:36,000
Kashou: Rational? Hold back from your instincts...?

2221
02:35:36,000 --> 02:35:40,000
Vanilla: Chocola, could it be... sniff, sniff, sniff, sniff~

2222
02:35:40,000 --> 02:35:45,000
*Vanilla pushed her face against Chocola's body as she sniffed her.*

2223
02:35:45,000 --> 02:35:47,000
Vanilla: I knew it. You came?

2224
02:35:47,000 --> 02:35:48,000
Kashou: "Came...?"

2225
02:35:48,000 --> 02:35:52,000
Kashou: ... You don't mean, that mating season thing, right?

2226
02:35:52,000 --> 02:35:57,000
*Now that she mentioned it, that was noted in the book I bought before.*

2227
02:35:57,000 --> 02:36:01,000
*I thought that it was still a bit early for them though...*

2228
02:36:01,000 --> 02:36:05,000
Chocola: Ch-Chocola gets it! Chocola gets it already...!

2229
02:36:05,000 --> 02:36:12,000
Chocola: Chocola understands that Master didn't mean anything else when he was praising Chocola, but...!

2230
02:36:12,000 --> 02:36:16,000
Kashou: Ahh, please always be by my side from here on out.

2231
02:36:16,000 --> 02:36:19,000
Kashou: I'm so happy when you're with me.

2232
02:36:19,000 --> 02:36:22,000
Chocola: M-Master...?! Huh...? Fuwah...!

2233
02:36:22,000 --> 02:36:30,000
Chocola: Well, actually, there's a really sweet smell... coming from you, Master, which kinda made Chocola space out...

2234
02:36:30,000 --> 02:36:32,000
Kashou: ... Since back then, huh.

2235
02:36:32,000 --> 02:36:36,000
*"Situations When Dealing With A Fast Maturing Catgirl"*

2236
02:36:36,000 --> 02:36:40,000
*I remembered that a section inside the book was titled that.*

2237
02:36:40,000 --> 02:36:41,000
*Crap.*

2238
02:36:41,000 --> 02:36:48,000
