03:52:56,000 --> 03:52:59,000
Vanilla: Mhmn... I especially love you, Chocola...

3462
03:52:59,000 --> 03:53:02,000
Vanilla: ... so you don't need to be jealous...

3463
03:53:02,000 --> 03:53:05,000
Chocola: Ahah, Vanilla is just so cute~ ♪

3464
03:53:05,000 --> 03:53:11,000
Chocola: Master? Could you give Vanilla and Chocola... one last loving kiss, please?

3465
03:53:11,000 --> 03:53:14,000
Kashou: Yeah. I'll give you many as you want.

3466
03:53:14,000 --> 03:53:17,000
*I gently picked up Vanilla's strengthless body...*

3467
03:53:17,000 --> 03:53:21,000
*... and gave both of my cute catgirls a soft kiss on their lips.*

3468
03:53:21,000 --> 03:53:23,000
Chocola: Mhmn... Master... Zzz zzz...

3469
03:53:23,000 --> 03:53:26,000
Vanilla: Chocola, Master... Zzz zzz...

3470
03:53:26,000 --> 03:53:29,000
Chocola: Haah... Master... Purrrrrr~ ♪

3471
03:53:29,000 --> 03:53:32,000
Vanilla: Mm... Master... Chocola~ ♪ Purrrrrrrrr~ ♪

3472
03:53:32,000 --> 03:53:34,000
*As they let out sleepy breaths...*

3473
03:53:34,000 --> 03:53:38,000
*... the two of them rested their cheeks against my body.*

3474
03:53:38,000 --> 03:53:42,000
*I petted both of their heads, each with one hand...*

3475
03:53:42,000 --> 03:53:47,000
*... and looked up at the ceiling with my mouth still slightly agape.*

3476
03:53:47,000 --> 03:53:53,000
Kashou: ... It's a big bed, but I never thought it would actually be useful in this way, too.

3477
03:53:53,000 --> 03:53:58,000
*And here we were, sleeping right next to each other like a big family.*

3478
03:53:58,000 --> 03:54:02,000
*I murmured that aloud, never thinking this could've happened.*

3479
03:54:02,000 --> 03:54:07,000
Kashou: ... I can't make an excuse about me just going along with it now.

3480
03:54:07,000 --> 03:54:12,000
*From the start, I never intended to make excuses for this, though.*

3481
03:54:12,000 --> 03:54:16,000
*As I felt their softness and warmth throughout my body...*

3482
03:54:16,000 --> 03:54:19,000
*... I pet the two catgirls I honestly cherished.*

3483
03:54:19,000 --> 03:54:21,000
Chocola: Meow... Master, Vanilla...

3484
03:54:21,000 --> 03:54:24,000
Chocola: Master... Vanilla... and Chocola...

3485
03:54:24,000 --> 03:54:30,000
Chocola: Chocola loves everyone... Chocola wants us to always be together~ ♪ Myaom meom...

3486
03:54:30,000 --> 03:54:33,000
Vanilla: Myah... yes, always together...

3487
03:54:33,000 --> 03:54:36,000
Vanilla: Chocola, Master, and me... Myaom meom~ ♪

3488
03:54:36,000 --> 03:54:39,000
Kashou: Yeah, that's right. Always together.

3489
03:54:39,000 --> 03:54:43,000
*The two of them going "myaom meom" in their sleep...*

3490
03:54:43,000 --> 03:54:45,000
*... made me burst out laughing.*

3491
03:54:45,000 --> 03:54:50,000
Kashou: ... It was a lot different from what I was expecting, though.

3492
03:54:50,000 --> 03:54:53,000
*Leaving home by myself, becoming independent...*

3493
03:54:53,000 --> 03:54:58,000
*... taking up all the joys and hardships by myself... or so I'd thought.*

3494
03:54:58,000 --> 03:55:02,000
*I really thought I'd be living all by myself from now on.*

3495
03:55:02,000 --> 03:55:08,000
Kashou: ... I'm pretty lucky, having precious partners I can connect deeply with like this.

3496
03:55:08,000 --> 03:55:13,000
*Sometimes, they'd make things difficult for me, like when they make mistakes...*

3497
03:55:13,000 --> 03:55:19,000
*... But in the end, they're catgirls that support both me and the store the best they can.*

3498
03:55:19,000 --> 03:55:22,000
*Even though we haven't been together that long...*

3499
03:55:22,000 --> 03:55:26,000
*... I couldn't imagine a moment without Chocola and Vanilla.*

3500
03:55:26,000 --> 03:55:29,000
Chocola: Master... Chocola is happy too~ ♪ Zzz...

3501
03:55:29,000 --> 03:55:33,000
Vanilla: Master... Vanilla is also happy now... myah...

3502
03:55:33,000 --> 03:55:35,000
Kashou: Yeah, I am, too. Thanks.

3503
03:55:35,000 --> 03:55:39,000
*I kissed both of them gently as they murmured in their sleep...*

3504
03:55:39,000 --> 03:55:42,000
*... and closed my eyes and drifted off.*

3505
03:55:42,000 --> 03:55:45,000
Shigure: Become ill from being in heat?

3506
03:55:45,000 --> 03:55:48,000
Shigure: I don't think that's possible.

3507
03:55:48,000 --> 03:55:51,000
*Shigure, the first guest of the morning...*

3508
03:55:51,000 --> 03:55:56,000
*... said that with a straight face like it was obvious and sipped her tea.*

3509
03:55:56,000 --> 03:55:59,000
Kashou: Huh... but I've really heard that before...

3510
03:55:59,000 --> 03:56:03,000
Shigure: The catgirls at home are doing just fine, you know.

3511
03:56:03,000 --> 03:56:09,000
Shigure: I'm having them do a bit of exercise to work off the effects of being in heat, though.

3512
03:56:09,000 --> 03:56:14,000
Kashou: ... Come to think of it, I seem to remember seeing that before.

3513
03:56:14,000 --> 03:56:18,000
*I hadn't ever seen them doing "stuff" in the house.*

3514
03:56:18,000 --> 03:56:23,000
*No, being female, there was no way for Shigure to do that with them...*

3515
03:56:23,000 --> 03:56:27,000
Kashou: ... But Vanilla told me they'd get sick from being in heat.

3516
03:56:27,000 --> 03:56:29,000
Kashou: Right, Vanilla?

3517
03:56:29,000 --> 03:56:34,000
Vanilla: Shigure said that I should explain it to Master like that, yawn~

3518
03:56:34,000 --> 03:56:40,000
Chocola: Ah~ Come to think of it, Chocola remembers being told something like that yawnnn~

3519
03:56:40,000 --> 03:56:43,000
Kashou: ... So you're the one who told them.

3520
03:56:43,000 --> 03:56:49,000
Shigure: More importantly, Nii-sama. Whisper today's sweet nothings to your little sister~

3521
03:56:49,000 --> 03:56:55,000
Kashou: You can't just "more importantly" your way around this, you worthless little sister...

3522
03:56:55,000 --> 03:57:00,000
Shigure: Ah, it hurts, Nii-sama~! Though I don't mind it rough, either!

3523
03:57:00,000 --> 03:57:03,000
*She doesn't seem to regret anything.*

3524
03:57:03,000 --> 03:57:06,000
*... Well, I wasn't that angry at her, anyway.*

3525
03:57:06,000 --> 03:57:11,000
*It seemed as if Shigure was able to see through a lot of aspects of me.*

3526
03:57:11,000 --> 03:57:15,000
*Mainly my shame, embarrassment, resentments, in particular.*

3527
03:57:15,000 --> 03:57:20,000
Shigure: Sometimes, the way Nii-sama expresses his love is too rough! Blush~ ♪

3528
03:57:20,000 --> 03:57:25,000
Shigure: Next, let us partake in a sultry kiss between siblings... Mwah! ♪

3529
03:57:25,000 --> 03:57:26,000
Kashou: Don't be dumb.

3530
03:57:26,000 --> 03:57:30,000
*As Shigure sought my lips, I flicked her on the forehead.*

3531
03:57:30,000 --> 03:57:35,000
Shigure: Muuuuh~ I certainly hope there's a carrot to go with this stick.

3532
03:57:35,000 --> 03:57:40,000
Shigure: How could you ever refuse such a cute little sister's entincements?

3533
03:57:40,000 --> 03:57:46,000
Shigure: Aren't you acting rather cold now after Chocola and Vanilla became your catpanions?

3534
03:57:46,000 --> 03:57:50,000
Kashou: Don't say that and make it sound like we've kissed before.

3535
03:57:50,000 --> 03:57:54,000
*Shigure put her hands on her hips and puffed out her cheeks.*

3536
03:57:54,000 --> 03:57:57,000
*It was really hard to get her jokes.*

3537
03:57:57,000 --> 03:58:04,000
*Sometimes, as her older brother, I wondered if it's really safe for her to go outside on her own.*

3538
03:58:04,000 --> 03:58:08,000
*Even more so because she's a heck of a cute little sister.*

3539
03:58:08,000 --> 03:58:13,000
Shigure: I am glad that both Chocola and Vanilla are happy now, though.

3540
03:58:13,000 --> 03:58:17,000
Shigure: They were able to get their Bells by going with Nii-sama.

3541
03:58:17,000 --> 03:58:22,000
Shigure: It also seems like they've experienced love a bit as well, doesn't it?

3542
03:58:22,000 --> 03:58:26,000
*The two catgirls' combed each other's hair, still half-asleep.*

3543
03:58:26,000 --> 03:58:31,000
*Shigure gazed at them as if they were her very own lovely children.*

3544
03:58:31,000 --> 03:58:38,000
Shigure: Not too long ago, they didn't even seem to care much about personal grooming like that, either.

3545
03:58:38,000 --> 03:58:43,000
Shigure: Don't you think things are a little better now too, Nii-sama?

3546
03:58:43,000 --> 03:58:45,000
Kashou: ... Well, in it's own way.

3547
03:58:45,000 --> 03:58:48,000
Shigure: My my, you are just not honest. Teehee~

3548
03:58:48,000 --> 03:58:52,000
*She giggled as if she could see exactly how I truly felt.*

3549
03:58:52,000 --> 03:58:58,000
*... I did have a bit of uncalled-for pride just because I was a little older than her.*

3550
03:58:58,000 --> 03:59:03,000
Shigure: If Chocola and Vanilla weren't going to accept you, I would have myself.

3551
03:59:03,000 --> 03:59:07,000
Shigure: I may be your sister, but even before that, I am a woman.

3552
03:59:07,000 --> 03:59:12,000
Shigure: It would be very difficult to turn down Nii-sama's affection.

3553
03:59:12,000 --> 03:59:16,000
Kashou: Come on now. I couldn't do such things to my little sister.

3554
03:59:16,000 --> 03:59:19,000
Kashou: You're always saying silly stuff like that.

3555
03:59:19,000 --> 03:59:23,000
Shigure: Hyauuh, stop always treating me like a child~

3556
03:59:23,000 --> 03:59:26,000
*I rubbed Shigure's head, messing up her hair.*

3557
03:59:26,000 --> 03:59:28,000
*She grimaced and scowled at me.*

3558
03:59:28,000 --> 03:59:33,000
Shigure: I'm serious, you know? I'll do whatever I can for Nii-sama.

3559
03:59:33,000 --> 03:59:38,000
Kashou: Yeah, yeah. I get it, I get it. Thanks. Take this and that, too!

3560
03:59:38,000 --> 03:59:41,000
Shigure: Geez, Nii-sama! No messing up my hair!

3561
03:59:41,000 --> 03:59:44,000
*She fixed her hair by patting it down.*

3562
03:59:44,000 --> 03:59:47,000
*Yep. She was the same old cute little sister.*

3563
03:59:47,000 --> 03:59:51,000
Shigure: But you do seem to have become kinder too, Nii-sama.

3564
03:59:51,000 --> 03:59:55,000
Shigure: It probably was a good thing for you to leave the house.

3565
03:59:55,000 --> 03:59:58,000
Shigure: ... I do feel a bit lonely, though.

3566
03:59:58,000 --> 04:00:01,000
*With a slightly lower tone in her voice...*

3567
04:00:01,000 --> 04:00:04,000
*... she smiled a somewhat sad and troubled smile.*

3568
04:00:04,000 --> 04:00:08,000
Kashou: ... I've caused a lot of problems for you in the past.

3569
04:00:08,000 --> 04:00:11,000
*When I wasn't able to get along with Dad.*

3570
04:00:11,000 --> 04:00:14,000
*When I'd practice my baking in secret.*

3571
04:00:14,000 --> 04:00:17,000
*When I left without saying anything.*

3572
04:00:17,000 --> 04:00:21,000
*Even after she had realized, she pretended she didn't.*

3573
04:00:21,000 --> 04:00:25,000
*She even secretly helped box up Chocola and Vanilla, too.*

3574
04:00:25,000 --> 04:00:31,000
*... It's hard to imagine that Shigure is my little sister, given how bright she is.*

3575
04:00:31,000 --> 04:00:36,000
Kashou: I'll take good care of Chocola and Vanilla, so you don't need to worry.

3576
04:00:36,000 --> 04:00:38,000
Kashou: Come over whenever you want.

3577
04:00:38,000 --> 04:00:44,000
*I rested my hand on Shigure's cheek, filling it with my feelings of appreciation.*

3578
04:00:44,000 --> 04:00:47,000
Shigure: ... Okay. Thank you very much, Nii-sama.

3579
04:00:47,000 --> 04:00:52,000
*Shigure responded with a soft smile and by leaning her cheek against my hand.*

3580
04:00:52,000 --> 04:00:55,000
*I could feel the softness and affection...*

3581
04:00:55,000 --> 04:01:00,000
*... of my small little sister passing through the palm of my hand as warmth.*

3582
04:01:00,000 --> 04:01:04,000
Chocola: Master~! Preparations for work are all done!

3583
04:01:04,000 --> 04:01:08,000
Vanilla: Combat preparations complete. Not a single cow lick.

3584
04:01:08,000 --> 04:01:10,000
Kashou: Oh, roger that.

3585
04:01:10,000 --> 04:01:16,000
Kashou: Sorry, Shigure. I need to do a little bit of preparation to open the store.

3586
04:01:16,000 --> 04:01:20,000
Shigure: No, no. I was the one who pressed upon you this early.

3587
04:01:20,000 --> 04:01:24,000
Shigure: Today is a new day. Please do your best, Nii-sama.

3588
04:01:24,000 --> 04:01:27,000
Kashou: Yep. You can just take it easy.

3589
04:01:27,000 --> 04:01:31,000
Chocola: Chocola is going, too! See you later, Shigure-chan!

3590
04:01:31,000 --> 04:01:35,000
Vanilla: I shall also be off to work. See you again, Shigure.

3591
04:01:35,000 --> 04:01:38,000
Shigure: Okay~ Have a good day at work!

3592
04:01:38,000 --> 04:01:42,000
Shigure: ... Mhmn. I guess this settles a lot of stuff.

3593
04:01:42,000 --> 04:01:46,000
*After being sure everyone had gone down to the bakery to work...*

3594
04:01:46,000 --> 04:01:50,000
*... Shigure sat on the living room sofa and muttered to herself.*

3595
04:01:50,000 --> 04:01:56,000
Shigure: It's still hard to believe that Chocola and Vanilla are Nii-sama's catpanions now...

3596
04:01:56,000 --> 04:02:02,000
Shigure: ... It's almost like another girl has stolen away my crush from me. Teehee.

3597
04:02:02,000 --> 04:02:06,000
*Those catgirls who were once just little babies, are already...*

3598
04:02:06,000 --> 04:02:09,000
*Knowing that she had done it to herself...*

3599
04:02:09,000 --> 04:02:12,000
*... she couldn't help but let out an ironic laugh.*

3600
04:02:12,000 --> 04:02:17,000
Shigure: ... Well, I might as well give up on a dream that won't come to pass.

3601
04:02:17,000 --> 04:02:22,000
Shigure: Maybe it's time I thought about letting my older brother go.

3602
04:02:22,000 --> 04:02:26,000
*As if to ask her yearning heart for the impossible...*

3603
04:02:26,000 --> 04:02:30,000
*As if to confess to the person she loved, who was just nearby...*

3604
04:02:30,000 --> 04:02:32,000
*She whispered it out once more:*

3605
04:02:32,000 --> 04:02:34,000
*At least, instead of me...*

3606
04:02:34,000 --> 04:02:39,000
*I can entrust my feelings to those catgirls instead of a girl I don't know.*

3607
04:02:39,000 --> 04:02:43,000
*I'm okay with always staying by his side as his little sister.*

3608
04:02:43,000 --> 04:02:47,000
*Breathing deeply to calm her prickling, pained heart...*

3609
04:02:47,000 --> 04:02:51,000
*... she closed her eyes and leaned back on the sofa.*

3610
04:02:51,000 --> 04:02:52,000
Shigure: ... Okay.

3611
04:02:52,000 --> 04:02:58,000
Shigure: Now then, I guess I should start with tidying up Nii-sama's dirty clothes.

3612
04:02:58,000 --> 04:03:00,000
*She leapt up off the sofa...*

3613
04:03:00,000 --> 04:03:05,000
*... giving both her cheeks a quick slap, and looked out the window.*

3614
04:03:05,000 --> 04:03:09,000
Chocola: Meow~ So high up! We're so high up, Master~! Myahahaha~!

3615
04:03:09,000 --> 04:03:14,000
Vanilla: People really do look like ants from up high. Isn't that right, Master?

3616
04:03:14,000 --> 04:03:16,000
Kashou: ...Y-Yeah... I guess...

3617
04:03:16,000 --> 04:03:19,000
Chocola: What's the matter? You look a little pale.

3618
04:03:19,000 --> 04:03:22,000
Vanilla: Your face is as white as a ghost.

3619
04:03:22,000 --> 04:03:25,000
Kashou: Re-Really...? I guess it must be...

3620
04:03:25,000 --> 04:03:31,000
Chocola: Huhhh? You'd normally give a comeback like, "ghosts don't exist" or something.

3621
04:03:31,000 --> 04:03:35,000
Vanilla: Master is being a killjoy right now. Cold, in a word.

3622
04:03:35,000 --> 04:03:38,000
Kashou: No, it's not that I'm being cold, okay...?

3623
04:03:38,000 --> 04:03:44,000
*We were near the peak of Hyakkeijima Sea Paradise's main attraction, Blue Falling.*

3624
04:03:44,000 --> 04:03:47,000
*All around us was sky, sky, and more sky.*

3625
04:03:47,000 --> 04:03:51,000
*The safety and security of Earth was far, far away.*

3626
04:03:51,000 --> 04:03:59,000
*"Dare to experience the nations' highest free fall at 107 meters," they say, and when they do, they're not kidding.*

3627
04:03:59,000 --> 04:04:03,000
*Forced to get on the ride because of their whining...*

3628
04:04:03,000 --> 04:04:07,000
*... I was now facing the most extreme threat to my life ever.*

3629
04:04:07,000 --> 04:04:10,000
Kashou: Actually... how can you two be so calm...?

3630
04:04:10,000 --> 04:04:15,000
Chocola: Huh? Why is being high up so hard for you? Doesn't it feel nice~? ♪

3631
04:04:15,000 --> 04:04:20,000
Vanilla: Catgirls get proportionally more excited the higher they climb.

3632
04:04:20,000 --> 04:04:24,000
Vanilla: Our excitement is currently 107 meters above sea level.

3633
04:04:24,000 --> 04:04:28,000
Kashou: Isn't that just because you guys like high places...?

3634
04:04:28,000 --> 04:04:33,000
*I wasn't even able to say "only fools and smoke like high places."*

3635
04:04:33,000 --> 04:04:38,000
*I could only quiver as I was overtaken by more fear the higher we climbed.*

3636
04:04:38,000 --> 04:04:43,000
*Then, that merciless sound coming from the motor that seemed to go on forever...*

3637
04:04:43,000 --> 04:04:45,000
*... suddenly stopped.*

3638
04:04:45,000 --> 04:04:47,000
Announcer: ... 3, 2, 1!

3639
04:04:47,000 --> 04:04:48,000
Announcer: Bye bye~ ♪

3640
04:04:48,000 --> 04:04:50,000
Kashou: Gwaaaaaaaaaaaah!!!

3641
04:04:50,000 --> 04:04:53,000
Chocola & Vanilla: Nyaaaaaaaaaaaaah~! ♪♪♪

3642
04:04:53,000 --> 04:04:56,000
Kashou: Mghrwaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaah!!!

3643
04:04:56,000 --> 04:04:59,000
Chocola & Vanilla: Nyaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaah~! ♪♪♪

3644
04:04:59,000 --> 04:05:02,000
Kashou: Mghrwaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaah!!!

3645
04:05:02,000 --> 04:05:07,000
Chocola: Nyahahahahahaha, look at Master's face, nyahahahahahaha~! ♪♪♪

3646
04:05:07,000 --> 04:05:13,000
Vanilla: Master is hollering so much, tears are coming out, nyahahahahahahahaaaaaaa~! ♪♪♪

3647
04:05:13,000 --> 04:05:16,000
Chocola: Yode-lay-hee-hoo! Nyahahaha~ ♪

3648
04:05:16,000 --> 04:05:20,000
Chocola: It's sparkling! So sparkling and fun! Nyahahaha~ ♪

3649
04:05:20,000 --> 04:05:24,000
Vanilla: Yode-lay-hee-hoo. Meh, it's not that fun actually.

3650
04:05:24,000 --> 04:05:28,000
Vanilla: I might get addicted to these simple up-and-down rides~ ♪

3651
04:05:28,000 --> 04:05:30,000
Chocola: What's wrong, Master?

3652
04:05:30,000 --> 04:05:33,000
Vanilla: You're not afraid of this speed, are you?

3653
04:05:33,000 --> 04:05:38,000
Kashou: No, it's just... it's a bit embarrassing... being this old and this...

3654
04:05:38,000 --> 04:05:40,000
Chocola: Higyaaaaaah, Master!!

3655
04:05:40,000 --> 04:05:46,000
Chocola: I-I-I-I-I-I-It's going to kill Chocola! Chocola's gonna die! Chocola's gonnasdfhlkjahf!!

3656
04:05:46,000 --> 04:05:50,000
Kashou: It's just a ride! Calm down! It won't kill you!

3657
04:05:50,000 --> 04:05:54,000
Vanilla: When catgirls are extremely startled, they stop moving...

3658
04:05:54,000 --> 04:05:59,000
Vanilla: Also, they might lose more than just their pride as a catgirl...!

3659
04:05:59,000 --> 04:06:04,000
Kashou: Hold on! There's an emergency exit over there! Hold on until then!!

3660
04:06:04,000 --> 04:06:08,000
Vanilla: Tell Shigure... I went out like a true catgirl...! Urk!!

3661
04:06:08,000 --> 04:06:13,000
Kashou: What was that "urk" just now!? Don't give up!! Hey, Vanilla!!

3662
04:06:13,000 --> 04:06:18,000
Chocola: Myah! Myah! Master! That there! Let's ride that spinning one there next!!

3663
04:06:18,000 --> 04:06:23,000
Vanilla: Myaoh, myaoh. Enough of those fast ones. Let's do the dropping one again.

3664
04:06:23,000 --> 04:06:26,000
Kashou: Wait... Let me rest, really... seriously...

3665
04:06:26,000 --> 04:06:29,000
*Light-headed, I sat on the bench feeling groggy.*

3666
04:06:29,000 --> 04:06:33,000
*To think amusement parks could pack this much punch...*

3667
04:06:33,000 --> 04:06:38,000
Chocola: We're finally on a date, but you're really kind of a let-down, Master.

3668
04:06:38,000 --> 04:06:44,000
Vanilla: That's right, that's right. After we closed up the shop just to come and play too.

3669
04:06:44,000 --> 04:06:47,000
Kashou: I know, I get it. Just give me a second.

3670
04:06:47,000 --> 04:06:51,000
Chocola: Sheesh. Chocola guesses it just can't be helped, meow.

3671
04:06:51,000 --> 04:06:56,000
Chocola: Chocola is an understanding catpanion, so she'll forgive you~ ♪

3672
04:06:56,000 --> 04:07:02,000
Vanilla: I wouldn't mind going with just Chocola, but I shall wait for you, Master.

3673
04:07:02,000 --> 04:07:05,000
Chocola: Aww, Vanilla isn't being honest~

3674
04:07:05,000 --> 04:07:12,000
Chocola: Even after we were both trying our hardest to get all prettied up this morning together! Poke poke~ ♪

3675
04:07:12,000 --> 04:07:18,000
Vanilla: False. I was struggling a little since it was the first time wearing these new clothes.

3676
04:07:18,000 --> 04:07:22,000
*Vanilla wasn't pleased with having her cheek poked.*

3677
04:07:22,000 --> 04:07:25,000
*Well, that's just what she's saying.*

3678
04:07:25,000 --> 04:07:29,000
*Her tail was sticking straight up all the time at home though.*

3679
04:07:29,000 --> 04:07:39,000
*According to what Chocola said, she had to be really careful not to do that while we're out today. Otherwise, her tail would lift up the back of her skirt.*

3680
04:07:39,000 --> 04:07:44,000
*That's not the sort of thing we humans would ever have to worry about, though.*

3681
04:07:44,000 --> 04:07:47,000
Kashou: Those clothes look good on both of you.

3682
04:07:47,000 --> 04:07:50,000
Chocola: Yaaay, do they really? Hurray~ ♪

3683
04:07:50,000 --> 04:07:57,000
Chocola: Shigure gave us these as gifts when we said that Master was going to take us to the amusement park!

3684
04:07:57,000 --> 04:08:02,000
Vanilla: I really like these. So being praised makes me just a little bit happy.

3685
04:08:02,000 --> 04:08:05,000
*She spun around and showed me her back.*

3686
04:08:05,000 --> 04:08:08,000
*The white clothes sparkled in the sunshine.*

3687
04:08:08,000 --> 04:08:13,000
*It was very cute and seeing them all dressed up made the day even more special.*

3688
04:08:13,000 --> 04:08:17,000
*... Not that Vanilla would ever admit she felt that way.*

3689
04:08:17,000 --> 04:08:19,000
Kashou: Yeah, they look good.

3690
04:08:19,000 --> 04:08:21,000
*I said it one more time.*

3691
04:08:21,000 --> 04:08:26,000
Chocola: Meow~ Chocola is so happy Master said she looked cute too, meow~ ♪

3692
04:08:26,000 --> 04:08:31,000
Chocola: Right, Vanilla? Vanilla is happy, too, isn't she? Eheheh~ ♪

3693
04:08:31,000 --> 04:08:34,000
Vanilla: ... I guess I am a little bit.

3694
04:08:34,000 --> 04:08:39,000
Chocola: Meow~ ♪ You're blushing~ Poke poke, I'm gonna poke your cheek~ ♪

3695
04:08:39,000 --> 04:08:42,000
*The two fluttered about as they teased each other.*

3696
04:08:42,000 --> 04:08:45,000
*Seeing how happy Chocola and Vanilla were...*

3697
04:08:45,000 --> 04:08:49,000
*... made me glad I took the day off, even if it was inconvenient.*

3698
04:08:49,000 --> 04:08:55,000
Chocola: But are you sure it's okay to close for the day, even with how busy things have been?

3699
04:08:55,000 --> 04:08:59,000
Vanilla: I do think Master looks a bit tired lately...

3700
04:08:59,000 --> 04:09:05,000
Kashou: That's right. I've been a bit tired lately, so we've come here for a bit of fun.

3701
04:09:05,000 --> 04:09:08,000
Kashou: You guys don't need to worry about anything.

3702
04:09:08,000 --> 04:09:11,000
Kashou: Just go be catgirls and enjoy yourselves.

3703
04:09:11,000 --> 04:09:16,000
*The two of them looked into my eyes worriedly, so I messed with their hair.*

3704
04:09:16,000 --> 04:09:21,000
Chocola: Meow! Master, Chocola told you not to make her hair all messy!

3705
04:09:21,000 --> 04:09:26,000
Vanilla: Meow...! After I used hair spray and everything! It's all ruined...!

3706
04:09:26,000 --> 04:09:31,000
Girl: Wow, Mommy, look! Hyakkeijima has its own kitty-catgirls! Cute!!

3707
04:09:31,000 --> 04:09:34,000
Girl: Hey hey, Onii-san! Can I take a picture?

3708
04:09:34,000 --> 04:09:38,000
Kashou: Oh, no, these aren't Hyakkeijima's catgirls...

3709
04:09:38,000 --> 04:09:42,000
Mother: I'm so sorry, that was very rude of my daughter...!

3710
04:09:42,000 --> 04:09:47,000
Mother: Hey, listen! Those aren't the amusement park's catgirls, okay?

3711
04:09:47,000 --> 04:09:53,000
Chocola: It's fine! Let's take a picture~ ♪ We don't mind~ Let's take one together!

3712
04:09:53,000 --> 04:09:58,000
Vanilla: Ah, but Master messed my hair all up, so give me a moment to freshen up.

3713
04:09:58,000 --> 04:10:00,000
Mother: Are you sure? But...

3714
04:10:00,000 --> 04:10:03,000
*The hesitant mother looked over towards me.*

3715
04:10:03,000 --> 04:10:07,000
Kashou: I don't mind at all. They say they want to, too.

3716
04:10:07,000 --> 04:10:12,000
Chocola: She said we were cute, so we can at least let her take a picture with us!

3717
04:10:12,000 --> 04:10:18,000
Vanilla: Ah, we should take one for Shigure as a memento. Master, take one with your cell phone.

3718
04:10:18,000 --> 04:10:20,000
Kashou: ... So that's how it is.

3719
04:10:20,000 --> 04:10:23,000
Kashou: Could I have you take a picture for us, too?

3720
04:10:23,000 --> 04:10:27,000
Mother: Okay, then I might as well take you up on your offer then.

3721
04:10:27,000 --> 04:10:30,000
Girl: Yaay! Thank you, kitty-catgirls!

3722
04:10:30,000 --> 04:10:35,000
Girl: Hey, Mom, lend me your phone! I'm going to get a bunch of pictures!

3723
04:10:35,000 --> 04:10:41,000
Chocola: Come on, if you don't come closer you won't be in the shot. Closer, closer~ ♪

3724
04:10:41,000 --> 04:10:46,000
Vanilla: I'll throw in a hug too. Catgirls are stronger than they appear.

3725
04:10:46,000 --> 04:10:51,000
Chocola: Oh, nice~ Nice~! Chocola will take a bunch! Okay, say cheese!

3726
04:10:51,000 --> 04:10:56,000
Vanilla: I'll take some next, okay? Rapid-fire super paparazzi burst!

3727
04:10:56,000 --> 04:10:58,000
Kashou: ... What an unexpected scene.

3728
04:10:58,000 --> 04:11:02,000
*For me, Chocola and Vanilla were still like children...*

3729
04:11:02,000 --> 04:11:08,000
*... but I suppose even catgirls might have maternal instincts like human women do.*

3730
04:11:08,000 --> 04:11:11,000
*It was adorable seeing them playing with a child.*

3731
04:11:11,000 --> 04:11:14,000
*They're acting more big sister-like than usual.*

3732
04:11:14,000 --> 04:11:18,000
Vanilla: Take a good one, Master. So we can remember today.

3733
04:11:18,000 --> 04:11:22,000
Chocola: That's right. Today's a day you need to commemorate~ ♪

3734
04:11:22,000 --> 04:11:24,000
Kashou: Yeah, yeah, Say cheese.

3735
04:11:24,000 --> 04:11:26,000
Chocola: Ah! You're being lazy!

3736
04:11:26,000 --> 04:11:30,000
Chocola: You need to put more love into taking the pictures!

3737
04:11:30,000 --> 04:11:34,000
Vanilla: Such haphazardness isn't good. Super not good.

3738
04:11:34,000 --> 04:11:41,000
Vanilla: It's said that you can't take a good picture unless you think of how your subject is feeling.

3739
04:11:41,000 --> 04:11:44,000
Kashou: I'm taking more... Smile, smile!

3740
04:11:44,000 --> 04:11:49,000
Chocola: Aww! Master! With more love! Chocola wants you to put more love into it!!

3741
04:11:49,000 --> 04:11:55,000
Vanilla: Master doesn't understand's a woman's feelings. We are terribly disappointed.

3742
04:11:55,000 --> 04:12:00,000
*Their pouty faces were so cute that I kept provoking them intentionally.*

3743
04:12:00,000 --> 04:12:03,000
*... How wonderfully sweet this moment was.*

3744
04:12:03,000 --> 04:12:07,000
*I must be in pretty good spirits myself if I was thinking that.*

3745
04:12:07,000 --> 04:12:11,000
Girl: Ahaha, the kitty-catgirls' pouty faces are so cute~ ♪

3746
04:12:11,000 --> 04:12:15,000
Chocola: Myaown?! Don't take pictures of us like this!

3747
04:12:15,000 --> 04:12:20,000
Vanilla: How careless of me...! Infringement of catgirl personal rights, meow...!

3748
04:12:20,000 --> 04:12:23,000
Girl: You two are cute, so don't worry!

3749
04:12:23,000 --> 04:12:25,000
Girl: Come on, say cheese~ ♪

3750
04:12:25,000 --> 04:12:27,000
Chocola: Chocola said not now!

3751
04:12:27,000 --> 04:12:30,000
Vanilla: Catgirl smile super attack! Nipah~

3752
04:12:30,000 --> 04:12:33,000
Girl: Squee, too cute~ ♪ Look over here~! ♪

3753
04:12:33,000 --> 04:12:36,000
Mother: I'm so sorry that we interrupted your date.

3754
04:12:36,000 --> 04:12:39,000
Mother: Thank you very much. Have a good day.

3755
04:12:39,000 --> 04:12:42,000
Girl: See you later, kitty-catgirls! Thank you!

3756
04:12:42,000 --> 04:12:44,000
Chocola: Myahn, that was fun~ ♪

3757
04:12:44,000 --> 04:12:48,000
Vanilla: There was some bullying, but it all ended well.

3758
04:12:48,000 --> 04:12:50,000
Chocola: Little kids sure are cute.

3759
04:12:50,000 --> 04:12:54,000
Vanilla: Not even catgirls can withstand the innocence of children.

3760
04:12:54,000 --> 04:12:57,000
Kashou: ... So this does look like a date after all.

3761
04:12:57,000 --> 04:13:01,000
*I thought about that again as I texted the photo to Shigure.*

3762
04:13:01,000 --> 04:13:05,000
*Of course, there was no doubt that this was a date.*

3763
04:13:05,000 --> 04:13:09,000
*No, if I say it like that it sounds kind of negative.*

3764
04:13:09,000 --> 04:13:12,000
*Yeah, if I were to say it flat out...*

3765
04:13:12,000 --> 04:13:17,000
*... thinking about how others might view this makes me feel a bit bashful.*

3766
04:13:17,000 --> 04:13:23,000
*I'm well aware that it's a bit weird for me to be thinking about how wonderful things are.*

3767
04:13:23,000 --> 04:13:25,000
Chocola: Myaoh, meow~ ♪ Master~ ♪

3768
04:13:25,000 --> 04:13:32,000
Chocola: Don't just stand there with that big grin on your face! Let's go on another one! Another one!

3769
04:13:32,000 --> 04:13:34,000
Kashou: Huh? Am I grinning...?

3770
04:13:34,000 --> 04:13:37,000
Vanilla: Ultra grinning. Like Donald O'Ronald.

3771
04:13:37,000 --> 04:13:40,000
Vanilla: It even looks a bit lewd, too.

3772
04:13:40,000 --> 04:13:43,000
Kashou: Lewd? It's not like that at all...!

3773
04:13:43,000 --> 04:13:46,000
Chocola: Ahaha, you don't need to blush like that~ ♪

3774
04:13:46,000 --> 04:13:49,000
Vanilla: We already know that Master is a pervert.

3775
04:13:49,000 --> 04:13:53,000
Kashou: ... You two are plenty perverted yourselves, you know.

3776
04:13:53,000 --> 04:13:57,000
Chocola: That's right, we can't argue with that, myaoh~ ♪

3777
04:13:57,000 --> 04:14:01,000
Vanilla: Can't help it. They do say pets resemble their owners.

3778
04:14:01,000 --> 04:14:06,000
*With full smiles, the two of them wrapped themselves around my arms.*

3779
04:14:06,000 --> 04:14:09,000
*... I couldn't escape it even if I had tried.*

3780
04:14:09,000 --> 04:14:12,000
*So catgirls change as they grow up, too...*

3781
04:14:12,000 --> 04:14:16,000
*I tried to hide the face I was making as I thought that.*

3782
04:14:16,000 --> 04:14:20,000
*But if I stopped thinking about it, it'd come back again.*

3783
04:14:20,000 --> 04:14:23,000
Chocola: It's just fine if we're similar~ ♪

3784
04:14:23,000 --> 04:14:27,000
Chocola: How about doing something a bit more relaxing now?

3785
04:14:27,000 --> 04:14:31,000
Vanilla: It's just past noon. Still quite a bit of time.

3786
04:14:31,000 --> 04:14:35,000
Vanilla: You don't get to make excuses about being tired today.

3787
04:14:35,000 --> 04:14:38,000
Kashou: Then you guys don't get to, either.

3788
04:14:38,000 --> 04:14:42,000
Kashou: I set aside this day just for you guys, after all.

3789
04:14:42,000 --> 04:14:45,000
Chocola: Meow~ ♪ Master's so confident~ ♪

3790
04:14:45,000 --> 04:14:49,000
Vanilla: Teehee, Master is so aggressive, meow. Let's be off~ ♪

3791
04:14:49,000 --> 04:14:52,000
*... My spirits were just as high as theirs.*

3792
04:14:52,000 --> 04:14:55,000
*With each one wrapped around an arm...*

3793
04:14:55,000 --> 04:14:59,000
*... the three of us headed deeper into the amusement park.*

3794
04:14:59,000 --> 04:15:03,000
Chocola: Wow, it's so big...! The fish tank! It's seriously big!

3795
04:15:03,000 --> 04:15:09,000
Vanilla: Amazing...! An undersea tunnel...! There are fish swimming above my head...!

3796
04:15:09,000 --> 04:15:12,000
Chocola: Ah, over there! Look over there, Vanilla!

3797
04:15:12,000 --> 04:15:16,000
Chocola: A white dolphin! There's a white dolphin there!

3798
04:15:16,000 --> 04:15:21,000
Vanilla: Ooh... it's white! Almost like it's color has burnt down to white ash!

3799
04:15:21,000 --> 04:15:25,000
Vanilla: It's the same as my hair clip! Super cute...!

3800
04:15:25,000 --> 04:15:30,000
Chocola: It really looks just like a stuffed animal! Chocola is impressed!

3801
04:15:30,000 --> 04:15:35,000
Kashou: Hey. If you two don't watch where you're going, you'll trip--

3802
04:15:35,000 --> 04:15:38,000
Chocola: There's a shark! There's a whale shark!

3803
04:15:38,000 --> 04:15:42,000
Chocola: It's really big! It's going after a bunch of fish!

3804
04:15:42,000 --> 04:15:48,000
Vanilla: That whale shark is super huge...! I've never seen such a huge creature before...!

3805
04:15:48,000 --> 04:15:52,000
Vanilla: The ones stuck underneath him must be his buddies...!

3806
04:15:52,000 --> 04:15:57,000
Vanilla: But the stuffed animal Master bought for me doesn't have any buddies...

3807
04:15:57,000 --> 04:16:03,000
*My warnings went completely ignored as their gleaming eyes looked around the aquarium.*

3808
04:16:03,000 --> 04:16:07,000
*Shining rays of sun beamed down from directly overhead...*

3809
04:16:07,000 --> 04:16:12,000
*... making a mystical sheen spread throughout the surrounding scenery.*

3810
04:16:12,000 --> 04:16:15,000
*It was promoted as "a walk in the sea..."*

3811
04:16:15,000 --> 04:16:22,000
*... and that's what it really was. It really was like we were walking right through the middle of the sea.*

3812
04:16:22,000 --> 04:16:25,000
Chocola: Master! That fish! What's it called!?

3813
04:16:25,000 --> 04:16:30,000
Kashou: Let's see... The information sign says it's a Green Chromis.

3814
04:16:30,000 --> 04:16:34,000
Chocola: A Green Chromis! It's a Green Chromis, Vanilla!

3815
04:16:34,000 --> 04:16:38,000
Vanilla: A Green Chromis. It has been memorized. Perfect.

3816
04:16:38,000 --> 04:16:41,000
*You don't really need to remember that...*

3817
04:16:41,000 --> 04:16:46,000
*... I thought, smiling as I watched over the two overjoyed catgirls.*

3818
04:16:46,000 --> 04:16:53,000
Chocola: It's the first time Chocola has been to both an amusement park and an aquarium! It's so fun!

3819
04:16:53,000 --> 04:16:56,000
Chocola: Really really really fun, Master!

3820
04:16:56,000 --> 04:17:03,000
Vanilla: I'm also having lots of fun. It may not look it, but catgirls have a very high friskiness level.

3821
04:17:03,000 --> 04:17:08,000
Vanilla: Master's worth has been skyrocketing all morning. I'm super impressed.

3822
04:17:08,000 --> 04:17:14,000
Kashou: Yeah. It's because you two worked hard and got your Bells. What good girls.

3823
04:17:14,000 --> 04:17:18,000
Chocola: Yes! Chocola is glad she worked so hard back then!

3824
04:17:18,000 --> 04:17:24,000
Vanilla: Now we can help in the store and go out and play, too. Bells are great. Super great.

3825
04:17:24,000 --> 04:17:28,000
*The gold and silver Bells jingled almost as if in response.*

3826
04:17:28,000 --> 04:17:30,000
*Who knew they'd be this happy?*

3827
04:17:30,000 --> 04:17:33,000
*I should have taken them here sooner.*

3828
04:17:33,000 --> 04:17:38,000
*With how busy the store was, this really wasn't the best timing...*

3829
04:17:38,000 --> 04:17:41,000
*... but I didn't have many other choices...*

3830
04:17:41,000 --> 04:17:44,000
Chocola: Wow, look look, Master! Vanilla!

3831
04:17:44,000 --> 04:17:49,000
Chocola: Tuna! There's tuna! A whole bunch of them swimming this way!

3832
04:17:49,000 --> 04:17:52,000
Vanilla: Huge...! So profound! Such speed...!!

3833
04:17:52,000 --> 04:17:54,000
Kashou: Yeah, it's quite a view.

3834
04:17:54,000 --> 04:17:59,000
*I need to work hard for Chocola and Vanilla's sake from now on too though.*

3835
04:17:59,000 --> 04:18:02,000
*No... Rather, I WANT to work hard for them.*

3836
04:18:02,000 --> 04:18:04,000
*I honestly felt that.*

3837
04:18:04,000 --> 04:18:08,000
Chocola: They're so energetic and fresh and delicious... Drool~ ♪

3838
04:18:08,000 --> 04:18:13,000
Vanilla: So much fatty tuna. Salivating... I'm salivating... Drool~ ♪

3839
04:18:13,000 --> 04:18:17,000
Kashou: Don't blurt out cat-like things like that, okay?

3840
04:18:17,000 --> 04:18:19,000
*... They are still cats after all.*

3841
04:18:19,000 --> 04:18:23,000
*I wiped their mouths with a tissue as I thought that.*

3842
04:18:23,000 --> 04:18:26,000
Chocola: Meow, Chocola had fun, myaow~ ♪

3843
04:18:26,000 --> 04:18:30,000
Chocola: Going around like that felt like a date, too. It was nice.

3844
04:18:30,000 --> 04:18:35,000
Vanilla: The aquarium was super great... Makes me want to go away to the ocean...

3845
04:18:35,000 --> 04:18:42,000
Kashou: I'll bring you here again soon. That way, you don't think of doing anything dangerous, either.

3846
04:18:42,000 --> 04:18:46,000
*I gave Vanilla a light bop on her daydreaming cheeks.*

3847
04:18:46,000 --> 04:18:49,000
*... You're not serious about that, right? Right?*

3848
04:18:49,000 --> 04:18:52,000
Chocola: Master. Can I go to the bathroom for a bit?

3849
04:18:52,000 --> 04:18:54,000
Vanilla: Ah, I'll come, too.

3850
04:18:54,000 --> 04:18:56,000
Kashou: Okay. I'll wait here, then.

3851
04:18:56,000 --> 04:18:58,000
Chocola: Okayyy, please do~ ♪

3852
04:18:58,000 --> 04:19:00,000
Vanilla: Thanks, Master.

3853
04:19:00,000 --> 04:19:01,000
Kashou: Yeah. No rush.

3854
04:19:01,000 --> 04:19:04,000
*I took their things and watched them head off.*

3855
04:19:04,000 --> 04:19:11,000
Kashou: ... The restroom looked pretty busy just now. I wonder if they're waiting on a bench somewhere.

3856
04:19:11,000 --> 04:19:14,000
*I looked around, searching the benches.*

3857
04:19:14,000 --> 04:19:16,000
Staff: Do you like stuffed animals?

3858
04:19:16,000 --> 04:19:22,000
*She was holding some balloons decorated with drawings of Hyakkeijima in her hand.*

3859
04:19:22,000 --> 04:19:26,000
*She had Hyakkeijima's logo printed on her uniform shirt.*

3860
04:19:26,000 --> 04:19:33,000
Staff: Your arms. You're carrying a white dolphin and whale shark in your hands, so I thought you might.

3861
04:19:33,000 --> 04:19:38,000
*She pointed at the stuffed animals I was holding onto for Vanilla and Chocola.*

3862
04:19:38,000 --> 04:19:42,000
Kashou: Oh, these aren't mine. They belong to my catgirls.

3863
04:19:42,000 --> 04:19:44,000
Staff: Oh, sorry. I just assumed.

3864
04:19:44,000 --> 04:19:47,000
Staff: So, your catgirls like stuffed animals?

3865
04:19:47,000 --> 04:19:50,000
Staff: I'm sorry for mistaking that earlier. Ahaha.

3866
04:19:50,000 --> 04:19:54,000
*With an inviting smile much suiting an amusement park staffer...*

3867
04:19:54,000 --> 04:19:56,000
*... she bowed her head slightly.*

3868
04:19:56,000 --> 04:20:00,000
Staff: They sure are cute catgirls. Are they your catpanions?

